{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_42","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"D='Wii Fit Together-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-222701'; rg -n 'mod starter|GAMES|entry::|impl Game for|set_game|state.play|fn build|InputFrame' \\\"\"'$D/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/\"{mod.rs,starter.rs}; sed -n '\"'1,180p' \\\"\"'$D/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/starter.toml\"; sed -n '\"'1,130p' \\\"\"'$D/engine/crates/pav_core/src/input.rs\"; cat \"$D/engine/scripts/pack_single_html.py\" | head -100'","aggregated_output":"Wii Fit Together-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-222701/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/starter.rs:5://! `<key>.toml`, change `KEY`, add its line to `GAMES` in `mod.rs`, then change the rules.\nWii Fit Together-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-222701/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/starter.rs:20:use crate::input::InputFrame;\nWii Fit Together-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-222701/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/starter.rs:76:pub fn build(sim: &mut Sim, _rest: Option<&str>) -> Result<()> {\nWii Fit Together-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-222701/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/starter.rs:105:    sim.state.play = Some(GameBox::new(game));\nWii Fit Together-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-222701/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/starter.rs:109:impl Game for Starter {\nWii Fit Together-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-222701/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/starter.rs:115:        _input: &InputFrame,\nWii Fit Together-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-222701/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/starter.rs:118:    ) -> BTreeMap<EntityId, InputFrame> {\nWii Fit Together-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-222701/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/starter.rs:122:            for &id in sim.state.player.iter().chain(&self.slimes) {\nWii Fit Together-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-222701/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/starter.rs:123:                out.insert(id, InputFrame::default());\nWii Fit Together-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1