{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_53","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"cat 'Wii Fit Together-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-222701/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/starter.toml'; rg -n 'struct InputFrame|pub fn players|fn pre\\\\(' 'Wii Fit Together-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-222701/engine/crates/pav_core/src/input.rs' 'Wii Fit Together-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-222701/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/starter.rs'; rg -n 'fn (pre|hud|status|bot)|move_dir' 'Wii Fit Together-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-222701/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/starter.rs'; ls 'Wii Fit Together-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-222701'\"","aggregated_output":"# The starter game's level: a room file (every field: rooms/_template.toml). Column = x (east),\n# row = z (south), 1 cell = 1 m. `o` cells are shards and `P` is the start (legend markers,\n# read by starter.rs with `scenes::markers`); the slimes are [[npc]] entries the game drives.\n# Check it with `pav room_check path=crates/pav_core/src/games/starter.toml`.\n\nname = \"Starter\"\nabout = \"Collect every shard while slimes chase you.\"\nentrance = { at = [8, 12], facing = \"south\" }   # required by the format; the `P` marker is the start\n\n# The rules' numbers (starter.rs `Rules`). Running from the repository, `pav` reads this file at\n# each `load`: edit, then `load scene=starter` or `play bot=true seeds=10`, no rebuild.\n[game]\nlives = 3\nslime_speed = 0.5\nslime_sight = 9.0\ncatch = 0.8\npick = 0.9\ngrace = 2.0\n\n[camera]\ntilt = 58.0\ndistance = 17.0\n\n[layout]\norigin = [-9.0, 0.0, -6.5]\n\n[[layout.layer]]\ny = 0\nmap = '''\n##################\n#o......#.......o#\n#.......#........#\n#..##.......##...#\n#..#.........#...#\n#.......o........#\n#....#.....#.....#\n#.......P........#\n#..#.........#...#\n#..##.......##...#\n#.......#........#\n#o......#.......o#\n##################\n'''\n\n[layout.legend.'.']\nblocks = [{ y0 = -0.5, y1 = 0, color = \"#3b4a5c\" }]\n\n[layout.legend.'#']\nblocks = [{ y0 = -0.5, y1 = 0, color = \"#3b4a5c\" }, { y0 = 0, y1 = 1.2, color = \"#8a6f9e\", rounded = true }]\n\n[layout.legend.'o']\nblocks = [{ y0 = -0.5, y1 = 0, color = \"#3b4a5c\" }]\nmarker = \"shard\"\n\n[layout.legend.'P']\nblocks = [{ y0 = -0.5, y1 = 0, color = \"#3b4a5c\" }]\nmarker = \"player\"\n\n[[npc]]\nname = \"slime\"\nkind = \"blob\"\npos = [12.5, 0, 2.5]\nlook = { skin = \"#6cd66c\" }\n\n[[npc]]\nname = \"slime\"\nkind = \"blob\"\npos = [5.5, 0, 10.5]\nlook = { skin = \"#6cd66c\" }\n\n[[npc]]\nname = \"slime\"\nkind = \"blob\"\npos = [15.5, 0, 7.5]\nlook = { skin = \"#6cd66c\" }\nWii Fit Together-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-222701/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/starter.rs:112:    fn pre(\nWii Fit Together-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-222701/engine/crates/pav_core/src/input.rs:49:pub struct InputFrame {\n112:    fn pre(\n139:                input.move_dir = Vec2::new(d.x, d.z) * speed;\n196:    fn hud(&self, _sim: &Sim) -> Vec<String> {\n207:    fn status(&self, sim: &Sim) -> serde_json::Value {\n228:    fn bot(&self, sim: &Sim) -> InputFrame {\n249:        input.move_dir = path.map(|path| flat_dir(path[0] - p)).unwrap_or_default();\nengine\nhub\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
