 a touch-test selector is being corrected.\n+- AI Hub conformance exposed missing in-round progress reports; the implementation now reports at round start and every two seconds. Re-test Hub, run Rust tests, and complete the exit interview.\n*** End Patch\nPATCH\npython3 'Wii Fit Together-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-222701/scripts/bundle.py'\nnode --check 'Wii Fit Together-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-222701/web/game.js'\n./'Wii Fit Together-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-222701'/tests/run.sh all\"","aggregated_output":"Success. Updated the following files:\nM Wii Fit Together-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-222701/web/game.js\nM Wii Fit Together-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-222701/web/game.css\nM Wii Fit Together-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-222701/tests/test_game.py\nM PROGRESS.md\n10/10 checks passed\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
