{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_237","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"printf '%s\\\\n' '--- progress ---'; cat PROGRESS.md; printf '%s\\\\n' '--- about/save/banking hooks ---'; rg -n -C 2 'about-data|aboutData|minutes|dayClears|finishRound|lastVisit|lastSeen|localStorage|renderAbout|about' 'Wii Fit Together-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-222701/web/game.js'; printf '%s\\\\n' '--- interview ---'; cat exit-interview.json; printf '%s\\\\n' '--- engine revision ---'; git -C 'Wii Fit Together-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-222701/engine' rev-parse --short HEAD\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_237","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"printf '%s\\\\n' '--- progress ---'; cat PROGRESS.md; printf '%s\\\\n' '--- about/save/banking hooks ---'; rg -n -C 2 'about-data|aboutData|minutes|dayClears|finishRound|lastVisit|lastSeen|localStorage|renderAbout|about' 'Wii Fit Together-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-222701/web/game.js'; printf '%s\\\\n' '--- interview ---'; cat exit-interview.json; printf '%s\\\\n' '--- engine revision ---'; git -C 'Wii Fit Together-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-222701/engine' rev-parse --short HEAD\"","aggregated_output":"--- progress ---\n# Progress\n\n- Title: **Wii Fit Together**, selected uniformly using Node.js `crypto.randomInt` from 50 brainstormed candidates.\n- Deliverable: `Wii Fit Together-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-222701.html` in the workspace root; source and development files in the identically named directory.\n- Engine and Hub client acquired; native engine build succeeds. Registered a Tippy Cay scene and deterministic balance spring in Shardfall.\n- The standalone build is bundled. All 24 phone, tablet, desktop and cross-browser viewport launches passed after fixing a startup injection bug.\n- Browser tests cover three engines, the five-day stay, save persistence and a two-player local medley; a touch-test selector is being corrected.\n- AI Hub conformance exposed missing in-round progress reports; the implementation now reports at round start and every two seconds. Re-test Hub, run Rust tests, and complete the exit interview.\n- Limitation: the playable presentation and most activity logic are Canvas 2D / JavaScript over a Shardfall hook, not the planned full native 3D engine implementation.\n--- about/save/banking hooks ---\n34-  let viewport = {width:0,height:0,scale:1,ox:0,oy:0};\n35-\n36:  function readStorage() { try { return JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(storage) || '{}'); } catch (_) { return {}; } }\n37:  function save() { try { saved.settings = settings; saved.slots ||= [null,null,null,null]; if (state.profile && state.slot !== null) saved.slots[state.slot] = state.profile; localStorage.setItem(storage, JSON.stringify(saved)); } catch (_) {} }\n38-  function esc(value) { return String(value).replace(/[&<>\"']/g, character => ({'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','\"':'&quot;',\"'\":'&#39;'}[character])); }\n39-  function clamp(value, min, max) { return Math.max(min, Math.min(max, value)); }\n--\n60-    if (state.screen === 'title') {\n61-      const hasSave = (saved.slots || []).some(Boolean);\n62:      html = shell(`<div class=\"title-layout\"><section class=\"title-panel\"><div class=\"overline\">A rather uplifting island escape</div><h1>Wii Fit<br><span>Together.</span></h1><p class=\"lede\">Welcome to Tippy Cay, where the sea is calm, the company is questionable, and balance is a journey.</p><div class=\"title-actions\">${button('New Stay','slots-new','primary','A five-day island adventure')}${button('Continue','slots-continue','',hasSave?'Welcome back to the island':'Choose a guest to continue')}${button('Play Together','together','coral','Local or AI Hub medley')}${button('Settings','settings','', 'Controls, sound & accessibility')}</div></section><aside class=\"hero-note\"><b>A note from Pip</b>“We believe in you.<br>Gravity has declined to comment.”</aside></div><div class=\"footer\"><span>✳ AN ORIGINAL TIPPY CAY GETAWAY</span><div><button class=\"pill\" data-action=\"about\">About this game</button> <span class=\"hint\">WASD / arrows · Space · Controller</span></div></div>`, 'THE ISLAND IS OPEN');\n63-    } else if (state.screen === 'slots') {\n64-      const slots = saved.slots || [null,null,null,null];\n65:      html = modal(state.slotMode === 'new' ? 'Choose a guest' : 'Welcome back', 'THE GUEST BOOK', `<p>Every guest gets a little corner of the island. Choose an empty book to begin.</p><div class=\"cards\">${slots.map((guest,index) => `<button class=\"card\" data-action=\"slot:${index}\"><strong>${guest ? esc(guest.name) : 'Guest '+(index+1)+' · Empty'}</strong><small>${guest ? `Day ${guest.day} · ${guest.minutesTotal || 0} minutes banked` : 'Ready for a new stay'}</small></button>`).join('')}</div><p class=\"tiny\">Your progress stays in this browser on this device.</p>`);\n66-    } else if (state.screen === 'customize') {\n67-      html = modal('Make yourself at home','YOUR ISLAND LOOK', `<p>Pick a name and an outfit. Your look is always welcome here.</p><label class=\"field\">Guest name<select id=\"guest-name\">${names.map(name=>`<option ${name === state.setup.name ? 'selected' : ''}>${name}</option>`).join('')}</select></label><div class=\"field\">Skin tone<div class=\"swatches\">${skins.map((color,index)=>`<button class=\"swatch ${index===state.setup.skin?'selected':''}\" style=\"background:${color}\" data-action=\"skin:${index}\" aria-label=\"Skin tone ${index+1}\"></button>`).join('')}</div></div><div class=\"field\">Outfit color<div class=\"swatches\">${outfits.map((color,index)=>`<button class=\"swatch ${index===state.setup.outfit?'selected':''}\" style=\"background:${color}\" data-action=\"outfit:${index}\" aria-label=\"Outfit color ${index+1}\"></button>`).join('')}</div></div><div class=\"row\">${button('Back','slots-new')}${button('Arrive on the island','create-guest','primary')}</div>`, 'slots-new');\n68-    } else if (state.screen === 'intro') {\n69:      html = modal(`Welcome, ${esc(profileName())}!`,'A WORD FROM PIP', `<div class=\"dialogue\"><span class=\"speaker\">PIP · RECEPTION CUSHION</span><p>“I’m Pip. I run reception, mostly by remaining in one place. You’ll fit right in.”</p><p>Each morning starts with a Wobble Check. Try activities, collect minutes for the giant clam, and take the week at your own pace.</p></div><div class=\"row\">${button('Let’s explore','island','primary')}</div>`);\n70-    } else if (state.screen === 'island') {\n71-      const guest=state.profile, day=profileDay(), goal=goals[day-1];\n72-      const available=events.filter(item=>unlocked(item));\n73:      html = shell(`<div class=\"island-layout\"><section class=\"island-panel\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">HELLO, ${esc(guest.name.toUpperCase())} · ${guest.freePlay?'FREE PLAY':'YOUR ISLAND STAY'}</div><h2>Find your<br>happy wobble.</h2><div class=\"dayline\"><span>DAY ${day} / 5</span><span>✳ ${guest.dayMinutes || 0} / ${goal || '∞'} MIN</span><span>★ ${guest.stars || 0} STARS</span></div><p class=\"island-note\">${guest.checked ? `Pip says your Balance Age is ${guest.age}. The clam looks impressed.` : 'Pip is waiting for your morning Wobble Check.'}</p><div class=\"activity-list\">${!guest.checked ? `<button class=\"activity highlight\" data-action=\"check\"><span>◉</span><strong>Morning Wobble Check<small>Say hello to Pip · about a minute</small></strong><b>→</b></button>` : ''}${available.map(item=>`<button class=\"activity\" data-action=\"intro:${item.id}\"><span>${item.day===4?'≈':item.day===3?'✳':item.day===5?'★':'◌'}</span><strong>${item.name}<small>${item.place} · ${item.coach}</small></strong><b>→</b></button>`).join('')}</div><div class=\"row island-actions\">${button('Guest book','calendar')}${button(day===5?'Finish the stay':'Call it a day','end-day','primary')}</div></section></div><div class=\"footer\"><span>MINUTE CLAM: ${guest.minutesTotal || 0} MINUTES SAVED</span><button class=\"pill\" data-action=\"settings\">Settings</button></div>`, guest.freePlay ? 'FREE PLAY' : `DAY ${day} OF 5`);\n74-    } else if (state.screen === 'calendar') {\n75-      const guest=state.profile;\n76:      html = modal('Your island log','THE GUEST BOOK', `<p>Every visit is worth a stamp. Your best moments stay right here.</p><div class=\"cards\">${[1,2,3,4,5].map(day=>`<div class=\"card\"><strong>${day < guest.day || guest.freePlay ? '✓' : '○'} Day ${day}</strong><small>${day===guest.day&&!guest.freePlay?'Currently exploring':day < guest.day || guest.freePlay?'A day well spent':'A day to look forward to'}</small></div>`).join('')}</div><p>Balance Age: <strong>${guest.age ?? 'not checked yet'}</strong> · Total: <strong>${guest.minutesTotal || 0} minutes</strong></p><div class=\"row\">${button('Back to the island','island','primary')}</div>`, 'island');\n77-    } else if (state.screen === 'eventIntro') {\n78-      const item=eventById(state.eventId);\n--\n90-      const guest=state.profile, goal=goals[profileDay()-1];\n91-      const canFinish=guest.checked && (guest.freePlay || guest.day===5 ? guest.finaleDone || guest.freePlay : guest.dayMinutes>=goal);\n92:      html = modal(guest.day===5?'Check out?':'Time to rest?','THE MINUTE CLAM', `<div class=\"dialogue\"><span class=\"speaker\">PIP · RECEPTION CUSHION</span><p>“The clam has swallowed ${guest.dayMinutes || 0} minutes today. This is apparently a good thing.”</p></div><p>${!guest.checked?'Complete the morning Wobble Check first.':guest.day===5&&!guest.finaleDone&&!guest.freePlay?'Complete The Big Stand before checking out.':!canFinish?`The clam is hoping for ${goal} minutes today. Complete another activity or two.`:'You have done enough for today. The island will be here when you wake.'}</p><div class=\"row\">${button('Keep exploring','island')}${canFinish ? button(guest.day===5?'See the finale':'Sleep until tomorrow','sleep','primary') : ''}</div>`, 'island');\n93-    } else if (state.screen === 'ending') {\n94-      html = modal(state.profile.age<=40?'A standing ovation.':'An extended stay.','THE BIG STAND · CHECKOUT', `<div class=\"big-score\">${state.profile.age}<small>FINAL BALANCE AGE</small></div><div class=\"dialogue\"><p>${state.profile.age<=40?'“You did it,” says Pip. “You stood there, and we all felt something.”':'“We’ve extended your stay,” says Pip. “The paperwork is a napkin.”'}</p><p>The cast waves from the water. Your island adventure continues in free play.</p></div><p>Created for Tippy Cay · A playful original game inspired by Wii Fit.</p><div class=\"row\">${button('Continue in free play','free-play','primary')}</div>`, 'island');\n--\n105-    } else if (state.screen === 'settings') {\n106-      html = modal('Make it yours','SETTINGS & CONTROLS', `<label class=\"field\">Music volume: <span id=\"music-value\">${Math.round(settings.music*100)}%</span><input id=\"music\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"${Math.round(settings.music*100)}\"></label><label class=\"field\">Sound effects <select id=\"sound\"><option value=\"on\" ${settings.sound?'selected':''}>On</option><option value=\"off\" ${!settings.sound?'selected':''}>Off</option></select></label><label class=\"field\">Controller labels <select id=\"glyph\"><option ${settings.glyph==='PlayStation'?'selected':''}>PlayStation</option><option ${settings.glyph==='Xbox'?'selected':''}>Xbox</option></select></label><p>Keyboard: WASD or arrow keys to lean; Space / Enter to act; Esc to pause. Controller: left stick and ${settings.glyph==='Xbox'?'A':'Cross'}. Mouse: move to lean and click to act. Arrow keys navigate menus.</p><p>Touch-only devices can view the island; connect a controller or keyboard to play.</p><div class=\"row\">${button('Done','settings-back','primary')}</div>`, 'settings-back');\n107:    } else if (state.screen === 'about') {\n108:      const info = window.__aboutData || {};\n109-      const blocks = [['Source Information',info.sourceInformation],['Testing Feedback',info.testingFeedback],['Engine Feedback',info.engineFeedback],['Prompt Feedback',info.promptFeedback]];\n110:      html = modal('About this game','THE FINE PRINT', `<p>Made with Shardfall and an original island full of questionable advice.</p>${blocks.map(([label,value])=>`<h3>${esc(label)}</h3><div class=\"about-list\">${Array.isArray(value)?value.map(line=>`<p>${esc(line)}</p>`).join(''):Object.entries(value||{}).map(([key,line])=>`<p><strong>${esc(key)}:</strong> ${esc(line)}</p>`).join('')}</div>`).join('')}<div class=\"row\">${button('Back to the island','title','primary')}</div>`);\n111-    }\n112-    if (state.attract && state.screen==='title') html += `<div class=\"attract-label\">A LITTLE ISLAND DAYDREAM · PRESS ANY KEY TO RETURN</div>`;\n113:    if (isTouchOnly() && !state.hasHardwareInput && !['settings','about'].includes(state.screen)) html += `<div class=\"touch-guard\"><div><strong>Controller or keyboard required</strong><p>Connect one to play. The island will wait for you.</p><button class=\"button\" data-action=\"settings\">Settings</button></div></div>`;\n114-    app.innerHTML = html;\n115-    const musicInput=document.getElementById('music');\n--\n125-\n126-  function isTouchOnly() { return matchMedia('(pointer: coarse)').matches && !matchMedia('(any-pointer: fine)').matches; }\n127:  function newProfile() { return {name:state.setup.name,skin:state.setup.skin,outfit:state.setup.outfit,day:1,dayMinutes:0,minutesTotal:0,stars:0,age:null,checked:false,finaleDone:false,freePlay:false,bests:{},lastDate:new Date().toISOString().slice(0,10)}; }\n128-  function setScreen(screen) { state.screen=screen; render(); }\n129-  function selectAction(action) {\n--\n156-    else if (action==='settings') { state.returnScreen=state.screen; setScreen('settings'); }\n157-    else if (action==='settings-back') setScreen(state.returnScreen || 'title');\n158:    else if (action==='about') setScreen('about');\n159-    else if (action==='hub-ready') { if(hub) hub.ready(); state.message='Ready! Waiting for the other guests.'; render(); }\n160-  }\n--\n183-    state.result={isCheck:true,age,stars:skill>.8?3:skill>.5?2:1,comment:'A number! We can put it on a postcard. The important part is that you showed up.'}; voice(); setScreen('result');\n184-  }\n185:  function finishRound() {\n186-    const round=state.round; let score=Math.round(clamp(round.sum/Math.max(round.samples,1),0,1)*1000);\n187-    if (round.id==='tide') score=Math.round(clamp(round.potted*200+score*.4,0,1000));\n--\n191-    const stars=score>=850?3:score>=650?2:score>=400?1:0;\n192-    if(state.together) { state.together.scores[state.together.player]+=score; if(state.together.online && hub) hub.progress({score:state.together.scores[0],label:`${round.name}: ${score}`}); }\n193:    else if (state.profile) { const guest=state.profile; guest.dayMinutes=(guest.dayMinutes||0)+2; guest.minutesTotal=(guest.minutesTotal||0)+2; guest.stars=(guest.stars||0)+stars; guest.bests[round.id]=Math.max(guest.bests[round.id]||0,score); if(round.id==='finale') {guest.finaleDone=true;guest.age=Math.max(18,Math.round((guest.age||60)-score/100));} save(); }\n194:    state.result={isCheck:false,name:round.name,score,stars,comment:`${titles[Math.min(titles.length-1,Math.floor(score/1000*titles.length))]}. We’ve banked ${state.together?'your points':'two minutes in the clam'}.`}; sound(660,.25,'sine'); voice(); setScreen('result');\n195-  }\n196-  function advanceResult() {\n--\n256-    if(state.together?.online && hub && time-lastHubUpdate>.1){lastHubUpdate=time;hub.send({event:state.together.event,x:center.x,y:center.y,progress:time/round.length},{reliable:false});}\n257-    if(state.together?.online && hub && time-lastHubProgress>=2){lastHubProgress=time;hub.progress({score:state.together.scores[0]+Math.round(clamp(round.sum/Math.max(round.samples,1),0,1)*1000),label:round.name});}\n258:    if(time>=round.length) { if(state.screen==='check')finishCheck();else finishRound(); }\n259-  }\n260-\n--\n315-  }\n316-  window.__gameBoot={ready:true,title:'Wii Fit Together'};\n317:  window.__gameStatus=()=>JSON.stringify({scene:state.screen,guest:profileName(),day:state.profile?.day||0,checked:!!state.profile?.checked,minutes:state.profile?.dayMinutes||0,age:state.profile?.age??null,event:state.round?.id||null,elapsed:state.round?.elapsed||0,paused:state.paused,together:state.together?{player:state.together.player,event:state.together.event,scores:state.together.scores}:null});\n318-  if (new URLSearchParams(location.search).has('test')) window.__testAdvance=seconds=>{for(let elapsed=0;elapsed<seconds&&['event','check'].includes(state.screen);elapsed+=.025){updateInput(.025);tickRound(.025);}};\n319-  render();\n--- interview ---\n{\n  \"sourceInformation\": {\n    \"date\": \"2026-11-04 22:27:01\",\n    \"source\": \"Wii Fit\",\n    \"plan\": \"PLAN.md\",\n    \"genre\": \"Sports and wellness minigames\",\n    \"perspective\": \"Fixed, illustrated third-person island scenes and balance-board overlays\",\n    \"tech\": \"Shardfall engine in Rust/WebAssembly and WebGPU, HTML, CSS, Canvas 2D and JavaScript; AI Hub session library\",\n    \"artDirection\": \"Bright, friendly tropical resort with rounded characters and soft pastels\",\n    \"animation\": \"Procedural Canvas 2D motion and Shardfall's native simulation\",\n    \"audio\": \"Procedurally synthesized music, sound effects and gibberish voices; music defaults to 10%\",\n    \"online\": \"AI Hub ghost-mode medley, when launched inside a compatible hub\",\n    \"testing\": \"Headless Chromium, Firefox and WebKit, scripted interaction and viewport screenshots\",\n    \"research\": \"Shardfall source and documentation; AI Hub client and harness\",\n    \"environment\": \"Codex CLI (headless); Linux\",\n    \"model\": \"OpenAI, gpt-6.1-terra, reasoning effort max\",\n    \"usage\": \"added on import\"\n  },\n  \"testingFeedback\": [\n    \"unknown\",\n    \"unknown\",\n    \"unknown\",\n    \"unknown\"\n  ],\n  \"engineFeedback\": [\n    \"The Rust game registration and standalone scene provide a useful starting point.\",\n    \"The web presentation and input integration needed more work than expected.\",\n    \"The island interface, activity rules, persistence and multiplayer flow.\",\n    \"Connecting a full custom game and browser interface to the existing simulation.\",\n    \"Registered a fit game, island scene and balance spring to establish a native engine hook.\",\n    \"Provide a complete small example of a custom game with browser UI and observable state.\"\n  ],\n  \"promptFeedback\": [\n    \"The concrete source, detailed design and packaging requirements.\",\n    \"The very large design leaves tradeoffs unclear when the whole scope cannot be completed.\",\n    \"Implementing and validating the full multi-day activity set and online integration.\",\n    \"Prioritize required gameplay milestones and define which simplifications are acceptable.\"\n  ],\n  \"aiHub\": {\n    \"name\": \"Wii Fit Together\",\n    \"tagline\": \"Find your happy wobble\",\n    \"description\": \"Escape to Tippy Cay for a lighthearted island stay full of balance challenges. Play a local medley with friends or compare ghost performances through AI Hub.\",\n    \"type\": \"Game\",\n    \"genre\": \"Sports\",\n    \"source\": \"Wii Fit\",\n    \"series\": \"Wii Fit\",\n    \"players\": \"1–4\",\n    \"controls\": \"WASD or arrow keys to lean, Space to act, Escape to pause; gamepad supported\",\n    \"tags\": [\"sports\", \"casual\", \"island\", \"balance\", \"multiplayer\"]\n  }\n}\n--- engine revision ---\n49ef2ba\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
