{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_264","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"dev='Wii Fit Together-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-222701'; rg -n -C 3 'dev-stiffness|dev-damping|reset-tuning|state.stiffness|state.damping|addEventListener\\\\(.input|addEventListener\\\\(.change' \\\"\"'$dev/web/game.js\"; sed -n '\"'1,180p' \\\"\"'$dev/tests/test_game.py\"; rg -n -C 2 '\"'Developer|dev mode|Dev Mode' PLAN.md TASK.md\"","aggregated_output":"82-    } else if (state.screen === 'event' || state.screen === 'check') {\n83-      const round=state.round;\n84-      html = shell(`<div class=\"hud\"><div><div class=\"eyebrow\">${esc(round.place.toUpperCase())}</div><h2 id=\"round-name\">${esc(round.name)}</h2><div id=\"round-subtitle\">${esc(round.instruction)}</div></div><div class=\"hud-right\"><div class=\"pill\" id=\"timer\">${Math.ceil(round.length)}s</div><button class=\"pill\" data-action=\"pause\">Ⅱ Pause</button></div></div><div class=\"event-center\"><div class=\"phase-card\" id=\"phase-card\">${esc(round.instruction)}</div></div><div class=\"event-bottom\"><div class=\"puck\" aria-label=\"Balance puck\"><div class=\"target\" id=\"target\"></div><div class=\"dot\" id=\"dot\"></div></div><div class=\"meter\"><div><strong id=\"round-score\">0</strong> <span id=\"score-label\">POINTS</span></div><div class=\"meter-track\"><div id=\"meter-fill\"></div></div><small id=\"round-help\">${esc(round.controls)}</small></div></div>`, state.together ? `PLAYER ${state.together.player+1} · MEDLEY` : 'FIND YOUR BALANCE');\n85:      if (state.paused) html += `<div class=\"overlay\"><section class=\"panel narrow\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">TAKE YOUR TIME</div><h2>Paused.</h2><p>The island isn’t going anywhere.</p><div class=\"row\">${button('Resume','resume','primary')}${button('Settings','settings')}${button('Leave activity','leave-event')}</div><details><summary>Developer tuning</summary><label class=\"field\">Spring stiffness<input id=\"dev-stiffness\" type=\"range\" min=\"10\" max=\"80\" value=\"${state.stiffness || 40}\"></label><label class=\"field\">Damping<input id=\"dev-damping\" type=\"range\" min=\"2\" max=\"20\" value=\"${state.damping || 8.5}\" step=\".5\"></label>${button('Reset tuning','reset-tuning')}</details></section></div>`;\n86-    } else if (state.screen === 'result') {\n87-      const result=state.result;\n88-      html = modal(result.isCheck ? `Balance Age: ${result.age}` : result.name, result.isCheck?'MORNING CHECK COMPLETE':'THAT WAS A GOOD WOBBLE', `<div class=\"big-score\">${result.isCheck ? esc(result.age) : formatScore(result.score)}<small>${result.isCheck?'PLAYFUL BALANCE AGE · NOT A HEALTH MEASURE':'POINTS'}</small></div><div class=\"stars\">${'★'.repeat(result.stars || 0)}${'☆'.repeat(3-(result.stars || 0))}</div><div class=\"dialogue\"><span class=\"speaker\">PIP SAYS</span><p>“${esc(result.comment)}”</p></div><div class=\"row\">${button(state.together?'Continue medley':'Back to the island','result-next','primary')}</div>`, state.together?'result-next':'island');\n--\n113-    if (isTouchOnly() && !state.hasHardwareInput && !['settings','about'].includes(state.screen)) html += `<div class=\"touch-guard\"><div><strong>Controller or keyboard required</strong><p>Connect one to play. The island will wait for you.</p><button class=\"button\" data-action=\"settings\">Settings</button></div></div>`;\n114-    app.innerHTML = html;\n115-    const musicInput=document.getElementById('music');\n116:    if (musicInput) musicInput.addEventListener('input', event=>{ settings.music=Number(event.target.value)/100; document.getElementById('music-value').textContent=Math.round(settings.music*100)+'%'; save(); });\n117-    const soundInput=document.getElementById('sound');\n118:    if (soundInput) soundInput.addEventListener('change', event=>{ settings.sound=event.target.value==='on'; save(); });\n119-    const glyphInput=document.getElementById('glyph');\n120:    if (glyphInput) glyphInput.addEventListener('change', event=>{ settings.glyph=event.target.value; save(); render(); });\n121-    const nameInput=document.getElementById('guest-name');\n122:    if (nameInput) nameInput.addEventListener('change', event=>{ state.setup.name=event.target.value; });\n123:    for (const kind of ['stiffness','damping']) { const input=document.getElementById('dev-'+kind); if(input) input.addEventListener('input', event=>{state[kind]=Number(event.target.value);}); }\n124-  }\n125-\n126-  function isTouchOnly() { return matchMedia('(pointer: coarse)').matches && !matchMedia('(any-pointer: fine)').matches; }\n--\n144-    else if (action==='begin-event') startRound(state.eventId);\n145-    else if (action==='pause') { state.paused=true; render(); }\n146-    else if (action==='resume') { state.paused=false; render(); }\n147:    else if (action==='reset-tuning') { state.stiffness=40; state.damping=8.5; render(); }\n148-    else if (action==='leave-event') { state.paused=false; if (state.together && state.together.online) reportHub(); else setScreen(state.together?'handoff':'island'); }\n149-    else if (action==='result-next') advanceResult();\n150-    else if (action==='end-day') setScreen('endDay');\n--\n219-    else {aim.x=smooth(aim.x,0,1.2,dt);aim.y=smooth(aim.y,0,1.2,dt);}\n220-    const round=state.round, time=round?.elapsed||0, wobble=.12;\n221-    const targetX=aim.x*.92+wobble*(Math.sin(time*2.13)*.6+Math.sin(time*3.71)*.4), targetY=aim.y*.92+wobble*(Math.sin(time*1.79)*.6+Math.sin(time*3.31)*.4);\n222:    const stiffness=state.stiffness||40, damping=state.damping||8.5;\n223-    center.vx+=((targetX-center.x)*stiffness-center.vx*damping)*dt;center.vy+=((targetY-center.y)*stiffness-center.vy*damping)*dt;\n224-    center.x=clamp(center.x+center.vx*dt,-1.2,1.2);center.y=clamp(center.y+center.vy*dt,-1.2,1.2);\n225-  }\nimport json\nimport os\nimport sys\nimport threading\nimport traceback\nfrom functools import partial\nfrom http.server import SimpleHTTPRequestHandler, ThreadingHTTPServer\nfrom pathlib import Path\nfrom urllib.parse import urlencode\n\nfrom playwright.sync_api import sync_playwright\n\n\nDEV = Path(__file__).resolve().parent.parent\nROOT = DEV.parent\nHTML = ROOT / f\"{DEV.name}.html\"\nARTIFACTS = DEV / \"tests\" / \"artifacts\"\nfailures = []\nchecks = 0\n\n\ndef test(name, function):\n    global checks\n    checks += 1\n    try:\n        function()\n    except Exception:\n        failures.append(f\"{name}:\\n{traceback.format_exc()}\")\n\n\ndef status(page):\n    return json.loads(page.evaluate(\"window.__gameStatus()\"))\n\n\ndef click(page, action):\n    page.locator(f'[data-action=\"{action}\"]').first.click(timeout=5000)\n\n\ndef advance(page):\n    page.evaluate(\"window.__testAdvance(200)\")\n    assert status(page)[\"scene\"] == \"result\", status(page)\n\n\ndef load(browser, **kwargs):\n    context = browser.new_context(**kwargs)\n    page = context.new_page()\n    errors = []\n    page.on(\"pageerror\", lambda error: errors.append(str(error)))\n    page.goto(HTML.as_uri() + \"?test=1\", wait_until=\"domcontentloaded\")\n    page.wait_for_function(\"window.__gameBoot?.ready === true\")\n    return context, page, errors\n\n\ndef new_guest(page):\n    click(page, \"slots-new\")\n    click(page, \"slot:0\")\n    page.locator(\"#guest-name\").select_option(label=\"Ari\")\n    click(page, \"skin:2\")\n    click(page, \"outfit:3\")\n    click(page, \"create-guest\")\n    click(page, \"island\")\n    assert status(page)[\"guest\"] == \"Ari\"\n\n\ndef browser_tests(playwright):\n    for engine in (\"chromium\", \"firefox\", \"webkit\"):\n        browser = getattr(playwright, engine).launch(headless=True)\n\n        def smoke():\n            context, page, errors = load(browser, viewport={\"width\": 1280, \"height\": 800})\n            assert \"Wii Fit\" in page.title()\n            click(page, \"about\")\n            assert \"Source Information\" in page.locator(\"#app\").inner_text()\n            click(page, \"title\")\n            new_guest(page)\n            click(page, \"check\")\n            click(page, \"begin-check\")\n            page.keyboard.press(\"Escape\")\n            assert status(page)[\"paused\"]\n            page.keyboard.press(\"Escape\")\n            advance(page)\n            click(page, \"result-next\")\n            assert status(page)[\"checked\"]\n            click(page, \"intro:breath\")\n            click(page, \"begin-event\")\n            page.keyboard.press(\"Space\")\n            advance(page)\n            assert status(page)[\"minutes\"] == 1 + status(page)[\"resultStars\"]\n            click(page, \"result-next\")\n            page.screenshot(path=str(ARTIFACTS / f\"{engine}-island.png\"))\n            assert not errors, errors\n            context.close()\n\n        test(f\"{engine} guest, check and activity\", smoke)\n        browser.close()\n\n    browser = playwright.chromium.launch(headless=True)\n\n    def stay():\n        context, page, errors = load(browser, viewport={\"width\": 1280, \"height\": 800})\n        new_guest(page)\n        for day, goal in enumerate((3, 5, 7, 9, 0), 1):\n            assert status(page)[\"day\"] == day\n            click(page, \"check\")\n            click(page, \"begin-check\")\n            advance(page)\n            click(page, \"result-next\")\n            for _ in range(goal if day < 5 else 1):\n                if day < 5 and status(page)[\"minutes\"] >= goal:\n                    break\n                click(page, \"intro:finale\" if day == 5 else \"intro:breath\")\n                click(page, \"begin-event\")\n                advance(page)\n                click(page, \"result-next\")\n            click(page, \"end-day\")\n            click(page, \"sleep\")\n        assert status(page)[\"scene\"] == \"ending\"\n        click(page, \"free-play\")\n        assert status(page)[\"scene\"] == \"island\"\n        page.reload(wait_until=\"domcontentloaded\")\n        page.wait_for_function(\"window.__gameBoot?.ready === true\")\n        click(page, \"slots-continue\")\n        click(page, \"slot:0\")\n        assert status(page)[\"guest\"] == \"Ari\" and status(page)[\"day\"] == 5\n        assert not errors, errors\n        context.close()\n\n    test(\"five-day stay, ending and save persistence\", stay)\n\n    def minute_rewards():\n        context, page, errors = load(browser)\n        new_guest(page)\n        click(page, \"check\")\n        click(page, \"begin-check\")\n        advance(page)\n        click(page, \"result-next\")\n        for attempt in range(2):\n            before = status(page)[\"minutes\"]\n            click(page, \"intro:breath\")\n            click(page, \"begin-event\")\n            advance(page)\n            earned = status(page)[\"minutes\"] - before\n            assert earned == (1 + status(page)[\"resultStars\"] if attempt == 0 else 1)\n            click(page, \"result-next\")\n        while status(page)[\"minutes\"] < 3:\n            click(page, \"intro:breath\")\n            click(page, \"begin-event\")\n            advance(page)\n            click(page, \"result-next\")\n        click(page, \"end-day\")\n        click(page, \"sleep\")\n        click(page, \"check\")\n        click(page, \"begin-check\")\n        advance(page)\n        click(page, \"result-next\")\n        click(page, \"intro:breath\")\n        click(page, \"begin-event\")\n        advance(page)\n        assert status(page)[\"minutes\"] == 1 + status(page)[\"resultStars\"]\n        assert not errors, errors\n        context.close()\n\n    test(\"first-clear and repeat minute rewards\", minute_rewards)\n\n    def medley():\n        context, page, errors = load(browser)\n        click(page, \"together\")\n        click(page, \"hotseat:2\")\n        for player in range(2):\n            for event in range(3):\n                current = status(page)[\"together\"]\n                assert current[\"player\"] == player and current[\"event\"] == event, current\n                click(page, \"hotseat-next\")\n                click(page, \"begin-event\")\n                advance(page)\n                click(page, \"result-next\")\n        assert status(page)[\"scene\"] == \"podium\"\n        assert not errors, errors\n        context.close()\n\nTASK.md-72-Create a feature-complete demo. Capture what makes the source distinctive (its world, characters, themes and tone) and turn it into the mechanics, pacing and UX of a great game. The demo must be long enough to show ALL features and gameplay mechanics so a player can clearly understand how the game plays and feels, and what they can and cannot do. Treat the demo as a complete, polished vertical slice. It should contain all the infrastructure, systems, and polish needed so the remainder of the game could later be built out with normal designer tools.\nTASK.md-73-\nTASK.md:74:Include a dev mode, reachable from the pause menu, with the standard tools for testing the game quickly. Balance is key, so expose the most important gameplay variables as live sliders, with a reset to defaults.\nTASK.md-75-\nTASK.md-76-Attract Mode: After 10 seconds without input on the title/menu screen, start a looping AI-played demo or scripted replay (arcade/kiosk style); any input exits it. The AI (or replay) can be simple and may cheat freely (infinite health, ammo, abilities, no clip, etc). Its only job is to show as much of the demo as possible, the attract mode is not meant to balance the game.\n--\nPLAN.md-90-| Menus | D-pad or left stick, Cross confirms, Circle backs, L1/R1 change tabs | Arrows or W A S D, Enter or Space, Esc backs, Q/E change tabs | Hover moves focus, click activates, right-click backs |\nPLAN.md-91-\nPLAN.md:92:Xbox glyphs (Settings option) swap A B X Y, LB RB LT RT, Menu. Ignore Options while Create is held: that pair belongs to the AI Hub. Disable the engine's own keys (F1 to F10, digits, H, Backspace rewind, right-drag tilt) outside dev mode. Keep F11 for fullscreen.\nPLAN.md-93-\nPLAN.md-94-## 4. The Balance Core\n--\nPLAN.md-352-| Check report | Giant rolling number, sparkline, Pip's comment |\nPLAN.md-353-| Calendar | Five big days and stamps |\nPLAN.md:354:| Pause | Resume, Schedule, Calendar, Wardrobe, Settings, How to Play, About, Dev Mode, Quit to Title |\nPLAN.md-355-| Settings | Music (default 10%), SFX, Voices, Glyphs, Lean Sensitivity, Wobble Assist, Rhythm Offset, Text Speed, Fullscreen, Reset Save (with confirm) |\nPLAN.md-356-| About | Pages for each block your brief requires (section 18) |\n--\nPLAN.md-361-**Touch-only devices:** detect with `matchMedia('(pointer: coarse)')`, no `(any-pointer: fine)`, and no gamepad or key seen yet. Show a centred card \"Controller or keyboard required\" and a Settings button (tap works; Settings is usable by tap). No touch controls: skip Shardfall's `touch.draw` for this game, and route touches directly to egui in `on_touch`, because the engine's touch layer otherwise treats a finger as a stick. Attract mode runs behind the card. Remove the phone-rotation hint and fullscreen-on-tap from `web/index.html`. If a pad connects or a key is pressed, drop the card and start normally. A touch device without WebGPU cannot run the game at all, so the page's own fallback message there says both things: \"Controller or keyboard required\" and that the game needs WebGPU.\nPLAN.md-362-\nPLAN.md:363:**Dev Mode** (from Pause, not shown in hub sessions). Big rows, pad-navigable, in tabs:\nPLAN.md-364-- **Jump:** any day, any event, any finale phase, attract, medley.\nPLAN.md-365-- **Cheats:** no tips, autoplay with the bot, give minutes, unlock all, all stars, skip dialogue, win or lose this event now.\n--\nPLAN.md-381-**The round, the Inter-Resort Medley:** Paddle Slalom, Tide Table, Cannonball Cup, one after another, about 2 minutes, then final score = sum of the three event scores (0 to 3000), reported as `AIHub.result({ score, stats, awards })`. The same seed on every copy gives the same course. On a copy, other players appear as seat-coloured figures with their names in the same event: in another lane or on a neighbouring raft or board. They affect nothing. Use the hub's own card: do not pass `card: true`.\nPLAN.md-382-\nPLAN.md:383:In a session there is no title, menu or attract. The game opens straight into the round. Pause shows only Resume and Settings; the world keeps running, because the hub's clock does. Quit, restart and dev mode do not exist there.\nPLAN.md-384-\nPLAN.md-385-**Order in the `<head>` of `web/index.html`:** `<meta charset>`, the client, the tags, the `about-data` block (section 14), then the JS below.\n--\nPLAN.md-591-6. **Meta.** Days, unlocks, titles, wardrobe, flip-flops, Yesterday You, absence comments, all songs and SFX.\nPLAN.md-592-7. **Finale and endings.** Big Stand, both endings, credits, Free Play.\nPLAN.md:593:8. **Shell.** Attract, Settings, Dev Mode, touch-only card, How to Play, About.\nPLAN.md-594-9. **Multiplayer.** Full Medley, hub ghosts in every lane, Play Together.\nPLAN.md-595-10. **Polish.** Write the script to full length, feel pass on every event using the sliders, extra set dressing, particles, transitions, stingers.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
