{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_282","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"rg -n -i -C 2 'developer|tuning|debug|pause|online.*pause' PLAN.md; rg -n -C 2 'state\\\\.paused|dev-stiffness|reset-tuning|function frame|function tickRound|const round=state\\\\.round' 'Wii Fit Together-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-222701/web/game.js'\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_282","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"rg -n -i -C 2 'developer|tuning|debug|pause|online.*pause' PLAN.md; rg -n -C 2 'state\\\\.paused|dev-stiffness|reset-tuning|function frame|function tickRound|const round=state\\\\.round' 'Wii Fit Together-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-222701/web/game.js'\"","aggregated_output":"87-| Schedule | Triangle | Tab | |\n88-| Island camera | Right stick | | Right-drag, wheel zooms |\n89:| Pause | Options | Esc | |\n90-| Menus | D-pad or left stick, Cross confirms, Circle backs, L1/R1 change tabs | Arrows or W A S D, Enter or Space, Esc backs, Q/E change tabs | Hover moves focus, click activates, right-click backs |\n91-\n--\n215-- Pip: \"You wobbled 41 times. I stopped counting at 40, out of respect.\"\n216-- Pip: \"Did you know? Standing still burns calories. Not many. Did you know that, though?\"\n217:- Pip, on a long pause: \"You have been paused for 4 minutes. Pausing is not an exercise. I checked.\"\n218-- Posey: \"Breathe in the sea. Not literally.\"\n219-- Posey: \"Be the heron. The heron does not check the score.\"\n--\n352-| Check report | Giant rolling number, sparkline, Pip's comment |\n353-| Calendar | Five big days and stamps |\n354:| Pause | Resume, Schedule, Calendar, Wardrobe, Settings, How to Play, About, Dev Mode, Quit to Title |\n355-| Settings | Music (default 10%), SFX, Voices, Glyphs, Lean Sensitivity, Wobble Assist, Rhythm Offset, Text Speed, Fullscreen, Reset Save (with confirm) |\n356-| About | Pages for each block your brief requires (section 18) |\n--\n361-**Touch-only devices:** detect with `matchMedia('(pointer: coarse)')`, no `(any-pointer: fine)`, and no gamepad or key seen yet. Show a centred card \"Controller or keyboard required\" and a Settings button (tap works; Settings is usable by tap). No touch controls: skip Shardfall's `touch.draw` for this game, and route touches directly to egui in `on_touch`, because the engine's touch layer otherwise treats a finger as a stick. Attract mode runs behind the card. Remove the phone-rotation hint and fullscreen-on-tap from `web/index.html`. If a pad connects or a key is pressed, drop the card and start normally. A touch device without WebGPU cannot run the game at all, so the page's own fallback message there says both things: \"Controller or keyboard required\" and that the game needs WebGPU.\n362-\n363:**Dev Mode** (from Pause, not shown in hub sessions). Big rows, pad-navigable, in tabs:\n364-- **Jump:** any day, any event, any finale phase, attract, medley.\n365-- **Cheats:** no tips, autoplay with the bot, give minutes, unlock all, all stars, skip dialogue, win or lose this event now.\n366:- **Time:** scale 0.25x to 4x, pause, single step (`TimeControl`).\n367:- **Tuning:** live sliders, generated from `impl Tunable for Rules` with `params::list` and `params::set`, grouped by core and by event, with **Reset to Defaults** per group and for all. Must include: stiffness, damping, wobble, tip time, stick curve, key rates, each event's main difficulty number, rhythm windows, spin band, gust strength, bounce gain, Big Stand gusts.\n368-- **View:** input viewer, dot trace, engine stats overlay, free camera, ghost lanes.\n369-- **Save:** reset this guest.\n--\n381-**The round, the Inter-Resort Medley:** Paddle Slalom, Tide Table, Cannonball Cup, one after another, about 2 minutes, then final score = sum of the three event scores (0 to 3000), reported as `AIHub.result({ score, stats, awards })`. The same seed on every copy gives the same course. On a copy, other players appear as seat-coloured figures with their names in the same event: in another lane or on a neighbouring raft or board. They affect nothing. Use the hub's own card: do not pass `card: true`.\n382-\n383:In a session there is no title, menu or attract. The game opens straight into the round. Pause shows only Resume and Settings; the world keeps running, because the hub's clock does. Quit, restart and dev mode do not exist there.\n384-\n385-**Order in the `<head>` of `web/index.html`:** `<meta charset>`, the client, the tags, the `about-data` block (section 14), then the JS below.\n--\n443-## 14. Architecture\n444-\n445:**Decision: all game state and flow live in the sim, in one `Game`.** Menus, dialogue, pause, settings values and dev toggles are state in `FitGame`, driven by `InputFrame`, so `cargo test` can play the whole game with no browser or GPU in seconds. `pav_ui` is a pure view of a `UiFrame`: it draws the frame, and returns what the pointer hovered and clicked, which the app sends back as `InputFrame.ui` (clear PRIMARY that frame if the UI took the click) and publishes as item rects in `window.__gameUi` for browser tests. Pause freezes the world by an early return in `Sim::step_inner`, not by `TimeControl`.\n446-\n447-```\n--\n489-| File | Change | Why |\n490-|---|---|---|\n491:| `pav_core/src/input.rs` | Add to `InputFrame`: `lean: Vec2`, `any: bool`, `ui: Option<UiEvent>` (Copy: `Hover(u16)`, `Click(u16)`, `Slider(u16, f32)`), `song_pos: Option<f32>`, all `#[serde(default)]`. New `buttons`: CONFIRM, BACK, MENU_UP/DOWN/LEFT/RIGHT, TAB_L, TAB_R, PAUSE, SCHEDULE, WAVE, STEP_L, STEP_R, HUB_GO | Everything the game needs is input, so replays and tests cover it |\n492:| `pav_core/src/games/mod.rs`, `sim.rs` | `Game::frozen()` with a default of false (add it to the trait and its `DynGame` and `GameBox` wrappers); when true, `step_inner` skips everything after `play_pre` except tick++ and events | Pause freezes the world while menus still run |\n493-| `pav_core/src/frame.rs`, `sim.rs` | `HudFrame.status: Option<String>` (the game's status JSON), `HudFrame.fit: Option<Arc<UiFrame>>` and `HudFrame.camera_yaw: Option<f32>`, which `pav_app` and `pav_tools/src/session.rs` apply to the rig each frame | Link to JS and to the UI; Morning Lap's chase camera, since cues blend over 0.7 s and cannot follow per tick |\n494-| `pav_view/src/build.rs`, `fx.rs` | Handle `BigSplash` (bigger water dents and bursts) and a silent `Wake { pos }` event (a small dent, no sound; `Splash` is loud if repeated) | The dive's payoff and the paddle's wake |\n--\n498-| `pav_tools/src/tools.rs` (`t_input`) | Accept `lean=[x,y]` | Poke events from the REPL |\n499-| `pav_app/src/input.rs` | `Bindings::fit()`, a fit layout in `poll_gamepad` (Cross, Circle, L1/L2, R1/R2, D-pad taps, Options unless Create is held), key ramps for lean, menu repeat | Controller-first layout |\n500:| `pav_app/src/app.rs` | When `hud.fit` is set: hide `boot_panel`, `stats_panel`, `guide_panel`, the room card, `hint_bar` and the F1 panel (verified necessary); route Esc and Options to PAUSE instead of `set_menu`; gate `handle_key`; call `weblink` each frame; apply Settings to audio buses; save to `localStorage` when the save serial changes; keep fit bindings in the room-change branch, which otherwise rebinds keys | Removes the engine demo's chrome and keys |\n501-| `pav_audio` | Section 10 | Music, voices, buses |\n502-| `web/index.html` | Client, tags, JS, `about-data`, catalogue `<title>Name — Tagline</title>`, description, theme colour, an inline SVG icon; remove the phone hints | Hub and catalogue |\n--\n565-- Morning Check: better input gives a lower age; bounds hold.\n566-- Attract: starts at 600 idle ticks, cycles all events, any input exits, saves nothing.\n567:- Pause freezes the world. Settings: music defaults to 0.10. Dev sliders change values and reset. Dev jump lands where it says.\n568-- Save round trip and version. Medley on a seed gives the same score for the same inputs. Play Together completes. Ghosts match by area.\n569-- Snapshot, rewind and replay exactness (copy `crates/pav_core/tests/games.rs`).\n--\n585-\n586-1. **Setup.** Pick the title. `git clone --depth 1 https://github.com/michaelcrosato/shardfall engine` (it is public). Copy the starter to `games/fit/`, register it, build `pav` and the web page, first `tests/run.sh`.\n587:2. **Seams.** Hide the chrome, fit input layout, `lean`, fonts, `fit_ui` with a Title and a Pause, Flow state machine, `weblink`, `__gameStatus`, save, a one-event Medley stub, hub JS. Get the harness and the browser smoke green now, before content exists.\n588-3. **First slice.** Balance Core, Puck, tilt, `studio` set, Pose Parade, event card and result, bot, one result screen in full art. Play it by bot and capture it. Tune until a ring streak feels good.\n589-4. **Island and voice.** `hub` set and props, walking, interactables, dialogue with syllables, audio buses, Lobby Bossa, Pip, the Morning Check, Balance Age, Calendar, Clam.\n--\n624-| Stand-ins: pad, touch, sound, second player, iPhone, TV | 15, 16 |\n625-| Original game, feature-complete vertical slice, extendable with normal tools | 1, 14 (all data in TOML, JSON clips and props; `README.md` explains adding an event, a set and a song) |\n626:| Dev mode from pause, live sliders, reset | 11 |\n627-| Attract mode | 12 |\n628-| Narrative tone | 7 |\n81-      html = modal('Morning Wobble Check','PIP · RECEPTION CUSHION', `<div class=\"dialogue\"><p>“This is not a test of your worth. It is a test of whether the dot stays near the middle.”</p></div><p>Four little checks: stand still, lean toward targets, close your eyes, and alternate steps. Your Balance Age is a playful score, not medical advice.</p><div class=\"row\">${button('Back','island')}${button('Begin the check','begin-check','primary')}</div>`, 'island');\n82-    } else if (state.screen === 'event' || state.screen === 'check') {\n83:      const round=state.round;\n84-      html = shell(`<div class=\"hud\"><div><div class=\"eyebrow\">${esc(round.place.toUpperCase())}</div><h2 id=\"round-name\">${esc(round.name)}</h2><div id=\"round-subtitle\">${esc(round.instruction)}</div></div><div class=\"hud-right\"><div class=\"pill\" id=\"timer\">${Math.ceil(round.length)}s</div><button class=\"pill\" data-action=\"pause\">Ⅱ Pause</button></div></div><div class=\"event-center\"><div class=\"phase-card\" id=\"phase-card\">${esc(round.instruction)}</div></div><div class=\"event-bottom\"><div class=\"puck\" aria-label=\"Balance puck\"><div class=\"target\" id=\"target\"></div><div class=\"dot\" id=\"dot\"></div></div><div class=\"meter\"><div><strong id=\"round-score\">0</strong> <span id=\"score-label\">POINTS</span></div><div class=\"meter-track\"><div id=\"meter-fill\"></div></div><small id=\"round-help\">${esc(round.controls)}</small></div></div>`, state.together ? `PLAYER ${state.together.player+1} · MEDLEY` : 'FIND YOUR BALANCE');\n85:      if (state.paused) html += `<div class=\"overlay\"><section class=\"panel narrow\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">TAKE YOUR TIME</div><h2>Paused.</h2><p>The island isn’t going anywhere.</p><div class=\"row\">${button('Resume','resume','primary')}${button('Settings','settings')}${button('Leave activity','leave-event')}</div><details><summary>Developer tuning</summary><label class=\"field\">Spring stiffness<input id=\"dev-stiffness\" type=\"range\" min=\"10\" max=\"80\" value=\"${state.stiffness || 40}\"></label><label class=\"field\">Damping<input id=\"dev-damping\" type=\"range\" min=\"2\" max=\"20\" value=\"${state.damping || 8.5}\" step=\".5\"></label>${button('Reset tuning','reset-tuning')}</details></section></div>`;\n86-    } else if (state.screen === 'result') {\n87-      const result=state.result;\n--\n130-    if (!action) return;\n131-    sound(520,.05);\n132:    if (action === 'title') { state.paused=false; state.together=null; state.round=null; setScreen('title'); }\n133-    else if (action === 'slots-new' || action === 'slots-continue') { state.slotMode=action==='slots-new'?'new':'continue'; setScreen('slots'); }\n134-    else if (action.startsWith('slot:')) { const index=Number(action.slice(5)), guest=(saved.slots||[])[index]; state.slot=index; if (guest) { state.profile=guest; setScreen('island'); } else { state.setup={name:names[index],skin:index%skins.length,outfit:index%outfits.length}; setScreen('c