{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_482","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"rg -n '\"'^#{1,3} '\"' PLAN.md; printf '\\\\n--- source files ---\\\\n'; ls -la 'Wii Fit Together-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-222701' 'Wii Fit Together-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-222701/tests'; printf '\\\\n--- engine game ---\\\\n'; sed -n '1,220p' 'Wii Fit Together-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-222701/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit.rs'; printf '\\\\n--- exit interview ---\\\\n'; cat exit-interview.json\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_482","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"rg -n '\"'^#{1,3} '\"' PLAN.md; printf '\\\\n--- source files ---\\\\n'; ls -la 'Wii Fit Together-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-222701' 'Wii Fit Together-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-222701/tests'; printf '\\\\n--- engine game ---\\\\n'; sed -n '1,220p' 'Wii Fit Together-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-222701/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit.rs'; printf '\\\\n--- exit interview ---\\\\n'; cat exit-interview.json\"","aggregated_output":"1:# Game plan: a balance-and-wellness comedy inspired by Wii Fit\n5:## 0. How to read this plan\n15:## 1. The game in one page\n48:## 2. Structure of play\n74:## 3. Controls\n94:## 4. The Balance Core\n119:## 5. Events\n125:### Stillness Studio (Posey). Set: `studio`, a round white deck on a calm dawn lagoon. Camera: mirror view (yaw 0, tilt 12, distance 8.5, fov 36; the figure faces +Z, toward the camera, and stick right is screen right).\n131:### Iron Gazebo (Big Kettle). Set: `gazebo`, a white iron gazebo at golden hour. Camera: 3/4 front.\n137:### Boardwalk (Bounce). Set: `boardwalk`, a beach boardwalk at bright midday.\n145:### Lagoon (Commodore Gull). Sets: `tide`, `channel`, `pier`, `tower`.\n155:### The Big Stand (finale, about 2.5 minutes). Set: `bay`, a tiny post in the bay at sunset, with the whole cast watching from rafts.\n166:### Morning Wobble Check. Set: `studio`. About 70 s, four micro-tests, Pip presiding.\n181:## 6. Meta systems\n192:## 7. World, cast and writing\n227:## 8. Art direction\n258:# The sea: water zones near the action, one huge disc beyond them. Fog hides its edge.\n283:## 9. Animation\n308:## 10. Audio\n333:## 11. UI and UX\n371:## 12. Attract mode\n377:## 13. Multiplayer\n443:## 14. Architecture\n520:## 15. Verified facts and traps\n557:## 16. Testing\n582:## 17. Build order\n600:## 18. Finishing\n608:### What each brief item maps to\n\n--- source files ---\nWii Fit Together-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-222701:\ntotal 11104\ndrwxr-xr-x  7 micha micha     4096 Nov  4 23:02 .\ndrwxr-xr-x  3 micha micha     4096 Nov  4 23:02 ..\ndrwxr-xr-x 17 micha micha     4096 Nov  4 22:31 engine\n-rw-r--r--  1 micha micha 11341115 Nov  5 00:47 game.raw.html\ndrwxr-xr-x  2 micha micha     4096 Nov  4 22:32 hub\ndrwxr-xr-x  2 micha micha     4096 Nov  4 23:02 scripts\ndrwxr-xr-x  3 micha micha     4096 Nov  4 23:13 tests\ndrwxr-xr-x  2 micha micha     4096 Nov  4 22:50 web\n\nWii Fit Together-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-222701/tests:\ntotal 32\ndrwxr-xr-x 3 micha micha  4096 Nov  4 23:13 .\ndrwxr-xr-x 7 micha micha  4096 Nov  4 23:02 ..\ndrwxr-xr-x 2 micha micha  4096 Nov  5 00:23 artifacts\n-rwxr-xr-x 1 micha micha   151 Nov  4 23:13 run.sh\n-rw-r--r-- 1 micha micha 12668 Nov  5 00:22 test_game.py\n\n--- engine game ---\nuse anyhow::{Result, anyhow};\nuse glam::Vec2;\nuse serde::{Deserialize, Serialize};\nuse serde_json::json;\n\nuse super::{Game, GameBox};\nuse crate::input::InputFrame;\nuse crate::room::RoomDef;\nuse crate::sim::Sim;\n\nconst LEVEL: &str = include_str!(\"fit.toml\");\n\n#[derive(Clone, Serialize, Deserialize)]\npub struct FitGame {\n    pub center: Vec2,\n    pub velocity: Vec2,\n    pub elapsed: f32,\n    pub stable: f32,\n}\n\nimpl Default for FitGame {\n    fn default() -> Self {\n        Self { center: Vec2::ZERO, velocity: Vec2::ZERO, elapsed: 0.0, stable: 0.0 }\n    }\n}\n\nimpl FitGame {\n    pub fn advance(&mut self, lean: Vec2, dt: f32) {\n        self.elapsed += dt;\n        let wobble = Vec2::new((self.elapsed * 1.7).sin(), (self.elapsed * 1.3).cos()) * 0.12;\n        let target = lean.clamp_length_max(1.0) * 0.92 + wobble;\n        let acceleration = (target - self.center) * 40.0 - self.velocity * 8.5;\n        self.velocity += acceleration * dt;\n        self.center += self.velocity * dt;\n        if self.center.length() < 0.32 {\n            self.stable += dt;\n        }\n    }\n}\n\npub fn build(sim: &mut Sim, _rest: Option<&str>) -> Result<()> {\n    let def = RoomDef::parse(&super::level_text(FitGame::KEY, LEVEL)).map_err(|error| anyhow!(\"fit.toml: {error}\"))?;\n    crate::scenes::build_standalone_room(sim, FitGame::KEY, def);\n    sim.state.play = Some(GameBox::new(FitGame::default()));\n    Ok(())\n}\n\nimpl Game for FitGame {\n    const KEY: &'static str = \"fit\";\n\n    fn pre(&mut self, _sim: &mut Sim, input: &InputFrame, dt: f32, _events: &mut Vec<crate::frame::SimEvent>) -> std::collections::BTreeMap<crate::entity::EntityId, InputFrame> {\n        self.advance(input.move_dir, dt);\n        std::collections::BTreeMap::new()\n    }\n\n    fn status(&self, _sim: &Sim) -> serde_json::Value {\n        json!({ \"center\": [self.center.x, self.center.y], \"elapsed\": self.elapsed, \"stable\": self.stable })\n    }\n}\n\n#[cfg(test)]\nmod tests {\n    use super::*;\n\n    #[test]\n    fn balance_stays_finite_and_follows_input() {\n        let mut game = FitGame::default();\n        for _ in 0..120 {\n            game.advance(Vec2::X, 1.0 / 60.0);\n        }\n        assert!(game.center.x > 0.7 && game.center.x < 1.1);\n        assert!(game.center.is_finite());\n    }\n\n    #[test]\n    fn center_resting_is_stable() {\n        let mut game = FitGame::default();\n        for _ in 0..120 {\n            game.advance(Vec2::ZERO, 1.0 / 60.0);\n        }\n        assert!(game.stable > 1.9);\n    }\n}\n\n--- exit interview ---\n{\n  \"sourceInformation\": {\n    \"date\": \"2026-11-04 22:27:01\",\n    \"source\": \"Wii Fit\",\n    \"plan\": \"PLAN.md\",\n    \"genre\": \"Sports and wellness minigames\",\n    \"perspective\": \"Fixed, illustrated third-person island scenes and balance-board overlays\",\n    \"tech\": \"Shardfall engine in Rust/WebAssembly and WebGPU, HTML, CSS, Canvas 2D and JavaScript; AI Hub session library\",\n    \"artDirection\": \"Bright, friendly tropical resort with rounded characters and soft pastels\",\n    \"animation\": \"Procedural Canvas 2D motion and Shardfall's native simulation\",\n    \"audio\": \"Procedurally synthesized music, sound effects and gibberish voices; music defaults to 10%\",\n    \"online\": \"AI Hub ghost-mode medley, when launched inside a compatible hub\",\n    \"testing\": \"Headless Chromium, Firefox and WebKit, scripted interaction and viewport screenshots\",\n    \"research\": \"Shardfall source and documentation; AI Hub client and harness\",\n    \"environment\": \"Codex CLI (headless); Linux\",\n    \"model\": \"OpenAI, gpt-6.1-terra, reasoning effort max\",\n    \"usage\": \"added on import\"\n  },\n  \"testingFeedback\": [\n    \"unknown\",\n    \"unknown\",\n    \"unknown\",\n    \"unknown\"\n  ],\n  \"engineFeedback\": [\n    \"The Rust game registration and standalone scene provide a useful starting point.\",\n    \"The web presentation and input integration needed more work than expected.\",\n    \"The island interface, activity rules, persistence and multiplayer flow.\",\n    \"Connecting a full custom game and browser interface to the existing simulation.\",\n    \"Registered a fit game, island scene and balance spring to establish a native engine hook.\",\n    \"Provide a complete small example of a custom game with browser UI and observable state.\"\n  ],\n  \"promptFeedback\": [\n    \"The concrete source, detailed design and packaging requirements.\",\n    \"The very large design leaves tradeoffs unclear when the whole scope cannot be completed.\",\n    \"Implementing and validating the full multi-day activity set and online integration.\",\n    \"Prioritize required gameplay milestones and define which simplifications are acceptable.\"\n  ],\n  \"aiHub\": {\n    \"name\": \"Wii Fit Together\",\n    \"tagline\": \"Find your happy wobble\",\n    \"description\": \"Escape to Tippy Cay for a lighthearted island stay full of balance challenges. Play a local medley with friends or compare ghost performances through AI Hub.\",\n    \"type\": \"Game\",\n    \"genre\": \"Sports\",\n    \"source\": \"Wii Fit\",\n    \"series\": \"Wii Fit\",\n    \"players\": \"1–4\",\n    \"controls\": \"WASD or arrow keys to lean, Space to act, Escape to pause; gamepad supported\",\n    \"tags\": [\"sports\", \"casual\", \"island\", \"balance\", \"multiplayer\"]\n  }\n}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
