/div><div class=\"footer\"><span>✳ AN ORIGINAL TIPPY CAY GETAWAY</span><div><button class=\"pill\" data-action=\"about\">About this game</button> <span class=\"hint\">WASD / arrows · Space · Controller</span></div></div>`, 'THE ISLAND IS OPEN');\nWii Fit Together-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-222701/web/game.js-63-    } else if (state.screen === 'slots') {\nWii Fit Together-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-222701/web/game.js-64-      const slots = saved.slots || [null,null,null,null];\nWii Fit Together-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-222701/web/game.js-65-      html = modal(state.slotMode === 'new' ? 'Choose a guest' : 'Welcome back', 'THE GUEST BOOK', `<p>Every guest gets a little corner of the island. Choose an empty book to begin.</p><div class=\"cards\">${slots.map((guest,index) => `<button class=\"card\" data-action=\"slot:${index}\"><strong>${guest ? esc(guest.name) : 'Guest '+(index+1)+' · Empty'}</strong><small>${guest ? `Day ${guest.day} · ${guest.minutesTotal || 0} minutes banked` : 'Ready for a new stay'}</small></button>`).join('')}</div><p class=\"tiny\">Your progress stays in this browser on this device.</p>`);\n--\nWii Fit Together-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-222701/web/game.js-105-    } else if (state.screen === 'settings') {\nWii Fit Together-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-222701/web/game.js-106-      html = modal('Make it yours','SETTINGS & CONTROLS', `<label class=\"field\">Music volume: <span id=\"music-value\">${Math.round(settings.music*100)}%</span><input id=\"music\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"${Math.round(settings.music*100)}\"></label><label class=\"field\">Sound effects <select id=\"sound\"><option value=\"on\" ${settings.sound?'selected':''}>On</option><option value=\"off\" ${!settings.sound?'selected':''}>Off</option></select></label><label class=\"field\">Controller labels <select id=\"glyph\"><option ${settings.glyph==='PlayStation'?'selected':''}>PlayStation</option><option ${settings.glyph==='Xbox'?'selected':''}>Xbox</option></select></label><p>Keyboard: WASD or arrow keys to lean; Space / Enter to act; Esc to pause. Controller: left stick and ${settings.glyph==='Xbox'?'A':'Cross'}. Mouse: move to lean and click to act. Arrow keys navigate menus.</p><p>Touch-only devices can view the island; connect a controller or keyboard to play.</p><div class=\"row\">${button('Done','settings-back','primary')}</div>`, 'settings-back');\nWii Fit Together-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-222701/web/game.js-107-    } else if (state.screen === 'about') {\nWii Fit Together-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-222701/web/game.js:108:      const info = window.__aboutData || {};\nWii Fit Together-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-222701/web/game.js-109-      const blocks = [['Source Information',info.sourceInformation],['Testing Feedback',info.testingFeedback],['Engine Feedback',info.engineFeedback],['Prompt Feedback',info.promptFeedback]];\nWii Fit Together-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-222701/web/game.js:110:      html = modal('About this game','THE FINE PRINT', `<p>Made with Shardfall and an original island full of questionable advice.</p>${blocks.map(([label,value])=>`<h3>${esc(label)}</h3><div class=\"about-list\">${Array.isArray(value)?value.map(line=>`<p>${esc(line)}</p>`).join(''):Object.entries(value||{}).map(([key,line])=>`<p><strong>${esc(key)}:</strong> ${esc(line)}</p>`).join('')}</div>`).join('')}<div class=\"row\">${button('Back to the island','title','primary')}</div>`);\nWii Fit Together-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-222701/web/game.js-111-    }\nWii Fit Together-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-222701/web/game.js-112-    if (state.attract && state.screen==='title') html += `<div class=\"attract-label\">A LITTLE ISLAND DAYDREAM · PRESS ANY KEY TO RETURN</div>`;\nWii Fit Together-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-222701/web/game.js-113-    if (isTouchOnly() && !state.hasHardwareInput && !['settings','about'].includes(state.screen)) html += `<div class=\"touch-guard\"><div><strong>Controller or keyboard required</strong><p>Connect one to play. The island will wait for you.</p><button class=\"button\" data-action=\"settings\">Settings</button></div></div>`;\n\nLicense files:\n/home/micha/.cargo/registry/src/index.crates.io-1949cf8c6b5b557f/epaint_default_fonts-0.36.2/fonts/Hack-Regular.txt\n/home/micha/.cargo/registry/src/index.crates.io-1949cf8c6b5b557f/epaint_default_fonts-0.36.2/fonts/OFL.txt\n/home/micha/.cargo/registry/src/index.crates.io-1949cf8c6b5b557f/epaint_default_fonts-0.36.2/fonts/UFL.txt\n/home/micha/.cargo/registry/src/index.crates.io-1949cf8c6b5b557f/epaint_default_fonts-0.36.2/fonts/emoji-icon-font-mit-license.txt\n\nProgress:\n# Progress\n\n- Title: **Wii Fit Together**, selected uniformly using Node.js `crypto.randomInt` from 50 brainstormed candidates.\n- Deliverable: `Wii Fit Together-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-222701.html` in the workspace root; source and development files in the identically named directory.\n- Engine and Hub client acquired; native engine build succeeds. Registered a Tippy Cay scene and deterministic balance spring in Shardfall.\n- The standalone build is bundled. All 24 phone, tablet, desktop and cross-browser viewport launches passed after fixing a startup injection bug.\n- The browser suite passed 13 checks, including three engines, the five-day stay, rewards, save persistence, pause controls, the local medley, and 2–4-player AI Hub runs. Two Rust balance-spring tests passed.\n- First-clear and repeat minute rewards follow the plan. The exit interview and development README document the current result.\n- Limitations: the visible game and activity logic are Canvas 2D / JavaScript, not the planned full native 3D engine implementation. The explorable island and full event-specific mechanics, among other planned features, remain incomplete.\n- In a separate headless Chromium/SwiftShader probe, Shardfall reached its first frame but then lost its WebGPU device. Retaining the engine instance did not fix this. Hardware WebGPU and real iOS Safari have not been verified.\n- Next: re-bundle the completed interview, rerun the final browser suite, inspect a 1920×1080 frame, and remove engine build caches.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
