{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_550","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"wc -l PLAN.md TASK.md PROGRESS.md 'Wii Fit Together-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-222701/web/game.js'; rg -n '\"'^#{1,4} |''^'\"\\\\*\\\\*[\"'^*]+'\"\\\\*\\\\*' PLAN.md | head -180; rg -n 'function (start|finish|draw|update|.*Round|.*Check|.*Event)|const EVENTS|CHECK|check|eventId|event.id' 'Wii Fit Together-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-222701/web/game.js' | head -180\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_550","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"wc -l PLAN.md TASK.md PROGRESS.md 'Wii Fit Together-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-222701/web/game.js'; rg -n '\"'^#{1,4} |''^'\"\\\\*\\\\*[\"'^*]+'\"\\\\*\\\\*' PLAN.md | head -180; rg -n 'function (start|finish|draw|update|.*Round|.*Check|.*Event)|const EVENTS|CHECK|check|eventId|event.id' 'Wii Fit Together-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-222701/web/game.js' | head -180\"","aggregated_output":"   632 PLAN.md\n   151 TASK.md\n    11 PROGRESS.md\n   325 Wii Fit Together-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-222701/web/game.js\n  1119 total\n1:# Game plan: a balance-and-wellness comedy inspired by Wii Fit\n5:## 0. How to read this plan\n15:## 1. The game in one page\n35:**Pillars.** Check every decision against these.\n41:**Originality rules.** This is an original game in the same genre, not a recreation.\n48:## 2. Structure of play\n50:**Boot:** title screen over a slow island sweep. Menu: New Stay or Continue, Play Together, Settings, About. After 10 seconds with no input on the title or any pre-game menu, attract mode starts (section 12).\n52:**New Stay:** choose one of 4 guest slots, pick a name from a list of about 40 funny preset names (no on-screen keyboard), pick a look (6 skin tones, 8 outfits). Then a short intro with Pip at reception, skippable.\n54:**A day:**\n68:**Minutes:** the first clear of an event each day banks 1 + stars (0 to 3 stars, so 1 to 4 minutes); repeats bank 1. Resort minutes are openly not real minutes (\"Our minutes are longer. It is a wellness thing\").\n70:**Endings:** Balance Age 40 or better: you may check out, by rowboat (`LIB/core/rowboat`). Otherwise: the Extended Stay ending, gentle and funny. Both roll credits, then unlock Free Play: every event open, personal bests, star goals, and a calendar that keeps stamping real days.\n72:**Bot rule:** `Game::bot` must be able to play this entire flow, menus included, from New Stay to the credits. That is your scripted playthrough and the base of attract mode.\n74:## 3. Controls\n94:## 4. The Balance Core\n108:**Feel targets** (these numbers give them, by numeric simulation at 60 ticks/s): full stick reaches 90% in about 0.4 s with about 5% overshoot, like a body. Release settles in about 0.45 s. Left alone, the dot wanders at a mean radius of 0.05, at most 0.08. A held full lean does not tip by itself; a gust on top of it does.\n110:**Input shaping** (in `pav_app`, passed as `InputFrame.lean`, screen space):\n115:**Body:** the figure tilts with the dot (`cob * 14` degrees about the feet, engine change in section 14). Beyond |cob| 0.75 an upper-body arm-flail clip fades in. A tip plays a stumble and, over water, a splash. Tips never end the game; they cost time or score.\n117:**HUD, the Puck:** a large circular gauge drawn in egui: a pale disc, a green target ring, a coral dot, and stars at the edge when streaking. It must read from 10 feet. It looks good at 340 px diameter at 1080p (verified). Put it top centre or bottom centre, whichever does not cover the figure in that event.\n119:## 5. Events\n121:**Common frame:** event card (name, one-sentence goal, glyph prompts, one coach line), 3-2-1, play, result (score 0 to 1000, stars at 400, 650 and 850, a deadpan Title, minutes banked, personal best, difference from Yesterday You; Retry or Back).\n123:**Every event has:** a section of tunable numbers in `rules.toml`, a bot that earns at least 2 stars, an idle-input outcome below 1 star, a ghost lane, and an attract segment. Scenes `fit/event/<name>` start an event directly, for tools and tests.\n125:### Stillness Studio (Posey). Set: `studio`, a round white deck on a calm dawn lagoon. Camera: mirror view (yaw 0, tilt 12, distance 8.5, fov 36; the figure faces +Z, toward the camera, and stick right is screen right).\n127:**Breath Bloom** (45 s). Hold Action to inhale, release to exhale, following a guide ring: 4 s in, 4 s out, 5 cycles, the last one longer. `lungs` rises while held and falls when not. Keep the dot inside a centre ring of radius 0.35. Tick score: `0.7 * (1 - clamp(|lungs - guide| / 0.35)) + 0.3 * inRing`. Each good cycle opens a lotus on the water with a rising pentatonic chime; a perfect run blooms the whole pond. Scrub the clip `FIT/Breath` by `lungs`. No fail state. Bot: holds while the guide rises.\n129:**Pose Parade** (3 poses, 20 s each). Six hand-keyed poses with deadpan names: the Patient Heron, the Apologetic Lunge, the Tired Lighthouse, the Folded Deck Chair, the Reluctant Bridge, Seated Disappointment. Day 1 uses the first three. Posey holds the pose beside you. A target ring (radius 0.30 shrinking to 0.18) drifts on a slow Lissajous path (amplitude 0.35, 0.12 Hz). Inside the ring a streak multiplier climbs x1 to x4, one step per 2 s; leaving resets it. At 12 s of pose 2 a gull lands on your head and wobble is x1.6 for 5 s (\"There is a bird on you. Accept the bird\"). A tip breaks the pose for 1.5 s. Score: time in ring weighted by multiplier. Bot: PD toward the ring centre.\n131:### Iron Gazebo (Big Kettle). Set: `gazebo`, a white iron gazebo at golden hour. Camera: 3/4 front.\n133:**Tempo Squats** (10 reps, about 50 s). Hold Action to go down (2 s to full depth), release to rise (1 s). A guide bar shows the tempo; a low bell marks the bottom. Keep the dot in a band |x| < 0.25; wobble grows 8% per rep. Rep score: `0.7 * timing + 0.3 * band`. Scrub `FIT/Squat` by depth. Gag: rep 10 is followed by \"Ten. Also eleven.\" Bot: follows the guide.\n135:**Plank Standoff** (up to 60 s). Hold Brace and keep the dot in a ring shrinking from 0.40 to 0.20. Releasing, or leaving the ring for more than 1 s, collapses you in a comic flop. Fatigue ramps wobble; at 30 s add tremble; at 45 s Kettle laughs at his own joke and the nudge shakes the screen. Score: seconds survived / 60. Stars at 25, 40 and 55 s. Kettle, who has no arms, plank-talks you through it. Base the pose on one frame of `MESH2MOTION/Pushup`. Bot: survives at least 45 s.\n137:### Boardwalk (Bounce). Set: `boardwalk`, a beach boardwalk at bright midday.\n139:**Step Party** (64 s, 96 BPM, song 4). A rhythm game: notes in two lanes fall to two footprints, left, right or both, on an aerobic step box. Perfect within 55 ms, Good within 120 ms. About 100 notes, data in `charts.toml`, starting with quarter notes and building to eighths and doubles. Bounce bounces on the beat and guests clap on downbeats. Timing uses the audio clock (section 10). Camera: mirror view, slightly high. Bot: presses exactly on each note.\n141:**Floatie Spin** (50 s). Circle the lean (stick, mouse, or rolling W-D-S-A) to spin inflatable rings around your hips. Spin speed is the smoothed angular velocity of the lean while |lean| > 0.4; the sweet band is 6 to 9 rad/s, and a `spin_band_scale` rule widens it for keyboard. \"Switch!\" flips the required direction every 15 s. Guests toss new rings from left or right: press that side's step within 0.25 s of arrival to catch it. Out of band, rings sink; on the floor they are lost. Maximum 7 rings. Score: rings times time in band. Rings are no-physics entities positioned in code. Bot: 7.5 rad/s circle, presses on arrivals.\n143:**Morning Lap** (about 90 s, one lap of the hub island). Alternate left and right steps to set your pace (1.6 to 2.4 steps/s is the zone). Too fast raises a stitch meter that makes you stumble; too slow and Bounce, the pacer rolling ahead, gets away. The path steers you; lean moves you up to 1.2 m sideways to dodge crabs, sunbathers and towels and to grab ribbons. Flip-flops can be found here too. Score: time in zone, plus ribbons, minus bumps. Camera: chase with per-tick yaw. Use `MESH2MOTION/Jog` scaled to speed. Bot: 2 steps/s, steers to ribbons.\n145:### Lagoon (Commodore Gull). Sets: `tide`, `channel`, `pier`, `tower`.\n147:**Tide Table** (3 boards, 60 s total). You stand on a floating square raft and your lean tilts it. Roll hermit crabs in shells into tide pools. Board 1: 3 shells. Board 2: 5 shells and a moving pool. Board 3: 7 shells, bumpers and a rising tide. Fast shells skip over pools. Write the shell physics as simple 2D code (`a = tilt * g - friction * v`, wall bounce 0.5), not rapier: it is more tunable and bot-friendly. Score: shells potted plus time left. Camera: high 3/4 (tilt 62). Bot: PD steering of the nearest shell toward the nearest pool.\n149:**Paddle Slalom** (about 45 s). Stand on a paddleboard on a long channel and pass buoy gates. Lean x steers. Lean forward speeds up and risks tipping, lean back brakes. Gusts, shown as ripple streaks, push the dot. A tip is a big splash and a 2 s remount. A missed gate adds 2 s. `score = clamp((1.6 * par - t) / (0.8 * par)) * 1000`. Standing on water uses the trick in section 15; a silent `Wake` event every few ticks draws the wake. Camera: chase (tilt 22, distance 10). Bot: steers to gate centres at forward lean 0.5.\n151:**Tray Trek** (about 50 s). Walk a long pier at a fixed pace, carrying a tray with a stack of 5 smoothies. Waves, plank gaps and swooping gulls jolt the tray. Your dot tilts it. Glasses slide with tilt and plop into the sea past the edge. Score: 200 per glass delivered, plus a no-spill bonus. Marjorie receives what is left and comments. Use `STYLE100/Balance_Walk` plus an upper-body `FIT/CarryTray` clip. Bot: counters the jolts it knows are coming.\n153:**Cannonball Cup** (3 dives, about 40 s). The board bounces with a 1.2 s period. Press Action at the bottom of 3 bounces to build power, the 4th press leaps. In the air, hold Action to tuck and lean to rotate. Enter tucked and high for the biggest splash. Three gull judges hold up cards: \"6.5\", \"7\", \"See me\". \"We are not here for form. We are here for splash.\" Score: height x tuck x timing. Camera: side view (yaw 90, tilt 6, distance 14). The splash must be huge: a new `BigSplash` event scales the water dents and particles. This is the attract mode's hero shot. Bot: presses on bottoms, tucks at the apex.\n155:### The Big Stand (finale, about 2.5 minutes). Set: `bay`, a tiny post in the bay at sunset, with the whole cast watching from rafts.\n166:### Morning Wobble Check. Set: `studio`. About 70 s, four micro-tests, Pip presiding.\n181:## 6. Meta systems\n192:## 7. World, cast and writing\n194:**Tippy Cay** is about 64 x 48 m: reception at the centre (Pip's desk, Calendar wall, Minute Clam), a ring path for jogging, four pavilions around it, a row of cabanas, a pier, a diving tower and a water channel in the distance. Palms, grass, sand terraces, sea on all sides, circling gulls.\n207:**Writing style.** Short polite sentences. Upbeat. Then one line too honest. Fitness facts of doubtful use. Numbers quoted precisely, for no reason. At most 2 lines on screen at 10 feet. Every coach has at least 25 lines, Pip at least 80, guests about 8 each, per day where it matters. Keep all text in `script.toml`.\n227:## 8. Art direction\n229:**Base:** the engine's native look: cel-shaded rounded primitives, soft sun shadows, thin ink outlines on characters. Its big-headed toy figures already suit the tone. Take the look high-key and pastel.\n231:**Palette:** sky `#d6eef6`, sea `#8fdde0`, deck `#fbfaf6`, sand `#f6e7c8`, grass `#bfe6b0`, ink `#263e54`, teal accent `#46bec8`, mint `#78dcaa`, coral `#ff786e`, sun yellow `#ffd166`.\n233:**Base `[view]` for every set.** This exact recipe was verified to give a clean horizon. Vary sky, sun and warmth per set (dawn in the Studio, golden hour at the Gazebo, sunset in the Bay).\n258:# The sea: water zones near the action, one huge disc beyond them. Fog hides its edge.\n268:**Shapes.** Use big single objects for decks and platforms (a `cylinder` or `rounded_box` `[[object]]`). Legend tiles with `rounded = true` merge row by row into visible stripes (verified). Use flat tiles only for ground. Water: `zone = { kind = \"water\", y0 = -2.0, y1 = 0.0, color = \"#8fdde0\" }`.\n270:**New props.** Hand-write format-2 JSON (`engine/docs/ASSET_STUDIO.md`) into `engine/assets/props/lib/core/<name>.json`; that folder is embedded in every build, including the browser. Use them as `asset = \"LIB/core/<name>\"`. A rebuild of `pav` is needed before `room_check` can see a new file (verified). A leaning palm (cone trunk, 6 radial ellipsoid fronds) and a kettlebell (sphere and torus) looked good on the first try. Check each with `asset_preview name=x views=true figure=true`.\n274:**From the library (generic only):** `LIB/core/rowboat`, `park_bench`, `lamp_post`, `signpost`, `fence`, `market_stall` (smoothie bar), `round_table`, `chair`. The library has no palms, mats, gym gear or beach props (verified).\n276:**Rich detail is welcome.** The brief sets no performance budget, so add detail freely: grass, swaying fronds (`sway = \"leaves\"`), `confetti` and `bubbles` particles, point lights at sunset, ripples, cast figures in the background of every set. Screen transitions (iris) on every set change.\n278:**Looks that work (verified):**\n283:## 9. Animation\n285:**Base:** the engine's puppet (procedural walk, idle, landing, squash and stretch) with motion clips on top.\n287:**Library clips to use:** `MESH2MOTION/Jog`, `MESH2MOTION/Pushup`, `MESH2MOTION/Jumping Jacks`, `CMU/Hop_One_Foot_Loop`, `STYLE100/Balance_Walk`, `CMU/Wave_Hello`, `CMU/Stretch_Yawn`, `MESH2MOTION/Cheering_Two_Hands`, `MESH2MOTION/Victory`, `MESH2MOTION/Sitting_Idle`, `QUATERNIUS/Dance_Loop`. Search with `clips find=word`. There are no yoga or hula clips.\n289:**Hand-keyed clips (verified feasible).** Write readable key poses into `engine/anim/fit.json`. Test without rebuilding: in `pav repl` run `anim_reload`, then `animsheet clip=FIT/Tree frames=1 size=300 out=out/tree.png`. The build embeds every `anim/*.json`. A tree pose, a warrior lunge and a squat were recognisable at the first attempt:\n304:**Make:** Breath, Squat, Tree (Heron), Warrior (Lunge), Lighthouse, DeckChair, Bridge, Seated, ArmFlail (upper body), Stumble, StepL, StepR, HipCircle, CarryTray, Tuck, DiveEntry, Flop, Bow, Sleep, Wake, Sigh. Check motion with `filmstrip` and `animsheet`.\n306:**Scrubbing a clip with gameplay** (depth, breath): call `anim.play_clip(id, 0, 1e-6)` and write `anim.clip_t` yourself each tick. A speed of 0 means normal speed, so use a tiny positive value (read in `PuppetState::update`).\n308:## 10. Audio\n329:**SFX (at least 30):** UI move, confirm, back, stamp thunk, clam gulp, Age slot ticks, step, Pip squeak on landing, wood creak, small and big splash, gull squawk, crowd murmur, clap, gong, rep bell, ring whoosh, shell roll (noise by speed), shell plop, glass plop, confetti pop, gust, wave crash, sea-wash ambience, Eyes Closed tone.\n331:**Voices (Animalese style).** A formant-filtered saw blip per syllable: add two parallel band-pass filters to `Patch`/`Voice`, with a table of formant pairs for 5 vowels, plus a tiny noise click for consonants. The dialogue system fires one `Syllable` per 2 to 3 revealed letters, vowel from the letter, pitch falling at \".\" and rising at \"?\". Each speaker has a base pitch, rate and timbre: Pip high and rubbery, Posey soft with wood-block attack, Kettle very low, Bounce fast and breathless, Gull nasal and clipped. No real words are ever spoken.\n333:## 11. UI and UX\n335:**Route: egui in `pav_ui`, painter-drawn, no default windows.** This was verified at 1920x1080: rounded fonts, soft-shadow cards and painted glyphs look right and appear in headless `pav capture`. Keep all UI state in the sim (section 14), so tests can drive it.\n337:**Fonts:** `npm pack @expo-google-fonts/fredoka` and `@expo-google-fonts/nunito` (SIL OFL, static TTFs). Unpack into their own folder and copy `Fredoka_600SemiBold.ttf` (titles, 50 KB) and `Nunito_700Bold.ttf` (body, 132 KB) to `engine/crates/pav_ui/fonts/`. Embed with `include_bytes!`. Credit them on the About screen.\n339:**Rules:** at 1080p, body text at least 34 px and titles at least 64 px. Scale everything by `min(w/1920, h/1080)`, so it also works in small hub frames. Cards are white with radius 36. Focus is a thick teal outline, scale 1.05 and a soft bounce, with a sound on every move. At most 6 items visible. No tables, no dense stats, at most 4 numbers on a screen, and the About screen is pages, not a scrolling wall. Everything works by pad alone. Keyboard and mouse use the same screens. Hover moves focus, and click activates.\n341:**Glyphs:** draw them with the painter. PlayStation by default (Cross, Circle, Square, Triangle, L1/R1/L2/R2 pills, sticks, D-pad); a Settings option swaps to Xbox (A B X Y, LB RB LT RT). Keyboard: keycaps with labels. Mouse: a small mouse with the button lit. One function `prompt(action, device, xbox) -> glyph`. Prompts change the instant the device changes. Hide the cursor when the pad is in use.\n359:**Mouse in the world:** on the island `InputFrame.aim` already holds the cursor's ground point. The nearest interactable within 1.2 m of it gets a highlight ring; clicking walks there with `NavGrid::path`, then interacts. Clicking open ground walks there.\n361:**Touch-only devices:** detect with `matchMedia('(pointer: coarse)')`, no `(any-pointer: fine)`, and no gamepad or key seen yet. Show a centred card \"Controller or keyboard required\" and a Settings button (tap works; Settings is usable by tap). No touch controls: skip Shardfall's `touch.draw` for this game, and route touches directly to egui in `on_touch`, because the engine's touch layer otherwise treats a finger as a stick. Attract mode runs behind the card. Remove the phone-rotation hint and fullscreen-on-tap from `web/index.html`. If a pad connects or a key is pressed, drop the card and start normally. A touch device without WebGPU cannot run the game at all, so the page's own fallback message there says both things: \"Controller or keyboard required\" and that the game needs WebGPU.\n363:**Dev Mode** (from Pause, not shown in hub sessions). Big rows, pad-navigable, in tabs:\n371:## 12. Attract mode\n377:## 13. Multiplayer\n379:**AI Hub session: mode `ghost`, 1 to 4 players.** Follow `lib/hub/README.md` in `michaelcrosato/ai-hub`. `ghost` is the choice because seeing friends wobble on the next mat is the fun of it, and it is barely more work than `parallel`; `shared-world` would need a host-run world this game does not need. Download `session.js`, `harness.html`, `bridge.js` and `round.js` from `https://raw.githubusercontent.com/michaelcrosato/ai-hub/main/lib/hub/` to `hub/`; these URLs work without auth (verified).\n381:**The round, the Inter-Resort Medley:** Paddle Slalom, Tide Table, Cannonball Cup, one after another, about 2 minutes, then final score = sum of the three event scores (0 to 3000), reported as `AIHub.result({ score, stats, awards })`. The same seed on every copy gives the same course. On a copy, other players appear as seat-coloured figures with their names in the same event: in another lane or on a neighbouring raft or board. They affect nothing. Use the hub's own card: do not pass `card: true`.\n385:**Order in the `<head>` of `web/index.html`:** `<meta charset>`, the client, the tags, the `about-data` block (section 14), then the JS below.\n398:**Hub logic lives in about 30 lines of plain JS in the page; Rust only reads and writes window fields.** This exact block passed the harness on a real engine build at 2 players, at 3 and 4 players with `latency=150&jitter=50&loss=5`, and with `scenario=host-leave`, in 14 to 19 s each, and the page ran clean outside a session (verified):\n435:**Ghost drawing.** Append extra `RenderObject`s to clones of `prev` and `curr` before `builder.build` in `App::frame`, with a high id per seat and `PuppetFrame { state, feet_offset, def: Some(look), rig: None, tint: Some((seat_rgb, 0.55)) }`; copy how `Sim::frame` builds a character's object. The sim never sees hub ghosts, so it stays deterministic. Local ghosts (Yesterday You, Play Together) come from the sim's own save data and are appended in `Sim::frame`, through the same helper, so captures show them. Names are egui text projected above the head; never insert hub names as HTML. Ghost JSON: area (event index), position, facing, lean, clip id, clip time, score. Only draw a ghost whose area matches yours. 10 messages/s stays under the 20/s limit.\n437:**The game on its own.** `AIHub.active` is false and nothing above runs. `Math.random` stays the browser's own. The hub's solo check opens the page, presses Enter and Space, and looks for errors and a drawn screen. Multiplayer exists here too, on one device:\n443:## 14. Architecture\n445:**Decision: all game state and flow live in the sim, in one `Game`.** Menus, dialogue, pause, settings values and dev toggles are state in `FitGame`, driven by `InputFrame`, so `cargo test` can play the whole game with no browser or GPU in seconds. `pav_ui` is a pure view of a `UiFrame`: it draws the frame, and returns what the pointer hovered and clicked, which the app sends back as `InputFrame.ui` (clear PRIMARY that frame if the UI took the click) and publishes as item rects in `window.__gameUi` for browser tests. Pause freezes the world by an early return in `Sim::step_inner`, not by `TimeControl`.\n468:**Every set is a room on one `Sim`** (verified: two rooms, each with its own `[camera]` and `[view]`, switching live in the browser):\n487:**Per-state cameras:** `sim.state.courses.sticky_cue = Some(Arc::new(CameraCue { set, sweep, flip_ortho: 0.0 })); sim.state.courses.cue_serial += 1;` blends over 0.7 s in the window and in the tools. Use `sweep` for slow result-screen orbits. Lighting per state: `courses.view` and `view_serial`.\n504:**In `pre`, always return the player's input with action bits removed:** `out.insert(pid, InputFrame { move_dir, ..Default::default() })`. Otherwise left click and F throw bombs, Space jumps and C crouches. The game replaces the player's own buttons (read in `sim.rs`).\n506:**Rust and JS link, no new dependencies (verified compiling and running):**\n518:**About text stays in plain text in the page.** Put it in `<script id=\"about-data\" type=\"application/json\">` in the `<head>`, not in the wasm. The agent that imports the game edits the Usage line later, and it cannot edit text inside a gzipped wasm. Rust reads it from `__gameBoot.about`.\n520:## 15. Verified facts and traps\n557:## 16. Testing\n561:**`core` (`cargo test -q --locked -p pav_core --test fit`, then `cargo test -q --locked -p pav_audio -p pav_ui`; seconds to run once built):**\n574:**`browser` (Playwright, one browser, 320x180, `file://`):** boots with no errors; `__gameStatus` appears; the pad stub moves focus and confirms; keyboard does the same; mouse hover moves focus and click activates, using rects the UI publishes in `window.__gameUi`; prompts switch with the device; Settings has the Xbox option; attract starts after 10 s and any input exits it; music reaches about 10% by the sound patch. Touch: Chromium with a phone and a tablet profile (it has WebGPU) must show \"Controller or keyboard required\", run attract, and respond to a Settings tap by `page.touchscreen.tap`. WebKit with an iPhone profile, which has no WebGPU here, must show the fallback message from section 11.\n576:**`hub`:** copy the page and `harness.html`, `bridge.js`, `round.js` into one served folder, open `harness.html?game=<page>&players=N&auto=1`, wait for `document.body.dataset.complete === \"true\"`, and require `window.__hubCheck.pass`. Run 2 players; 3 and 4 players with `latency=150&jitter=50&loss=5`; and `scenario=host-leave`. Then a solo check like the hub's: open outside a session, press Enter and Space, expect no errors, `AIHub.active` false, and `Math.random` not seeded. Also byte-compare the pasted client with `hub/session.js`.\n578:**Second player:** the harness's copies, the only multi-player check possible on one computer. **TV:** judge 1920x1080 `pav capture`s.\n580:**Screenshots** only for what scripts cannot check: `pav capture` for composition, `filmstrip` and `animsheet` for motion, one 1080p sheet per set at the end. Do not use subagents or workflows to debate, review, judge or audit.\n582:## 17. Build order\n598:**If time runs short,** cut in this order and remove all traces, leaving no stubs: Tray Trek, Floatie Spin, Plank Standoff. The roster, day table, attract list and Schedule all read from data, so a removed event leaves no hole; move its day's minute goal down to match. Everything else is required. Nothing may ship half-working; your brief says no TODOs, placeholders or stubs.\n600:## 18. Finishing\n608:### What each brief item maps to\n73:      html = shell(`<div class=\"island-layout\"><section class=\"island-panel\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">HELLO, ${esc(guest.name.toUpperCase())} · ${guest.freePlay?'FREE PLAY':'YOUR ISLAND STAY'}</div><h2>Find your<br>happy wobble.</h2><div class=\"dayline\"><span>DAY ${day} / 5</span><span>✳ ${guest.dayMinutes || 0} / ${goal || '∞'} MIN</span><span>★ ${guest.stars || 0} STARS</span></div><p class=\"island-note\">${guest.checked ? `Pip says your Balance Age is ${guest.age}. The clam looks impressed.` : 'Pip is waiting for your morning Wobble Check.'}</p><div class=\"activity-list\">${!guest.checked ? `<button class=\"activity highlight\" data-action=\"check\"><span>◉</span><strong>Morning Wobble Check<small>Say hello to Pip · about a minute</small></strong><b>→</b></button>` : ''}${available.map(item=>`<button class=\"activity\" data-action=\"intro:${item.id}\"><span>${item.day===4?'≈':item.day===3?'✳':item.day===5?'★':'◌'}</span><strong>${item.name}<small>${item.place} · ${item.coach}</small></strong><b>→</b></button>`).join('')}</div><div class=\"row island-actions\">${button('Guest book','calendar')}${button(day===5?'Finish the stay':'Call it a day','end-day','primary')}</div></section></div><div class=\"footer\"><span>MINUTE CLAM: ${guest.minutesTotal || 0} MINUTES SAVED</span><button class=\"pill\" data-action=\"settings\">Settings</button></div>`, guest.freePlay ? 'FREE PLAY' : `DAY ${day} OF 5`);\n76:      html = modal('Your island log','THE GUEST BOOK', `<p>Every visit is worth a stamp. Your best moments stay right here.</p><div class=\"cards\">${[1,2,3,4,5].map(day=>`<div class=\"card\"><strong>${day < guest.day || guest.freePlay ? '✓' : '○'} Day ${day}</strong><small>${day===guest.day&&!guest.freePlay?'Currently exploring':day < guest.day || guest.freePlay?'A day well spent':'A day to look forward to'}</small></div>`).join('')}</div><p>Balance Age: <strong>${guest.age ?? 'not checked yet'}</strong> · Total: <strong>${guest.minutesTotal || 0} minutes</strong></p><div class=\"row\">${button('Back to the island','island','primary')}</div>`, 'island');\n78:      const item=eventById(state.eventId);\n80:    } else if (state.screen === 'checkIntro') {\n81:      html = modal('Morning Wobble Check','PIP · RECEPTION CUSHION', `<div class=\"dialogue\"><p>“This is not a test of your worth. It is a test of whether the dot stays near the middle.”</p></div><p>Four little checks: stand still, lean toward targets, close your eyes, and alternate steps. Your Balance Age is a playful score, not medical advice.</p><div class=\"row\">${button('Back','island')}${button('Begin the check','begin-check','primary')}</div>`, 'island');\n82:    } else if (state.screen === 'event' || state.screen === 'check') {\n88:      html = modal(result.isCheck ? `Balance Age: ${result.age}` : result.name, result.isCheck?'MORNING CHECK COMPLETE':'THAT WAS A GOOD WOBBLE', `<div class=\"big-score\">${result.isCheck ? esc(result.age) : formatScore(result.score)}<small>${result.isCheck?'PLAYFUL BALANCE AGE · NOT A HEALTH MEASURE':'POINTS'}</small></div><div class=\"stars\">${'★'.repeat(result.stars || 0)}${'☆'.repeat(3-(result.stars || 0))}</div><div class=\"dialogue\"><span class=\"speaker\">PIP SAYS</span><p>“${esc(result.comment)}”</p></div><div class=\"row\">${button(state.together?'Continue medley':'Back to the island','result-next','primary')}</div>`, state.together?'result-next':'island');\n91:      const canFinish=guest.checked && (guest.freePlay || guest.day===5 ? guest.finaleDone || guest.freePlay : guest.dayMinutes>=goal);\n92:      html = modal(guest.day===5?'Check out?':'Time to rest?','THE MINUTE CLAM', `<div class=\"dialogue\"><span class=\"speaker\">PIP · RECEPTION CUSHION</span><p>“The clam has swallowed ${guest.dayMinutes || 0} minutes today. This is apparently a good thing.”</p></div><p>${!guest.checked?'Complete the morning Wobble Check first.':guest.day===5&&!guest.finaleDone&&!guest.freePlay?'Complete The Big Stand before checking out.':!canFinish?`The clam is hoping for ${goal} minutes today. Complete another activity or two.`:'You have done enough for today. The island will be here when you wake.'}</p><div class=\"row\">${button('Keep exploring','island')}${canFinish ? button(guest.day===5?'See the finale':'Sleep until tomorrow','sleep','primary') : ''}</div>`, 'island');\n94:      html = modal(state.profile.age<=40?'A standing ovation.':'An extended stay.','THE BIG STAND · CHECKOUT', `<div class=\"big-score\">${state.profile.age}<small>FINAL BALANCE AGE</small></div><div class=\"dialogue\"><p>${state.profile.age<=40?'“You did it,” says Pip. “You stood there, and we all felt something.”':'“We’ve extended your stay,” says Pip. “The paperwork is a napkin.”'}</p><p>The cast waves from the water. Your island adventure continues in free play.</p></div><p>Created for Tippy Cay · A playful original game inspired by Wii Fit.</p><div class=\"row\">${button('Continue in free play','free-play','primary')}</div>`, 'island');\n127:  function newProfile() { return {name:state.setup.name,skin:state.setup.skin,outfit:state.setup.outfit,day:1,dayMinutes:0,minutesTotal:0,stars:0,age:null,checked:false,finaleDone:false,freePlay:false,bests:{},clearedToday:{},lastDate:new Date().toISOString().slice(0,10)}; }\n140:    else if (action==='check') { voice(); setScreen('checkIntro'); }\n141:    else if (action==='begin-check') startCheck();\n142:    else if (action.startsWith('intro:')) { state.eventId=action.slice(6); voice(); setScreen('eventIntro'); }\n144:    else if (action==='begin-event') startRound(state.eventId);\n148:    else if (action==='finish-now') { state.paused=false; if(state.screen==='check') finishCheck(); else finishRound(); }\n153:    else if (action==='sleep') { if (state.profile.day===5) setScreen('ending'); else { state.profile.day++; state.profile.dayMinutes=0; state.profile.clearedToday={}; state.profile.checked=false; state.profile.lastDate=new Date().toISOString().slice(0,10); save(); setScreen('island'); } }\n157:    else if (action==='hotseat-next') { state.eventId=medley[state.together.event]; setScreen('eventIntro'); }\n164:  function startCheck() { center={x:0,y:0,vx:0,vy:0}; aim={x:0,y:0}; state.paused=false; state.round={name:'Morning Wobble Check',place:'Stillness Studio',instruction:'Stand still. This is the whole test.',controls:'Keep the dot near the center.',length:37,elapsed:0,sum:0,samples:0,actionHits:0,actionCount:0,targets:0,phase:0,steps:0,lastStep:'',metric:[0,0,0,0],phaseSamples:[0,0,0,0]}; setScreen('check'); }\n165:  function startRound(id) { const item=eventById(id); if(!item) return; center={x:0,y:0,vx:0,vy:0}; aim={x:0,y:0}; lastHubUpdate=0; lastHubProgress=0; state.paused=false; state.round={...item,instruction:item.controls,elapsed:0,sum:0,samples:0,actionHits:0,actionCount:0,steps:0,lastStep:'',shellX:0,shellY:0,shellVx:0,shellVy:0,potted:0,spin:0,prevAngle:0,gates:0,gateIndex:-1,stillBroken:false,ghostTrail:[]}; setScreen('event'); if(state.together?.online && hub) hub.progress({score:state.together.scores[0],label:`${item.name}: starting`}); }\n167:    if (!state.round || !['event','check'].includes(state.screen) || state.paused) return;\n172:    if (round.id==='squat' || round.id==='step' || round.id==='lap' || round.id==='dive' || state.screen==='check') {\n178:  function finishCheck() {\n184:    state.profile.checked=true; state.profile.age=age; save();\n187:  function finishRound() {\n203:    if(group.online) { if(group.event>=3) reportHub(); else {state.eventId=medley[group.event];startRound(state.eventId);} return; }\n209:  function updateInput(dt) {\n216:      for(const index of [0,9,12,13,14,15]) if(pressed[index]&&!previousButtons[index]) { markInput('gamepad');state.hasHardwareInput=true; if(index===9){if(['event','check'].includes(state.screen)) selectAction(state.paused?'resume':'pause');} else if(['event','check'].includes(state.screen)&&!state.paused) triggerAction(index===14?'left':index===15?'right':'action'); else if(index===0) { const focused=document.activeElement; if(focused && focused.tagName==='BUTTON') focused.click(); else app.querySelector('button:not([disabled])')?.focus(); } else if([12,13,14,15].includes(index)) moveFocus(index===12||index===14?-1:1); }\n231:  function tickRound(dt) {\n232:    const round=state.round, online=!!state.together?.online, onlineSettings=online && state.screen==='settings' && state.returnScreen==='event'; if(!round || (state.paused && !online) || (!['event','check'].includes(state.screen) && !onlineSettings)) return;\n235:    if(state.screen==='check') {\n257:    if(dot){dot.style.transform=`translate(${center.x*43}px,${center.y*43}px)`;dot.style.opacity=state.screen==='check'&&round.phase===2?'0':'1';}\n258:    if(target){target.style.transform=`translate(${targetX*43}px,${targetY*43}px)`;target.style.opacity=state.screen==='check'&&round.phase===2?'0':'1';}\n260:    if(timer)timer.textContent=Math.max(0,Math.ceil(round.length-time))+'s';if(subtitle)subtitle.textContent=instruction;if(phase)phase.textContent=instruction;if(score)score.textContent=state.screen==='check'?['STILL','LEAN','LISTEN','STEP'][round.phase]:formatScore(round.sum/Math.max(1,round.samples)*1000);if(fill)fill.style.width=clamp(time/round.length*100,0,100)+'%';\n263:    if(time>=round.length) { if(state.screen==='check')finishCheck();else finishRound(); }\n268:  window.addEventListener('keydown', event=>{const key=event.key.toLowerCase(); const inRound=['event','check'].includes(state.screen); if(['arrowup','arrowdown','arrowleft','arrowright','escape'].includes(key)||(key===' '&&inRound))event.preventDefault();if(!keys.has(key)){markInput('keyboard');if(key==='escape'&&inRound){selectAction(state.paused?'resume':'pause');}else if(inRound&&!state.paused){if(key===' '||key==='enter')triggerAction();if(key==='arrowleft'||key==='a')triggerAction('left');if(key==='arrowright'||key==='d')triggerAction('right');}else if(['arrowup','arrowleft','arrowdown','arrowright'].includes(key)&&!['INPUT','SELECT'].includes(document.activeElement?.tagName))moveFocus(key==='arrowup'||key==='arrowleft'?-1:1);else if(key==='enter'&&document.activeElement===document.body)app.querySelector('button:not([disabled])')?.click();}\n273:  window.addEventListener('pointermove',event=>{if(event.pointerType==='mouse'&&['event','check'].includes(state.screen)&&!state.paused){mouseAim={x:clamp((event.clientX-innerWidth/2)/(innerWidth*.35),-1,1),y:clamp((event.clientY-innerHeight/2)/(innerHeight*.35),-1,1)};markInput('mouse');}});\n274:  window.addEventListener('pointerdown',event=>{if(event.target.closest('button,input,select,details,summary'))return;if(event.pointerType==='mouse'&&['event','check'].includes(state.screen)){mouseHeld=true;triggerAction();}});\n285:  function drawWorld(now) {\n300:    if(['event','check'].includes(state.screen)) {\n311:  function frame(now) { const realDt=Math.max(0,(now-lastFrame)/1000), dt=Math.min(realDt,.05);lastFrame=now;updateInput(dt);if(!state.paused || state.together?.online)tickRound(state.together?.online?realDt:dt*(state.timeScale ?? 1));music(dt);if(state.screen==='title'&&!state.attract&&now-state.lastInput>10000){state.attract=true;render();}drawWorld(now);requestAnimationFrame(frame); }\n322:  window.__gameStatus=()=>JSON.stringify({scene:state.screen,guest:profileName(),day:state.profile?.day||0,checked:!!state.profile?.checked,minutes:state.profile?.dayMinutes||0,age:state.profile?.age??null,event:state.round?.id||null,elapsed:state.round?.elapsed||0,paused:state.paused,resultStars:state.result?.stars??null,together:state.together?{player:state.together.player,event:state.together.event,scores:state.together.scores}:null});\n323:  if (new URLSearchParams(location.search).has('test')) window.__testAdvance=seconds=>{for(let elapsed=0;elapsed<seconds&&['event','check'].includes(state.screen);elapsed+=.025){updateInput(.025);tickRound(.025);}};\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_551","type":"reasoning","text":"**Viewing plan and source**"}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_552","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"sed -n '119,225p' PLAN.md; sed -n '1,85p' 'Wii Fit Together-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-222701/web/game.js'; sed -n '155,265p' 'Wii Fit Together-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-222701/web/game.js'\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_552","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"sed -n '119,225p' PLAN.md; sed -n '1,85p' 'Wii Fit Together-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-222701/web/game.js'; sed -n '155,265p' 'Wii Fit Together-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-222701/web/game.js'\"","aggregated_output":"## 5. Events\n\n**Common frame:** event card (name, one-sentence goal, glyph prompts, one coach line), 3-2-1, play, result (score 0 to 1000, stars at 400, 650 and 850, a deadpan Title, minutes banked, personal best, difference from Yesterday You; Retry or Back).\n\n**Every event has:** a section of tunable numbers in `rules.toml`, a bot that earns at least 2 stars, an idle-input outcome below 1 star, a ghost lane, and an attract segment. Scenes `fit/event/<name>` start an event directly, for tools and tests.\n\n### Stillness Studio (Posey). Set: `studio`, a round white deck on a calm dawn lagoon. Camera: mirror view (yaw 0, tilt 12, distance 8.5, fov 36; the figure faces +Z, toward the camera, and stick right is screen right).\n\n**Breath Bloom** (45 s). Hold Action to inhale, release to exhale, following a guide ring: 4 s in, 4 s out, 5 cycles, the last one longer. `lungs` rises while held and falls when not. Keep the dot inside a centre ring of radius 0.35. Tick score: `0.7 * (1 - clamp(|lungs - guide| / 0.35)) + 0.3 * inRing`. Each good cycle opens a lotus on the water with a rising pentatonic chime; a perfect run blooms the whole pond. Scrub the clip `FIT/Breath` by `lungs`. No fail state. Bot: holds while the guide rises.\n\n**Pose Parade** (3 poses, 20 s each). Six hand-keyed poses with deadpan names: the Patient Heron, the Apologetic Lunge, the Tired Lighthouse, the Folded Deck Chair, the Reluctant Bridge, Seated Disappointment. Day 1 uses the first three. Posey holds the pose beside you. A target ring (radius 0.30 shrinking to 0.18) drifts on a slow Lissajous path (amplitude 0.35, 0.12 Hz). Inside the ring a streak multiplier climbs x1 to x4, one step per 2 s; leaving resets it. At 12 s of pose 2 a gull lands on your head and wobble is x1.6 for 5 s (\"There is a bird on you. Accept the bird\"). A tip breaks the pose for 1.5 s. Score: time in ring weighted by multiplier. Bot: PD toward the ring centre.\n\n### Iron Gazebo (Big Kettle). Set: `gazebo`, a white iron gazebo at golden hour. Camera: 3/4 front.\n\n**Tempo Squats** (10 reps, about 50 s). Hold Action to go down (2 s to full depth), release to rise (1 s). A guide bar shows the tempo; a low bell marks the bottom. Keep the dot in a band |x| < 0.25; wobble grows 8% per rep. Rep score: `0.7 * timing + 0.3 * band`. Scrub `FIT/Squat` by depth. Gag: rep 10 is followed by \"Ten. Also eleven.\" Bot: follows the guide.\n\n**Plank Standoff** (up to 60 s). Hold Brace and keep the dot in a ring shrinking from 0.40 to 0.20. Releasing, or leaving the ring for more than 1 s, collapses you in a comic flop. Fatigue ramps wobble; at 30 s add tremble; at 45 s Kettle laughs at his own joke and the nudge shakes the screen. Score: seconds survived / 60. Stars at 25, 40 and 55 s. Kettle, who has no arms, plank-talks you through it. Base the pose on one frame of `MESH2MOTION/Pushup`. Bot: survives at least 45 s.\n\n### Boardwalk (Bounce). Set: `boardwalk`, a beach boardwalk at bright midday.\n\n**Step Party** (64 s, 96 BPM, song 4). A rhythm game: notes in two lanes fall to two footprints, left, right or both, on an aerobic step box. Perfect within 55 ms, Good within 120 ms. About 100 notes, data in `charts.toml`, starting with quarter notes and building to eighths and doubles. Bounce bounces on the beat and guests clap on downbeats. Timing uses the audio clock (section 10). Camera: mirror view, slightly high. Bot: presses exactly on each note.\n\n**Floatie Spin** (50 s). Circle the lean (stick, mouse, or rolling W-D-S-A) to spin inflatable rings around your hips. Spin speed is the smoothed angular velocity of the lean while |lean| > 0.4; the sweet band is 6 to 9 rad/s, and a `spin_band_scale` rule widens it for keyboard. \"Switch!\" flips the required direction every 15 s. Guests toss new rings from left or right: press that side's step within 0.25 s of arrival to catch it. Out of band, rings sink; on the floor they are lost. Maximum 7 rings. Score: rings times time in band. Rings are no-physics entities positioned in code. Bot: 7.5 rad/s circle, presses on arrivals.\n\n**Morning Lap** (about 90 s, one lap of the hub island). Alternate left and right steps to set your pace (1.6 to 2.4 steps/s is the zone). Too fast raises a stitch meter that makes you stumble; too slow and Bounce, the pacer rolling ahead, gets away. The path steers you; lean moves you up to 1.2 m sideways to dodge crabs, sunbathers and towels and to grab ribbons. Flip-flops can be found here too. Score: time in zone, plus ribbons, minus bumps. Camera: chase with per-tick yaw. Use `MESH2MOTION/Jog` scaled to speed. Bot: 2 steps/s, steers to ribbons.\n\n### Lagoon (Commodore Gull). Sets: `tide`, `channel`, `pier`, `tower`.\n\n**Tide Table** (3 boards, 60 s total). You stand on a floating square raft and your lean tilts it. Roll hermit crabs in shells into tide pools. Board 1: 3 shells. Board 2: 5 shells and a moving pool. Board 3: 7 shells, bumpers and a rising tide. Fast shells skip over pools. Write the shell physics as simple 2D code (`a = tilt * g - friction * v`, wall bounce 0.5), not rapier: it is more tunable and bot-friendly. Score: shells potted plus time left. Camera: high 3/4 (tilt 62). Bot: PD steering of the nearest shell toward the nearest pool.\n\n**Paddle Slalom** (about 45 s). Stand on a paddleboard on a long channel and pass buoy gates. Lean x steers. Lean forward speeds up and risks tipping, lean back brakes. Gusts, shown as ripple streaks, push the dot. A tip is a big splash and a 2 s remount. A missed gate adds 2 s. `score = clamp((1.6 * par - t) / (0.8 * par)) * 1000`. Standing on water uses the trick in section 15; a silent `Wake` event every few ticks draws the wake. Camera: chase (tilt 22, distance 10). Bot: steers to gate centres at forward lean 0.5.\n\n**Tray Trek** (about 50 s). Walk a long pier at a fixed pace, carrying a tray with a stack of 5 smoothies. Waves, plank gaps and swooping gulls jolt the tray. Your dot tilts it. Glasses slide with tilt and plop into the sea past the edge. Score: 200 per glass delivered, plus a no-spill bonus. Marjorie receives what is left and comments. Use `STYLE100/Balance_Walk` plus an upper-body `FIT/CarryTray` clip. Bot: counters the jolts it knows are coming.\n\n**Cannonball Cup** (3 dives, about 40 s). The board bounces with a 1.2 s period. Press Action at the bottom of 3 bounces to build power, the 4th press leaps. In the air, hold Action to tuck and lean to rotate. Enter tucked and high for the biggest splash. Three gull judges hold up cards: \"6.5\", \"7\", \"See me\". \"We are not here for form. We are here for splash.\" Score: height x tuck x timing. Camera: side view (yaw 90, tilt 6, distance 14). The splash must be huge: a new `BigSplash` event scales the water dents and particles. This is the attract mode's hero shot. Bot: presses on bottoms, tucks at the apex.\n\n### The Big Stand (finale, about 2.5 minutes). Set: `bay`, a tiny post in the bay at sunset, with the whole cast watching from rafts.\n\nFive phases, reusing event code with new numbers:\n1. Breathing, 4 cycles.\n2. A pose under rising gusts, 20 s.\n3. Step Party for 16 bars with a marching band of guests, wobble on.\n4. Brace while waves crash, 20 s.\n5. **The Long Stillness:** 30 s of nothing. Music fades to silence, the HUD vanishes except the Puck. At 15 s a fake prompt offers \"Press Cross to skip\". Pressing anything forfeits the Inner Peace bonus. Then Pip, quietly: \"...Oh. You're still here. Good.\"\n\nA tip drops you in the sea to a groan from the crowd and puts you back; it costs score and cannot end the run. Final Balance Age = morning age minus `final_score / 100` (up to 10).\n\n### Morning Wobble Check. Set: `studio`. About 70 s, four micro-tests, Pip presiding.\n\n| Test | What you do | Metric (0 to 1) |\n|---|---|---|\n| Stand Still (\"This is the whole test\") | Hold the dot centred for 8 s; one small nudge at 5 s | Mean distance from centre |\n| Lean Targets | A left/right bar: reach \"70% left\", then two more targets, within 6%, hold 1.5 s; 5 s limit each | Time taken |\n| Eyes Closed | 6 s. The screen dims to almost black, the Puck vanishes. A tone's pitch tells your offset, and rumble if the pad has it | Mean distance |\n| Step Test | 8 alternating steps to a 100 BPM metronome | Timing |\n\n```\nskill = 0.30*still + 0.25*targets + 0.25*blind + 0.20*steps\nage   = 24 + 56 * (1 - skill)^1.1 - 2*days_completed - min(total_stars/3, 8)\n```\nClamp to 18..99, round. A middling player (skill 0.5) starts at 50 and reaches about 34 by Day 5; a weak one (skill 0.2) starts at 68 and ends near 52, before the finale's bonus. The big number rolls like a slot machine. Pip's comment is chosen by the change since yesterday and by the worst metric. A sparkline of 5 big dots shows the week. Your figure's posture improves as the age falls (a small constant forward slump through the tilt field, shrinking each day): visible progress, no numbers needed.\n\n## 6. Meta systems\n\n- **Minute Clam:** a giant clam at reception that gulps banked minutes with a gibberish burp. Totals unlock wardrobe items.\n- **Calendar:** five big days, a stamp per completed day, then real days in free play. No tables.\n- **Titles:** after each event Pip awards a deadpan title by score: Human Soup, Acceptable Human, Certified Lean-To, Wobble Enthusiast, Seasoned Tilter, Stillness Intern, Professional Standing Person, Alarmingly Balanced. At least 30, in `script.toml`.\n- **Wardrobe:** reuse the engine's `GearLook`, which needs no new drawing (verified): `helm = cap` (sun cap), `helm = hood` (towel turban), `crown`, `halo`; `gloves` (sweatbands), `belt`, `pauldrons` (reads as arm floaties, funny). Plus shirt, pants and shoe colours. Skip `cape`: it draws long sticks.\n- **Lost flip-flops:** 5 hidden on the island, for Two-Towel Tom. Reward: Golden Flip-Flops (gold shoes) and a line. This is the exploration layer.\n- **Yesterday You:** your best run of each event is recorded and replayed as a tinted figure in a neighbouring lane, from Day 3.\n- **Absence comments:** the page passes today's date to the game at boot, and the save stores the last day played. \"You were away for 2 days. I did not count them. There were 2.\" Passing the date in as data keeps the rule that the sim never reads the clock.\n- **Saves:** versioned JSON in `localStorage`: guest slots (name, look, day, minutes, stars, bests, ghosts, ages, flip-flops, unlocks) and global settings. Save on every change of day and every result.\n\n## 7. World, cast and writing\n\n**Tippy Cay** is about 64 x 48 m: reception at the centre (Pip's desk, Calendar wall, Minute Clam), a ring path for jogging, four pavilions around it, a row of cabanas, a pier, a diving tower and a water channel in the distance. Palms, grass, sand terraces, sea on all sides, circling gulls.\n\n| Character | What it is | Voice and manner |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Pip** | Sky-blue round wobble cushion, two dot eyes (`blob` plan, scale 0.7, squash 2.0, plus a small valve) | Front desk and scorekeeper. Relentlessly pleasant. Keeps records of everything. Never technically insults you. Squeaky rubber voice |\n| **Posey** | Faceless wooden artist's mannequin (biped with eyes the colour of its skin; verified look in section 8) | Stillness. Serene, short, oddly poetic. Soft wood-block voice. It has no eyes and never blinks; \"This has not been discussed\" |\n| **Big Kettle** | Cast-iron kettlebell (dark `blob` plus a torus handle part; add a `Handle` attach kind) | Strength. Booming, gentle, deeply supportive. No arms or legs, cannot do any exercise |\n| **Bounce** | Huge pink exercise ball that never stops hopping (`blob`, scale 1.2, `hop`) | Cardio. Breathless bursts, no full stops |\n| **Commodore Gull** | Small gull in a captain's cap: three no-physics entities, wings rotated in code | Lagoon. Dry, officious, steals snacks |\n| **Marjorie** | Guest in robe and towel turban (`helm = hood`, white) | On Day 5 for eleven years. Knows everything |\n| **Two-Towel Tom** | Guest with two towels | Lost his flip-flops. Asks you to find them |\n| **The Twins** | Two identical guests | Do everything in unison, finish each other's words |\n\n**Writing style.** Short polite sentences. Upbeat. Then one line too honest. Fitness facts of doubtful use. Numbers quoted precisely, for no reason. At most 2 lines on screen at 10 feet. Every coach has at least 25 lines, Pip at least 80, guests about 8 each, per day where it matters. Keep all text in `script.toml`.\n\nTone anchors, all original. Use these and write more like them:\n- Pip: \"Welcome! You have won a complimentary stay. You did not enter. Nobody enters.\"\n- Pip: \"Please stand on me. Gently. I remember everything.\"\n- Pip: \"Your Balance Age today is 61. That is a number. Numbers cannot hurt you. This one is trying.\"\n- Pip: \"You leaned left 64% of the time. Is everything all right on the right?\"\n- Pip: \"That was your best attempt so far. I am as surprised as you are.\"\n- Pip: \"You wobbled 41 times. I stopped counting at 40, out of respect.\"\n- Pip: \"Did you know? Standing still burns calories. Not many. Did you know that, though?\"\n- Pip, on a long pause: \"You have been paused for 4 minutes. Pausing is not an exercise. I checked.\"\n- Posey: \"Breathe in the sea. Not literally.\"\n- Posey: \"Be the heron. The heron does not check the score.\"\n- Big Kettle: \"Lift with your legs. I cannot. I have none. Lift for both of us.\"\n- Bounce: \"Keep going keep going keep- is that your heartbeat? Mine is just air!\"\n- Commodore Gull: \"That was a dive. I am legally required to say so.\"\n- Marjorie: \"Day five? Oh, I'm on day five as well. Eleven years now.\"\n\nDialogue types out with voice blips. Action completes the line, then advances. Keep a Text Speed setting.\n(() => {\n  'use strict';\n\n  const app = document.getElementById('app');\n  const canvas = document.getElementById('world');\n  const context = canvas.getContext('2d');\n  const hub = window.AIHub;\n  const names = ['Alex','Ari','Ash','Bailey','Bea','Benny','Birdie','Blair','Bo','Cameron','Casey','Charlie','Cleo','Coco','Dani','Drew','Eden','Eli','Emery','Finn','Frankie','Harper','Indigo','Jaden','Jamie','Jesse','Jules','Kai','Kit','Lane','Leo','Lou','Marley','Mika','Morgan','Nico','Parker','Quinn','Remy','Robin'];\n  const skins = ['#f4c29c','#dca37a','#b87855','#8a563f','#f5d7c4','#604437'];\n  const outfits = ['#ff826d','#49b4ac','#f5bb52','#8a9cdb','#e77c9d','#87b979','#e9a778','#778a99'];\n  const titles = ['Stillness Intern','Human Soup','Wobble Enthusiast','Certified Lean-To','Acceptable Human','Seasoned Tilter','Professional Standing Person','Alarmingly Balanced','Chief of Almost','Puddle Avoider','The Upright-ish','Assistant to Gravity','A Quiet Triumph','Exceptionally Present','Honorary Buoy','Very Good at Floor','Sensible Seagull','The Sway Whisperer','Locally Stable','Foot Placement Expert','A Fine Vertical','Slightly Legendary','Calm Adjacent','Proudly Perpendicular','The Unfallen','Official Dot Mover','Ocean Negotiator','Flamingo in Training','Grand Marshal of Balance','Keeper of the Wobble'];\n  const events = [\n    {id:'breath', name:'Breath Bloom', day:1, coach:'Posey', place:'Stillness Studio', length:32, description:'Breathe with the flower. Hold Action as it opens; release as it closes.', controls:'Hold and release Action with the flower.'},\n    {id:'pose', name:'Pose Parade', day:1, coach:'Posey', place:'Stillness Studio', length:36, description:'Follow three gently drifting poses. Keep your dot inside the moving ring.', controls:'Lean toward the moving target.'},\n    {id:'squat', name:'Tempo Squats', day:2, coach:'Big Kettle', place:'Iron Gazebo', length:32, description:'A very dignified imaginary chair awaits. Press on the beat.', controls:'Press Action when the ring closes.'},\n    {id:'plank', name:'Plank Standoff', day:2, coach:'Big Kettle', place:'Iron Gazebo', length:30, description:'Brace against the breeze. A plank is a promise you make to the floor.', controls:'Hold Action and keep the dot centered.'},\n    {id:'step', name:'Step Party', day:3, coach:'Bounce', place:'Boardwalk', length:32, description:'Find your feet at 96 beats per minute. Left, right, and repeat.', controls:'Alternate Left and Right on the beat.'},\n    {id:'spin', name:'Floatie Spin', day:3, coach:'Bounce', place:'Boardwalk', length:32, description:'Circle your lean to keep a bright stack of floaties spinning.', controls:'Circle with WASD, the stick, or mouse.'},\n    {id:'lap', name:'Morning Lap', day:3, coach:'Bounce', place:'Boardwalk', length:35, description:'Take the scenic route. Alternate your steps and steer around beach clutter.', controls:'Alternate Left and Right; lean to steer.'},\n    {id:'tide', name:'Tide Table', day:4, coach:'Commodore Gull', place:'Lagoon', length:40, description:'Tilt the raft to roll a shell into the tide pool. Mind the edges.', controls:'Lean to roll the shell into the pool.'},\n    {id:'paddle', name:'Paddle Slalom', day:4, coach:'Commodore Gull', place:'Lagoon', length:36, description:'Steer through the buoy gates. The sea is mostly on your side.', controls:'Lean left and right to meet the gates.'},\n    {id:'tray', name:'Tray Trek', day:4, coach:'Marjorie', place:'Lagoon Pier', length:35, description:'Carry five very optimistic smoothies across a wobbly pier.', controls:'Keep the dot centered through the gusts.'},\n    {id:'dive', name:'Cannonball Cup', day:4, coach:'Commodore Gull', place:'Lagoon Tower', length:36, description:'Time your bounce, tuck in the air, and make a spectacular splash.', controls:'Press Action at the bottom of a bounce; hold to tuck.'},\n    {id:'finale', name:'The Big Stand', day:5, coach:'Pip', place:'Sunset Bay', length:90, description:'The whole island is watching. Breathe, pose, step, brace, and finally be still.', controls:'Follow each phase. During Long Stillness, do nothing.'}\n  ];\n  const medley = ['paddle','tide','dive'];\n  const goals = [3,5,7,9,0];\n  const keys = new Set();\n  const storage = 'wii-fit-together-v1';\n  let saved = readStorage();\n  let settings = Object.assign({music:0.1, sound:true, glyph:'PlayStation'}, saved.settings || {});\n  let state = {screen:'title', previous:'title', slot:null, profile:null, setup:{name:'Alex',skin:0,outfit:0}, round:null, paused:false, together:null, hub:null, lastInput:performance.now(), device:'keyboard', attract:false, message:'', returnScreen:'title'};\n  let center = {x:0,y:0,vx:0,vy:0}, aim = {x:0,y:0}, mouseAim = null, mouseHeld = false, previousButtons = [], audio, musicClock = 0, lastFrame = performance.now(), lastHubUpdate = 0, lastHubProgress = 0;\n  let viewport = {width:0,height:0,scale:1,ox:0,oy:0};\n\n  function readStorage() { try { return JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(storage) || '{}'); } catch (_) { return {}; } }\n  function save() { try { saved.settings = settings; saved.slots ||= [null,null,null,null]; if (state.profile && state.slot !== null) saved.slots[state.slot] = state.profile; localStorage.setItem(storage, JSON.stringify(saved)); } catch (_) {} }\n  function esc(value) { return String(value).replace(/[&<>\"']/g, character => ({'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','\"':'&quot;',\"'\":'&#39;'}[character])); }\n  function clamp(value, min, max) { return Math.max(min, Math.min(max, value)); }\n  function smooth(value, target, rate, dt) { return value + (target-value) * Math.min(1,rate*dt); }\n  function markInput(device) { const needsRender = state.attract || (!state.hasHardwareInput && (device === 'keyboard' || device === 'gamepad')); state.device = device; state.lastInput = performance.now(); if (device === 'keyboard' || device === 'gamepad') state.hasHardwareInput = true; if (needsRender) { state.attract = false; render(); } }\n  function sound(frequency=440, length=.08, type='sine', volume=.06) {\n    if (!settings.sound) return;\n    try { audio ||= new (window.AudioContext || window.webkitAudioContext)(); if (audio.state === 'suspended') audio.resume(); const oscillator=audio.createOscillator(), gain=audio.createGain(); oscillator.type=type; oscillator.frequency.value=frequency; gain.gain.setValueAtTime(volume,audio.currentTime); gain.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(.001,audio.currentTime+length); oscillator.connect(gain).connect(audio.destination); oscillator.start(); oscillator.stop(audio.currentTime+length); } catch (_) {}\n  }\n  function voice() { [490,610,520].forEach((tone,index) => setTimeout(() => sound(tone,.07,'sine',.025),index*75)); }\n  function music(dt) { if (!audio || !settings.music || document.hidden) return; musicClock -= dt; if (musicClock <= 0) { musicClock=.48; const notes=[261.63,329.63,392,329.63,293.66,349.23,440,349.23]; const index=Math.floor(performance.now()/480)%notes.length; try { const oscillator=audio.createOscillator(), gain=audio.createGain(); oscillator.type='sine'; oscillator.frequency.value=notes[index]; gain.gain.setValueAtTime(settings.music*.07,audio.currentTime); gain.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(.001,audio.currentTime+.32); oscillator.connect(gain).connect(audio.destination); oscillator.start(); oscillator.stop(audio.currentTime+.32); } catch (_) {} } }\n  function button(label, action, extra='', subtitle='') { return `<button class=\"button ${extra}\" data-action=\"${action}\">${label}${subtitle ? `<small>${subtitle}</small>` : ''}</button>`; }\n  function header(right='A little balance goes a long way') { return `<div class=\"topbar\"><div class=\"logo\">TIPPY <i>✳</i> CAY</div><span class=\"pill\"><span class=\"sun-dot\"></span>${esc(right)}</span></div>`; }\n  function shell(content, right) { return `<div class=\"screen\">${header(right)}${content}</div>`; }\n  function modal(title, eyebrow, content, back='title') { return shell(`<div class=\"panel-wrap\"><section class=\"panel\"><div class=\"panel-head\"><div><div class=\"eyebrow\">${eyebrow}</div><h2>${title}</h2></div><button class=\"close\" data-action=\"${back}\" aria-label=\"Back\">×</button></div>${content}</section></div>`); }\n  function profileName() { return state.profile ? state.profile.name : 'Guest'; }\n  function profileDay() { return state.profile ? clamp(state.profile.day,1,5) : 1; }\n  function eventById(id) { return events.find(item => item.id === id); }\n  function unlocked(item) { return state.profile && (state.profile.freePlay || item.day <= state.profile.day); }\n  function formatScore(score) { return Math.round(score).toLocaleString(); }\n\n  function render() {\n    let html = '';\n    if (state.screen === 'title') {\n      const hasSave = (saved.slots || []).some(Boolean);\n      html = shell(`<div class=\"title-layout\"><section class=\"title-panel\"><div class=\"overline\">A rather uplifting island escape</div><h1>Wii Fit<br><span>Together.</span></h1><p class=\"lede\">Welcome to Tippy Cay, where the sea is calm, the company is questionable, and balance is a journey.</p><div class=\"title-actions\">${button('New Stay','slots-new','primary','A five-day island adventure')}${button('Continue','slots-continue','',hasSave?'Welcome back to the island':'Choose a guest to continue')}${button('Play Together','together','coral','Local or AI Hub medley')}${button('Settings','settings','', 'Controls, sound & accessibility')}</div></section><aside class=\"hero-note\"><b>A note from Pip</b>“We believe in you.<br>Gravity has declined to comment.”</aside></div><div class=\"footer\"><span>✳ AN ORIGINAL TIPPY CAY GETAWAY</span><div><button class=\"pill\" data-action=\"about\">About this game</button> <span class=\"hint\">WASD / arrows · Space · Controller</span></div></div>`, 'THE ISLAND IS OPEN');\n    } else if (state.screen === 'slots') {\n      const slots = saved.slots || [null,null,null,null];\n      html = modal(state.slotMode === 'new' ? 'Choose a guest' : 'Welcome back', 'THE GUEST BOOK', `<p>Every guest gets a little corner of the island. Choose an empty book to begin.</p><div class=\"cards\">${slots.map((guest,index) => `<button class=\"card\" data-action=\"slot:${index}\"><strong>${guest ? esc(guest.name) : 'Guest '+(index+1)+' · Empty'}</strong><small>${guest ? `Day ${guest.day} · ${guest.minutesTotal || 0} minutes banked` : 'Ready for a new stay'}</small></button>`).join('')}</div><p class=\"tiny\">Your progress stays in this browser on this device.</p>`);\n    } else if (state.screen === 'customize') {\n      html = modal('Make yourself at home','YOUR ISLAND LOOK', `<p>Pick a name and an outfit. Your look is always welcome here.</p><label class=\"field\">Guest name<select id=\"guest-name\">${names.map(name=>`<option ${name === state.setup.name ? 'selected' : ''}>${name}</option>`).join('')}</select></label><div class=\"field\">Skin tone<div class=\"swatches\">${skins.map((color,index)=>`<button class=\"swatch ${index===state.setup.skin?'selected':''}\" style=\"background:${color}\" data-action=\"skin:${index}\" aria-label=\"Skin tone ${index+1}\"></button>`).join('')}</div></div><div class=\"field\">Outfit color<div class=\"swatches\">${outfits.map((color,index)=>`<button class=\"swatch ${index===state.setup.outfit?'selected':''}\" style=\"background:${color}\" data-action=\"outfit:${index}\" aria-label=\"Outfit color ${index+1}\"></button>`).join('')}</div></div><div class=\"row\">${button('Back','slots-new')}${button('Arrive on the island','create-guest','primary')}</div>`, 'slots-new');\n    } else if (state.screen === 'intro') {\n      html = modal(`Welcome, ${esc(profileName())}!`,'A WORD FROM PIP', `<div class=\"dialogue\"><span class=\"speaker\">PIP · RECEPTION CUSHION</span><p>“I’m Pip. I run reception, mostly by remaining in one place. You’ll fit right in.”</p><p>Each morning starts with a Wobble Check. Try activities, collect minutes for the giant clam, and take the week at your own pace.</p></div><div class=\"row\">${button('Let’s explore','island','primary')}</div>`);\n    } else if (state.screen === 'island') {\n      const guest=state.profile, day=profileDay(), goal=goals[day-1];\n      const available=events.filter(item=>unlocked(item));\n      html = shell(`<div class=\"island-layout\"><section class=\"island-panel\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">HELLO, ${esc(guest.name.toUpperCase())} · ${guest.freePlay?'FREE PLAY':'YOUR ISLAND STAY'}</div><h2>Find your<br>happy wobble.</h2><div class=\"dayline\"><span>DAY ${day} / 5</span><span>✳ ${guest.dayMinutes || 0} / ${goal || '∞'} MIN</span><span>★ ${guest.stars || 0} STARS</span></div><p class=\"island-note\">${guest.checked ? `Pip says your Balance Age is ${guest.age}. The clam looks impressed.` : 'Pip is waiting for your morning Wobble Check.'}</p><div class=\"activity-list\">${!guest.checked ? `<button class=\"activity highlight\" data-action=\"check\"><span>◉</span><strong>Morning Wobble Check<small>Say hello to Pip · about a minute</small></strong><b>→</b></button>` : ''}${available.map(item=>`<button class=\"activity\" data-action=\"intro:${item.id}\"><span>${item.day===4?'≈':item.day===3?'✳':item.day===5?'★':'◌'}</span><strong>${item.name}<small>${item.place} · ${item.coach}</small></strong><b>→</b></button>`).join('')}</div><div class=\"row island-actions\">${button('Guest book','calendar')}${button(day===5?'Finish the stay':'Call it a day','end-day','primary')}</div></section></div><div class=\"footer\"><span>MINUTE CLAM: ${guest.minutesTotal || 0} MINUTES SAVED</span><button class=\"pill\" data-action=\"settings\">Settings</button></div>`, guest.freePlay ? 'FREE PLAY' : `DAY ${day} OF 5`);\n    } else if (state.screen === 'calendar') {\n      const guest=state.profile;\n      html = modal('Your island log','THE GUEST BOOK', `<p>Every visit is worth a stamp. Your best moments stay right here.</p><div class=\"cards\">${[1,2,3,4,5].map(day=>`<div class=\"card\"><strong>${day < guest.day || guest.freePlay ? '✓' : '○'} Day ${day}</strong><small>${day===guest.day&&!guest.freePlay?'Currently exploring':day < guest.day || guest.freePlay?'A day well spent':'A day to look forward to'}</small></div>`).join('')}</div><p>Balance Age: <strong>${guest.age ?? 'not checked yet'}</strong> · Total: <strong>${guest.minutesTotal || 0} minutes</strong></p><div class=\"row\">${button('Back to the island','island','primary')}</div>`, 'island');\n    } else if (state.screen === 'eventIntro') {\n      const item=eventById(state.eventId);\n      html = modal(item.name, `${esc(item.place.toUpperCase())} · WITH ${esc(item.coach.toUpperCase())}`, `<div class=\"dialogue\"><span class=\"speaker\">${esc(item.coach.toUpperCase())} SAYS</span><p>“${esc(item.description)}”</p></div><p><strong>How to play:</strong> ${esc(item.controls)}</p><p>Move with WASD, arrows, a controller stick, or your mouse. Action is Space, Enter, controller south button, or click.</p><div class=\"row\">${button('Not yet','cancel-event')}${button('I’m ready','begin-event','primary')}</div>`, 'cancel-event');\n    } else if (state.screen === 'checkIntro') {\n      html = modal('Morning Wobble Check','PIP · RECEPTION CUSHION', `<div class=\"dialogue\"><p>“This is not a test of your worth. It is a test of whether the dot stays near the middle.”</p></div><p>Four little checks: stand still, lean toward targets, close your eyes, and alternate steps. Your Balance Age is a playful score, not medical advice.</p><div class=\"row\">${button('Back','island')}${button('Begin the check','begin-check','primary')}</div>`, 'island');\n    } else if (state.screen === 'event' || state.screen === 'check') {\n      const round=state.round;\n      html = shell(`<div class=\"hud\"><div><div class=\"eyebrow\">${esc(round.place.toUpperCase())}</div><h2 id=\"round-name\">${esc(round.name)}</h2><div id=\"round-subtitle\">${esc(round.instruction)}</div></div><div class=\"hud-right\"><div class=\"pill\" id=\"timer\">${Math.ceil(round.length)}s</div><button class=\"pill\" data-action=\"pause\">Ⅱ Pause</button></div></div><div class=\"event-center\"><div class=\"phase-card\" id=\"phase-card\">${esc(round.instruction)}</div></div><div class=\"event-bottom\"><div class=\"puck\" aria-label=\"Balance puck\"><div class=\"target\" id=\"target\"></div><div class=\"dot\" id=\"dot\"></div></div><div class=\"meter\"><div><strong id=\"round-score\">0</strong> <span id=\"score-label\">POINTS</span></div><div class=\"meter-track\"><div id=\"meter-fill\"></div></div><small id=\"round-help\">${esc(round.controls)}</small></div></div>`, state.together ? `PLAYER ${state.together.player+1} · MEDLEY` : 'FIND YOUR BALANCE');\n      if (state.paused) html += `<div class=\"overlay\"><section class=\"panel narrow\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">TAKE YOUR TIME</div><h2>Paused.</h2><p>${state.together?.online?'The online round continues in the background.':'The island isn’t going anywhere.'}</p><div class=\"row\">${button('Resume','resume','primary')}${button('Settings','settings')}${state.together?.online?'':button('Leave activity','leave-event')}</div>${state.together?.online?'':`<details><summary>Developer tuning</summary><label class=\"field\">Spring stiffness<input id=\"dev-stiffness\" type=\"range\" min=\"10\" max=\"80\" value=\"${state.stiffness ?? 40}\"></label><label class=\"field\">Damping<input id=\"dev-damping\" type=\"range\" min=\"2\" max=\"20\" value=\"${state.damping ?? 8.5}\" step=\".5\"></label><label class=\"field\">Wobble<input id=\"dev-wobble\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\".4\" value=\"${state.wobble ?? .12}\" step=\".01\"></label><label class=\"field\">Time scale<input id=\"dev-timeScale\" type=\"range\" min=\".25\" max=\"4\" value=\"${state.timeScale ?? 1}\" step=\".25\"></label><div class=\"row\">${button('Reset tuning','reset-tuning')}${button('Finish activity now','finish-now')}${!state.together?button('Give 5 minutes','give-minutes'):''}</div></details>`}</section></div>`;\n    else if (action==='together') { state.together=null; setScreen('together'); }\n    else if (action.startsWith('hotseat:')) { state.together={count:Number(action.slice(8)),player:0,event:0,scores:[0,0,0,0],online:false,ghosts:{}}; setScreen('handoff'); }\n    else if (action==='hotseat-next') { state.eventId=medley[state.together.event]; setScreen('eventIntro'); }\n    else if (action==='settings') { state.returnScreen=state.screen; setScreen('settings'); }\n    else if (action==='settings-back') setScreen(state.returnScreen || 'title');\n    else if (action==='about') setScreen('about');\n    else if (action==='hub-ready') { if(hub) hub.ready(); state.message='Ready! Waiting for the other guests.'; render(); }\n  }\n\n  function startCheck() { center={x:0,y:0,vx:0,vy:0}; aim={x:0,y:0}; state.paused=false; state.round={name:'Morning Wobble Check',place:'Stillness Studio',instruction:'Stand still. This is the whole test.',controls:'Keep the dot near the center.',length:37,elapsed:0,sum:0,samples:0,actionHits:0,actionCount:0,targets:0,phase:0,steps:0,lastStep:'',metric:[0,0,0,0],phaseSamples:[0,0,0,0]}; setScreen('check'); }\n  function startRound(id) { const item=eventById(id); if(!item) return; center={x:0,y:0,vx:0,vy:0}; aim={x:0,y:0}; lastHubUpdate=0; lastHubProgress=0; state.paused=false; state.round={...item,instruction:item.controls,elapsed:0,sum:0,samples:0,actionHits:0,actionCount:0,steps:0,lastStep:'',shellX:0,shellY:0,shellVx:0,shellVy:0,potted:0,spin:0,prevAngle:0,gates:0,gateIndex:-1,stillBroken:false,ghostTrail:[]}; setScreen('event'); if(state.together?.online && hub) hub.progress({score:state.together.scores[0],label:`${item.name}: starting`}); }\n  function triggerAction(side='action') {\n    if (!state.round || !['event','check'].includes(state.screen) || state.paused) return;\n    const round=state.round, time=round.elapsed;\n    if (round.id==='finale' && time>60) round.stillBroken=true;\n    round.actionCount++;\n    if (side==='left' || side==='right') { if (round.lastStep!==side) {round.steps++; round.lastStep=side;} }\n    if (round.id==='squat' || round.id==='step' || round.id==='lap' || round.id==='dive' || state.screen==='check') {\n      const interval=round.id==='dive'?1.2:round.id==='step'?.625:.6;\n      const phase=time%interval; if(Math.min(phase,interval-phase)<.22) round.actionHits++;\n      sound(round.id==='dive'?240:420,.09,'sine',.045);\n    } else sound(360,.06,'sine',.03);\n  }\n  function finishCheck() {\n    const round=state.round;\n    const metric=round.metric.map((value,index)=>round.phaseSamples[index] ? value/round.phaseSamples[index] : 0);\n    metric[3]=clamp(round.steps/8,0,1)*.6 + clamp(round.actionHits/8,0,1)*.4;\n    const skill=.30*metric[0]+.25*metric[1]+.25*metric[2]+.20*metric[3];\n    const age=Math.round(clamp(24+56*Math.pow(1-clamp(skill,0,1),1.1)-2*(profileDay()-1)-Math.min((state.profile.stars||0)/3,8),18,99));\n    state.profile.checked=true; state.profile.age=age; save();\n    state.result={isCheck:true,age,stars:skill>.8?3:skill>.5?2:1,comment:'A number! We can put it on a postcard. The important part is that you showed up.'}; voice(); setScreen('result');\n  }\n  function finishRound() {\n    const round=state.round; let score=Math.round(clamp(round.sum/Math.max(round.samples,1),0,1)*1000);\n    if (round.id==='tide') score=Math.round(clamp(round.potted*200+score*.4,0,1000));\n    if (round.id==='paddle') score=Math.round(clamp(round.gates*125+score*.3,0,1000));\n    if (round.id==='dive') score=Math.round(clamp(score*.5+Math.min(round.actionHits,8)*65,0,1000));\n    if (round.id==='finale' && !round.stillBroken) score=Math.min(1000,score+100);\n    const stars=score>=850?3:score>=650?2:score>=400?1:0;\n    let banked=0;\n    if(state.together) { state.together.scores[state.together.player]+=score; if(state.together.online && hub) hub.progress({score:state.together.scores[0],label:`${round.name}: ${score}`}); }\n    else if (state.profile) { const guest=state.profile; guest.clearedToday=guest.clearedToday||{}; banked=guest.clearedToday[round.id]?1:1+stars; guest.clearedToday[round.id]=true; guest.dayMinutes=(guest.dayMinutes||0)+banked; guest.minutesTotal=(guest.minutesTotal||0)+banked; guest.stars=(guest.stars||0)+stars; guest.bests[round.id]=Math.max(guest.bests[round.id]||0,score); if(round.id==='finale') {guest.finaleDone=true;guest.age=Math.max(18,Math.round((guest.age||60)-score/100));} save(); }\n    state.result={isCheck:false,name:round.name,score,stars,comment:`${titles[Math.min(titles.length-1,Math.floor(score/1000*titles.length))]}. We’ve banked ${state.together?'your points':`${banked} minute${banked===1?'':'s'} in the clam`}.`}; state.paused=false; sound(660,.25,'sine'); voice(); setScreen('result');\n    if(state.together?.online) setTimeout(()=>{if(state.screen==='result' && state.round===round && state.together?.online) advanceResult();},1500);\n  }\n  function advanceResult() {\n    if(!state.together) {setScreen('island');return;}\n    const group=state.together; group.event++;\n    if(group.online) { if(group.event>=3) reportHub(); else {state.eventId=medley[group.event];startRound(state.eventId);} return; }\n    if(group.event>=3) {group.event=0;group.player++;}\n    if(group.player>=group.count) setScreen('podium'); else setScreen('handoff');\n  }\n  function reportHub() { if(!state.together || !state.together.online) return; const score=clamp(Math.round(state.together.scores[0]),0,3000); if(hub && !state.together.reported) {state.together.reported=true;hub.result({score,stats:{events:Math.min(3,state.together.event)},awards:[{name:'Island Enthusiast',description:'Completed the Tippy Cay medley.'}]});} state.message=`Medley complete: ${formatScore(score)} points. Waiting for the group.`;setScreen('waiting'); }\n\n  function updateInput(dt) {\n    let x=(keys.has('arrowright')||keys.has('d')?1:0)-(keys.has('arrowleft')||keys.has('a')?1:0), y=(keys.has('arrowdown')||keys.has('s')?1:0)-(keys.has('arrowup')||keys.has('w')?1:0);\n    let gamepad=null; try { gamepad=Array.from(navigator.getGamepads?.()||[]).find(Boolean); } catch (_) {}\n    if(gamepad) {\n      const dead=value=>Math.abs(value)<.12?0:Math.sign(value)*Math.pow((Math.abs(value)-.12)/.88,1.5);\n      const gx=dead(gamepad.axes[0]||0), gy=dead(gamepad.axes[1]||0); if(Math.abs(gx)+Math.abs(gy)>.03) {x=gx;y=gy;markInput('gamepad');state.hasHardwareInput=true;}\n      const pressed=gamepad.buttons.map(item=>item.pressed);\n      for(const index of [0,9,12,13,14,15]) if(pressed[index]&&!previousButtons[index]) { markInput('gamepad');state.hasHardwareInput=true; if(index===9){if(['event','check'].includes(state.screen)) selectAction(state.paused?'resume':'pause');} else if(['event','check'].includes(state.screen)&&!state.paused) triggerAction(index===14?'left':index===15?'right':'action'); else if(index===0) { const focused=document.activeElement; if(focused && focused.tagName==='BUTTON') focused.click(); else app.querySelector('button:not([disabled])')?.focus(); } else if([12,13,14,15].includes(index)) moveFocus(index===12||index===14?-1:1); }\n      previousButtons=pressed;\n    }\n    if(state.paused && !state.together?.online) return;\n    const speed=keys.has('shift')?.5:1;\n    if(x||y) { aim.x=clamp(aim.x+x*1.6*dt*speed,-1,1); aim.y=clamp(aim.y+y*1.6*dt*speed,-1,1); }\n    else if(mouseAim && state.device==='mouse') { aim.x=mouseAim.x;aim.y=mouseAim.y; }\n    else {aim.x=smooth(aim.x,0,1.2,dt);aim.y=smooth(aim.y,0,1.2,dt);}\n    const round=state.round, time=round?.elapsed||0, wobble=state.wobble ?? .12;\n    const targetX=aim.x*.92+wobble*(Math.sin(time*2.13)*.6+Math.sin(time*3.71)*.4), targetY=aim.y*.92+wobble*(Math.sin(time*1.79)*.6+Math.sin(time*3.31)*.4);\n    const stiffness=state.stiffness||40, damping=state.damping||8.5;\n    center.vx+=((targetX-center.x)*stiffness-center.vx*damping)*dt;center.vy+=((targetY-center.y)*stiffness-center.vy*damping)*dt;\n    center.x=clamp(center.x+center.vx*dt,-1.2,1.2);center.y=clamp(center.y+center.vy*dt,-1.2,1.2);\n  }\n  function heldAction() { try { const gamepad=Array.from(navigator.getGamepads?.()||[]).find(Boolean);return mouseHeld||keys.has(' ')||keys.has('enter')||!!gamepad?.buttons[0]?.pressed; } catch (_) { return mouseHeld||keys.has(' '); } }\n  function tickRound(dt) {\n    const round=state.round, online=!!state.together?.online, onlineSettings=online && state.screen==='settings' && state.returnScreen==='event'; if(!round || (state.paused && !online) || (!['event','check'].includes(state.screen) && !onlineSettings)) return;\n    round.elapsed+=dt; const time=round.elapsed;\n    let quality=clamp(1-Math.hypot(center.x,center.y)*.8,0,1), targetX=0,targetY=0, instruction=round.controls;\n    if(state.screen==='check') {\n      const phase=time<8?0:time<23?1:time<29?2:3;round.phase=phase;\n      if(phase===1) {targetX=[-.7,.7,-.7][Math.min(2,Math.floor((time-8)/5))];quality=clamp(1-Math.abs(center.x-targetX),0,1);instruction='Lean into the target ring.';}\n      else if(phase===2) instruction='Eyes closed. Trust the sound and find your center.';\n      else if(phase===3) instruction='Alternate left and right steps to the beat.';\n      else instruction='Stand still. This is the whole test.';\n      round.metric[phase]+=quality;round.phaseSamples[phase]++;\n    } else {\n      if(round.id==='breath') { const inhale=(time%8)<4;quality=(heldAction()===inhale)?1:.15;instruction=inhale?'Breathe in · hold Action':'Breathe out · release Action'; }\n      else if(round.id==='pose') { targetX=Math.sin(time*.58)*.55;targetY=Math.cos(time*.43)*.25;quality=clamp(1-Math.hypot(center.x-targetX,center.y-targetY),0,1);instruction='Follow the drifting ring.'; }\n      else if(round.id==='squat') {quality=clamp(round.actionHits/Math.max(1,time/.6)*1.1,0,1)*.7+quality*.3;instruction='Press Action as the beat lands.';}\n      else if(round.id==='plank') { quality=quality*(heldAction()?1:.35);instruction='Hold Action. Be one with the plank.'; }\n      else if(round.id==='step'||round.id==='lap') {quality=clamp(round.steps/Math.max(1,time/.625),0,1)*.65+clamp(round.actionHits/Math.max(1,round.actionCount),0,1)*.35;instruction='Alternate Left and Right on the beat.';}\n      else if(round.id==='spin') {const angle=Math.atan2(center.y,center.x);let diff=angle-round.prevAngle;while(diff>Math.PI)diff-=Math.PI*2;while(diff<-Math.PI)diff+=Math.PI*2;round.prevAngle=angle;round.spin=smooth(round.spin,Math.abs(diff)/Math.max(dt,.001),3,dt);quality=clamp(round.spin/4,0,1)*(Math.hypot(center.x,center.y)>.25?1:.3);instruction='Circle your lean. Keep the floaties moving!';}\n      else if(round.id==='tide') {round.shellVx=(round.shellVx+center.x*dt*.9)*Math.exp(-1.6*dt);round.shellVy=(round.shellVy+center.y*dt*.9)*Math.exp(-1.6*dt);round.shellX=clamp(round.shellX+round.shellVx*dt,-.9,.9);round.shellY=clamp(round.shellY+round.shellVy*dt,-.9,.9);targetX=Math.sin(round.potted*3)*.6;targetY=Math.cos(round.potted*2)*.55;if(Math.hypot(round.shellX-targetX,round.shellY-targetY)<.16){round.potted++;round.shellX=0;round.shellY=0;sound(780,.12);}quality=clamp(1-Math.hypot(round.shellX-targetX,round.shellY-targetY)*.5,0,1);instruction=`Shells in pools: ${round.potted} · Tilt toward the pool.`;}\n      else if(round.id==='paddle') {targetX=Math.sin(Math.floor(time/4.5)*1.9)*.65;quality=clamp(1-Math.abs(center.x-targetX),0,1);const gate=Math.floor(time/4.5);if(gate!==round.gateIndex){round.gateIndex=gate;if(quality>.63)round.gates++;}instruction=`Gates cleared: ${round.gates} · Steer to the ring.`;}\n      else if(round.id==='tray') {quality=clamp(quality-.08*Math.abs(Math.sin(time*1.7)),0,1);instruction='Keep the smoothies aboard.';}\n      else if(round.id==='dive') {quality=clamp(round.actionHits/Math.max(1,time/1.2)*1.5,0,1)*.7+(heldAction()?.3:0);instruction='Press at the bottom of the bounce; hold to tuck.';}\n      else if(round.id==='finale') {if(time<16){instruction=(time%8)<4?'Breathe in · hold Action':'Breathe out · release Action';quality=(heldAction()===((time%8)<4))?1:.2;}else if(time<36){targetX=Math.sin(time*.5)*.5;quality=clamp(1-Math.abs(center.x-targetX),0,1);instruction='Follow the pose through the breeze.';}else if(time<48){quality=clamp(round.steps/Math.max(1,(time-36)/.625),0,1);instruction='Step with the island marching band.';}else if(time<60){quality*=heldAction()?1:.3;instruction='Brace against the waves. Hold Action.';}else{instruction=time>75?'Press Action to skip? Or simply stay.':'The Long Stillness. Do nothing.';quality=round.stillBroken?.2:1;}}\n      round.sum+=quality;round.samples++;\n    }\n    const dot=document.getElementById('dot'), target=document.getElementById('target');\n    if(dot){dot.style.transform=`translate(${center.x*43}px,${center.y*43}px)`;dot.style.opacity=state.screen==='check'&&round.phase===2?'0':'1';}\n    if(target){target.style.transform=`translate(${targetX*43}px,${targetY*43}px)`;target.style.opacity=state.screen==='check'&&round.phase===2?'0':'1';}\n    const timer=document.getElementById('timer'), subtitle=document.getElementById('round-subtitle'), phase=document.getElementById('phase-card'), score=document.getElementById('round-score'), fill=document.getElementById('meter-fill');\n    if(timer)timer.textContent=Math.max(0,Math.ceil(round.length-time))+'s';if(subtitle)subtitle.textContent=instruction;if(phase)phase.textContent=instruction;if(score)score.textContent=state.screen==='check'?['STILL','LEAN','LISTEN','STEP'][round.phase]:formatScore(round.sum/Math.max(1,round.samples)*1000);if(fill)fill.style.width=clamp(time/round.length*100,0,100)+'%';\n    if(state.together?.online && hub && time-lastHubUpdate>.1){lastHubUpdate=time;hub.send({event:state.together.event,x:center.x,y:center.y,progress:time/round.length},{reliable:false});}\n    if(state.together?.online && hub && time-lastHubProgress>=2){lastHubProgress=time;hub.progress({score:state.together.scores[0]+Math.round(clamp(round.sum/Math.max(round.samples,1),0,1)*1000),label:round.name});}\n    if(time>=round.length) { if(state.screen==='check')finishCheck();else finishRound(); }\n  }\n\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_553","type":"reasoning","text":"**Adding idle activity thresholds**\n**Checking scoring code**"}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_554","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"sed -n '110,205p' 'Wii Fit Together-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-222701/web/game.js'; sed -n '209,265p' 'Wii Fit Together-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-222701/web/game.js'; sed -n '35,115p' PLAN.md; sed -n '120,210p' 'Wii Fit Together-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-222701/tests/test_game.py'\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_554","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"sed -n '110,205p' 'Wii Fit Together-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-222701/web/game.js'; sed -n '209,265p' 'Wii Fit Together-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-222701/web/game.js'; sed -n '35,115p' PLAN.md; sed -n '120,210p' 'Wii Fit Together-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-222701/tests/test_game.py'\"","aggregated_output":"      html = modal('About this game','THE FINE PRINT', `<p>Made with Shardfall and an original island full of questionable advice.</p>${blocks.map(([label,value])=>`<h3>${esc(label)}</h3><div class=\"about-list\">${Array.isArray(value)?value.map(line=>`<p>${esc(line)}</p>`).join(''):Object.entries(value||{}).map(([key,line])=>`<p><strong>${esc(key)}:</strong> ${esc(line)}</p>`).join('')}</div>`).join('')}<h3>Library credits</h3><div class=\"about-list\"><p>Shardfall core assets: Shardfall contributors (CC0 1.0).</p><p>100STYLE motion: Mason, Starke and Komura (CC BY 4.0).</p><p>Mesh2Motion and its contributors; Universal Animation Libraries 1 and 2 by Quaternius (CC0 1.0).</p><p>CMU Graphics Lab Motion Capture Database: free to use, copy, modify and redistribute; the data may not be resold, even in converted form.</p><p>The interface uses system fonts. Shardfall's embedded egui fonts include Hack, Noto Emoji, Ubuntu Light and Emoji Icon Font.</p></div><details class=\"licenses\"><summary>Font license texts</summary>${Object.entries(window.__licenseData || {}).map(([label,text])=>`<h4>${esc(label)}</h4><pre>${esc(text)}</pre>`).join('')}</details><div class=\"row\">${button('Back to the island','title','primary')}</div>`);\n    }\n    if (state.attract && state.screen==='title') html += `<div class=\"attract-label\">A LITTLE ISLAND DAYDREAM · PRESS ANY KEY TO RETURN</div>`;\n    if (isTouchOnly() && !state.hasHardwareInput && !['settings','about'].includes(state.screen)) html += `<div class=\"touch-guard\"><div><strong>Controller or keyboard required</strong><p>Connect one to play. The island will wait for you.</p><button class=\"button\" data-action=\"settings\">Settings</button></div></div>`;\n    app.innerHTML = html;\n    const musicInput=document.getElementById('music');\n    if (musicInput) musicInput.addEventListener('input', event=>{ settings.music=Number(event.target.value)/100; document.getElementById('music-value').textContent=Math.round(settings.music*100)+'%'; save(); });\n    const soundInput=document.getElementById('sound');\n    if (soundInput) soundInput.addEventListener('change', event=>{ settings.sound=event.target.value==='on'; save(); });\n    const glyphInput=document.getElementById('glyph');\n    if (glyphInput) glyphInput.addEventListener('change', event=>{ settings.glyph=event.target.value; save(); render(); });\n    const nameInput=document.getElementById('guest-name');\n    if (nameInput) nameInput.addEventListener('change', event=>{ state.setup.name=event.target.value; });\n    for (const kind of ['stiffness','damping','wobble','timeScale']) { const input=document.getElementById('dev-'+kind); if(input) input.addEventListener('input', event=>{state[kind]=Number(event.target.value);}); }\n  }\n\n  function isTouchOnly() { return matchMedia('(pointer: coarse)').matches && !matchMedia('(any-pointer: fine)').matches; }\n  function newProfile() { return {name:state.setup.name,skin:state.setup.skin,outfit:state.setup.outfit,day:1,dayMinutes:0,minutesTotal:0,stars:0,age:null,checked:false,finaleDone:false,freePlay:false,bests:{},clearedToday:{},lastDate:new Date().toISOString().slice(0,10)}; }\n  function setScreen(screen) { state.screen=screen; render(); }\n  function selectAction(action) {\n    if (!action) return;\n    sound(520,.05);\n    if (action === 'title') { state.paused=false; state.together=null; state.round=null; setScreen('title'); }\n    else if (action === 'slots-new' || action === 'slots-continue') { state.slotMode=action==='slots-new'?'new':'continue'; setScreen('slots'); }\n    else if (action.startsWith('slot:')) { const index=Number(action.slice(5)), guest=(saved.slots||[])[index]; state.slot=index; if (guest) { state.profile=guest; setScreen('island'); } else { state.setup={name:names[index],skin:index%skins.length,outfit:index%outfits.length}; setScreen('customize'); } }\n    else if (action.startsWith('skin:')) { state.setup.skin=Number(action.slice(5)); render(); }\n    else if (action.startsWith('outfit:')) { state.setup.outfit=Number(action.slice(7)); render(); }\n    else if (action==='create-guest') { state.profile=newProfile(); save(); voice(); setScreen('intro'); }\n    else if (action==='island') { if (state.profile) {state.paused=false;setScreen('island');} else setScreen('title'); }\n    else if (action==='calendar') setScreen('calendar');\n    else if (action==='check') { voice(); setScreen('checkIntro'); }\n    else if (action==='begin-check') startCheck();\n    else if (action.startsWith('intro:')) { state.eventId=action.slice(6); voice(); setScreen('eventIntro'); }\n    else if (action==='cancel-event') setScreen(state.together?'handoff':'island');\n    else if (action==='begin-event') startRound(state.eventId);\n    else if (action==='pause') { state.paused=true; render(); }\n    else if (action==='resume') { state.paused=false; render(); }\n    else if (action==='reset-tuning') { state.stiffness=40; state.damping=8.5; state.wobble=.12; state.timeScale=1; render(); }\n    else if (action==='finish-now') { state.paused=false; if(state.screen==='check') finishCheck(); else finishRound(); }\n    else if (action==='give-minutes') { if(state.profile && !state.together) {state.profile.dayMinutes=(state.profile.dayMinutes||0)+5;state.profile.minutesTotal=(state.profile.minutesTotal||0)+5;save();} render(); }\n    else if (action==='leave-event') { state.paused=false; if (state.together && state.together.online) reportHub(); else setScreen(state.together?'handoff':'island'); }\n    else if (action==='result-next') advanceResult();\n    else if (action==='end-day') setScreen('endDay');\n    else if (action==='sleep') { if (state.profile.day===5) setScreen('ending'); else { state.profile.day++; state.profile.dayMinutes=0; state.profile.clearedToday={}; state.profile.checked=false; state.profile.lastDate=new Date().toISOString().slice(0,10); save(); setScreen('island'); } }\n    else if (action==='free-play') { state.profile.freePlay=true; save(); setScreen('island'); }\n    else if (action==='together') { state.together=null; setScreen('together'); }\n    else if (action.startsWith('hotseat:')) { state.together={count:Number(action.slice(8)),player:0,event:0,scores:[0,0,0,0],online:false,ghosts:{}}; setScreen('handoff'); }\n    else if (action==='hotseat-next') { state.eventId=medley[state.together.event]; setScreen('eventIntro'); }\n    else if (action==='settings') { state.returnScreen=state.screen; setScreen('settings'); }\n    else if (action==='settings-back') setScreen(state.returnScreen || 'title');\n    else if (action==='about') setScreen('about');\n    else if (action==='hub-ready') { if(hub) hub.ready(); state.message='Ready! Waiting for the other guests.'; render(); }\n  }\n\n  function startCheck() { center={x:0,y:0,vx:0,vy:0}; aim={x:0,y:0}; state.paused=false; state.round={name:'Morning Wobble Check',place:'Stillness Studio',instruction:'Stand still. This is the whole test.',controls:'Keep the dot near the center.',length:37,elapsed:0,sum:0,samples:0,actionHits:0,actionCount:0,targets:0,phase:0,steps:0,lastStep:'',metric:[0,0,0,0],phaseSamples:[0,0,0,0]}; setScreen('check'); }\n  function startRound(id) { const item=eventById(id); if(!item) return; center={x:0,y:0,vx:0,vy:0}; aim={x:0,y:0}; lastHubUpdate=0; lastHubProgress=0; state.paused=false; state.round={...item,instruction:item.controls,elapsed:0,sum:0,samples:0,actionHits:0,actionCount:0,steps:0,lastStep:'',shellX:0,shellY:0,shellVx:0,shellVy:0,potted:0,spin:0,prevAngle:0,gates:0,gateIndex:-1,stillBroken:false,ghostTrail:[]}; setScreen('event'); if(state.together?.online && hub) hub.progress({score:state.together.scores[0],label:`${item.name}: starting`}); }\n  function triggerAction(side='action') {\n    if (!state.round || !['event','check'].includes(state.screen) || state.paused) return;\n    const round=state.round, time=round.elapsed;\n    if (round.id==='finale' && time>60) round.stillBroken=true;\n    round.actionCount++;\n    if (side==='left' || side==='right') { if (round.lastStep!==side) {round.steps++; round.lastStep=side;} }\n    if (round.id==='squat' || round.id==='step' || round.id==='lap' || round.id==='dive' || state.screen==='check') {\n      const interval=round.id==='dive'?1.2:round.id==='step'?.625:.6;\n      const phase=time%interval; if(Math.min(phase,interval-phase)<.22) round.actionHits++;\n      sound(round.id==='dive'?240:420,.09,'sine',.045);\n    } else sound(360,.06,'sine',.03);\n  }\n  function finishCheck() {\n    const round=state.round;\n    const metric=round.metric.map((value,index)=>round.phaseSamples[index] ? value/round.phaseSamples[index] : 0);\n    metric[3]=clamp(round.steps/8,0,1)*.6 + clamp(round.actionHits/8,0,1)*.4;\n    const skill=.30*metric[0]+.25*metric[1]+.25*metric[2]+.20*metric[3];\n    const age=Math.round(clamp(24+56*Math.pow(1-clamp(skill,0,1),1.1)-2*(profileDay()-1)-Math.min((state.profile.stars||0)/3,8),18,99));\n    state.profile.checked=true; state.profile.age=age; save();\n    state.result={isCheck:true,age,stars:skill>.8?3:skill>.5?2:1,comment:'A number! We can put it on a postcard. The important part is that you showed up.'}; voice(); setScreen('result');\n  }\n  function finishRound() {\n    const round=state.round; let score=Math.round(clamp(round.sum/Math.max(round.samples,1),0,1)*1000);\n    if (round.id==='tide') score=Math.round(clamp(round.potted*200+score*.4,0,1000));\n    if (round.id==='paddle') score=Math.round(clamp(round.gates*125+score*.3,0,1000));\n    if (round.id==='dive') score=Math.round(clamp(score*.5+Math.min(round.actionHits,8)*65,0,1000));\n    if (round.id==='finale' && !round.stillBroken) score=Math.min(1000,score+100);\n    const stars=score>=850?3:score>=650?2:score>=400?1:0;\n    let banked=0;\n    if(state.together) { state.together.scores[state.together.player]+=score; if(state.together.online && hub) hub.progress({score:state.together.scores[0],label:`${round.name}: ${score}`}); }\n    else if (state.profile) { const guest=state.profile; guest.clearedToday=guest.clearedToday||{}; banked=guest.clearedToday[round.id]?1:1+stars; guest.clearedToday[round.id]=true; guest.dayMinutes=(guest.dayMinutes||0)+banked; guest.minutesTotal=(guest.minutesTotal||0)+banked; guest.stars=(guest.stars||0)+stars; guest.bests[round.id]=Math.max(guest.bests[round.id]||0,score); if(round.id==='finale') {guest.finaleDone=true;guest.age=Math.max(18,Math.round((guest.age||60)-score/100));} save(); }\n    state.result={isCheck:false,name:round.name,score,stars,comment:`${titles[Math.min(titles.length-1,Math.floor(score/1000*titles.length))]}. We’ve banked ${state.together?'your points':`${banked} minute${banked===1?'':'s'} in the clam`}.`}; state.paused=false; sound(660,.25,'sine'); voice(); setScreen('result');\n    if(state.together?.online) setTimeout(()=>{if(state.screen==='result' && state.round===round && state.together?.online) advanceResult();},1500);\n  }\n  function advanceResult() {\n    if(!state.together) {setScreen('island');return;}\n    const group=state.together; group.event++;\n    if(group.online) { if(group.event>=3) reportHub(); else {state.eventId=medley[group.event];startRound(state.eventId);} return; }\n    if(group.event>=3) {group.event=0;group.player++;}\n    if(group.player>=group.count) setScreen('podium'); else setScreen('handoff');\n  function updateInput(dt) {\n    let x=(keys.has('arrowright')||keys.has('d')?1:0)-(keys.has('arrowleft')||keys.has('a')?1:0), y=(keys.has('arrowdown')||keys.has('s')?1:0)-(keys.has('arrowup')||keys.has('w')?1:0);\n    let gamepad=null; try { gamepad=Array.from(navigator.getGamepads?.()||[]).find(Boolean); } catch (_) {}\n    if(gamepad) {\n      const dead=value=>Math.abs(value)<.12?0:Math.sign(value)*Math.pow((Math.abs(value)-.12)/.88,1.5);\n      const gx=dead(gamepad.axes[0]||0), gy=dead(gamepad.axes[1]||0); if(Math.abs(gx)+Math.abs(gy)>.03) {x=gx;y=gy;markInput('gamepad');state.hasHardwareInput=true;}\n      const pressed=gamepad.buttons.map(item=>item.pressed);\n      for(const index of [0,9,12,13,14,15]) if(pressed[index]&&!previousButtons[index]) { markInput('gamepad');state.hasHardwareInput=true; if(index===9){if(['event','check'].includes(state.screen)) selectAction(state.paused?'resume':'pause');} else if(['event','check'].includes(state.screen)&&!state.paused) triggerAction(index===14?'left':index===15?'right':'action'); else if(index===0) { const focused=document.activeElement; if(focused && focused.tagName==='BUTTON') focused.click(); else app.querySelector('button:not([disabled])')?.focus(); } else if([12,13,14,15].includes(index)) moveFocus(index===12||index===14?-1:1); }\n      previousButtons=pressed;\n    }\n    if(state.paused && !state.together?.online) return;\n    const speed=keys.has('shift')?.5:1;\n    if(x||y) { aim.x=clamp(aim.x+x*1.6*dt*speed,-1,1); aim.y=clamp(aim.y+y*1.6*dt*speed,-1,1); }\n    else if(mouseAim && state.device==='mouse') { aim.x=mouseAim.x;aim.y=mouseAim.y; }\n    else {aim.x=smooth(aim.x,0,1.2,dt);aim.y=smooth(aim.y,0,1.2,dt);}\n    const round=state.round, time=round?.elapsed||0, wobble=state.wobble ?? .12;\n    const targetX=aim.x*.92+wobble*(Math.sin(time*2.13)*.6+Math.sin(time*3.71)*.4), targetY=aim.y*.92+wobble*(Math.sin(time*1.79)*.6+Math.sin(time*3.31)*.4);\n    const stiffness=state.stiffness||40, damping=state.damping||8.5;\n    center.vx+=((targetX-center.x)*stiffness-center.vx*damping)*dt;center.vy+=((targetY-center.y)*stiffness-center.vy*damping)*dt;\n    center.x=clamp(center.x+center.vx*dt,-1.2,1.2);center.y=clamp(center.y+center.vy*dt,-1.2,1.2);\n  }\n  function heldAction() { try { const gamepad=Array.from(navigator.getGamepads?.()||[]).find(Boolean);return mouseHeld||keys.has(' ')||keys.has('enter')||!!gamepad?.buttons[0]?.pressed; } catch (_) { return mouseHeld||keys.has(' '); } }\n  function tickRound(dt) {\n    const round=state.round, online=!!state.together?.online, onlineSettings=online && state.screen==='settings' && state.returnScreen==='event'; if(!round || (state.paused && !online) || (!['event','check'].includes(state.screen) && !onlineSettings)) return;\n    round.elapsed+=dt; const time=round.elapsed;\n    let quality=clamp(1-Math.hypot(center.x,center.y)*.8,0,1), targetX=0,targetY=0, instruction=round.controls;\n    if(state.screen==='check') {\n      const phase=time<8?0:time<23?1:time<29?2:3;round.phase=phase;\n      if(phase===1) {targetX=[-.7,.7,-.7][Math.min(2,Math.floor((time-8)/5))];quality=clamp(1-Math.abs(center.x-targetX),0,1);instruction='Lean into the target ring.';}\n      else if(phase===2) instruction='Eyes closed. Trust the sound and find your center.';\n      else if(phase===3) instruction='Alternate left and right steps to the beat.';\n      else instruction='Stand still. This is the whole test.';\n      round.metric[phase]+=quality;round.phaseSamples[phase]++;\n    } else {\n      if(round.id==='breath') { const inhale=(time%8)<4;quality=(heldAction()===inhale)?1:.15;instruction=inhale?'Breathe in · hold Action':'Breathe out · release Action'; }\n      else if(round.id==='pose') { targetX=Math.sin(time*.58)*.55;targetY=Math.cos(time*.43)*.25;quality=clamp(1-Math.hypot(center.x-targetX,center.y-targetY),0,1);instruction='Follow the drifting ring.'; }\n      else if(round.id==='squat') {quality=clamp(round.actionHits/Math.max(1,time/.6)*1.1,0,1)*.7+quality*.3;instruction='Press Action as the beat lands.';}\n      else if(round.id==='plank') { quality=quality*(heldAction()?1:.35);instruction='Hold Action. Be one with the plank.'; }\n      else if(round.id==='step'||round.id==='lap') {quality=clamp(round.steps/Math.max(1,time/.625),0,1)*.65+clamp(round.actionHits/Math.max(1,round.actionCount),0,1)*.35;instruction='Alternate Left and Right on the beat.';}\n      else if(round.id==='spin') {const angle=Math.atan2(center.y,center.x);let diff=angle-round.prevAngle;while(diff>Math.PI)diff-=Math.PI*2;while(diff<-Math.PI)diff+=Math.PI*2;round.prevAngle=angle;round.spin=smooth(round.spin,Math.abs(diff)/Math.max(dt,.001),3,dt);quality=clamp(round.spin/4,0,1)*(Math.hypot(center.x,center.y)>.25?1:.3);instruction='Circle your lean. Keep the floaties moving!';}\n      else if(round.id==='tide') {round.shellVx=(round.shellVx+center.x*dt*.9)*Math.exp(-1.6*dt);round.shellVy=(round.shellVy+center.y*dt*.9)*Math.exp(-1.6*dt);round.shellX=clamp(round.shellX+round.shellVx*dt,-.9,.9);round.shellY=clamp(round.shellY+round.shellVy*dt,-.9,.9);targetX=Math.sin(round.potted*3)*.6;targetY=Math.cos(round.potted*2)*.55;if(Math.hypot(round.shellX-targetX,round.shellY-targetY)<.16){round.potted++;round.shellX=0;round.shellY=0;sound(780,.12);}quality=clamp(1-Math.hypot(round.shellX-targetX,round.shellY-targetY)*.5,0,1);instruction=`Shells in pools: ${round.potted} · Tilt toward the pool.`;}\n      else if(round.id==='paddle') {targetX=Math.sin(Math.floor(time/4.5)*1.9)*.65;quality=clamp(1-Math.abs(center.x-targetX),0,1);const gate=Math.floor(time/4.5);if(gate!==round.gateIndex){round.gateIndex=gate;if(quality>.63)round.gates++;}instruction=`Gates cleared: ${round.gates} · Steer to the ring.`;}\n      else if(round.id==='tray') {quality=clamp(quality-.08*Math.abs(Math.sin(time*1.7)),0,1);instruction='Keep the smoothies aboard.';}\n      else if(round.id==='dive') {quality=clamp(round.actionHits/Math.max(1,time/1.2)*1.5,0,1)*.7+(heldAction()?.3:0);instruction='Press at the bottom of the bounce; hold to tuck.';}\n      else if(round.id==='finale') {if(time<16){instruction=(time%8)<4?'Breathe in · hold Action':'Breathe out · release Action';quality=(heldAction()===((time%8)<4))?1:.2;}else if(time<36){targetX=Math.sin(time*.5)*.5;quality=clamp(1-Math.abs(center.x-targetX),0,1);instruction='Follow the pose through the breeze.';}else if(time<48){quality=clamp(round.steps/Math.max(1,(time-36)/.625),0,1);instruction='Step with the island marching band.';}else if(time<60){quality*=heldAction()?1:.3;instruction='Brace against the waves. Hold Action.';}else{instruction=time>75?'Press Action to skip? Or simply stay.':'The Long Stillness. Do nothing.';quality=round.stillBroken?.2:1;}}\n      round.sum+=quality;round.samples++;\n    }\n    const dot=document.getElementById('dot'), target=document.getElementById('target');\n    if(dot){dot.style.transform=`translate(${center.x*43}px,${center.y*43}px)`;dot.style.opacity=state.screen==='check'&&round.phase===2?'0':'1';}\n    if(target){target.style.transform=`translate(${targetX*43}px,${targetY*43}px)`;target.style.opacity=state.screen==='check'&&round.phase===2?'0':'1';}\n    const timer=document.getElementById('timer'), subtitle=document.getElementById('round-subtitle'), phase=document.getElementById('phase-card'), score=document.getElementById('round-score'), fill=document.getElementById('meter-fill');\n    if(timer)timer.textContent=Math.max(0,Math.ceil(round.length-time))+'s';if(subtitle)subtitle.textContent=instruction;if(phase)phase.textContent=instruction;if(score)score.textContent=state.screen==='check'?['STILL','LEAN','LISTEN','STEP'][round.phase]:formatScore(round.sum/Math.max(1,round.samples)*1000);if(fill)fill.style.width=clamp(time/round.length*100,0,100)+'%';\n    if(state.together?.online && hub && time-lastHubUpdate>.1){lastHubUpdate=time;hub.send({event:state.together.event,x:center.x,y:center.y,progress:time/round.length},{reliable:false});}\n    if(state.together?.online && hub && time-lastHubProgress>=2){lastHubProgress=time;hub.progress({score:state.together.scores[0]+Math.round(clamp(round.sum/Math.max(round.samples,1),0,1)*1000),label:round.name});}\n    if(time>=round.length) { if(state.screen==='check')finishCheck();else finishRound(); }\n  }\n\n**Pillars.** Check every decision against these.\n1. **Small movements, big consequences.** Mastery means doing less. The best moments are held breaths.\n2. **Deadpan encouragement.** Everything you do is commented on, kindly, and slightly too honestly.\n3. **A daily ritual.** Check in, get a number, do your exercises, get a stamp.\n4. **Calm surface, silly underneath.** The screen stays serene while a seagull stands on your head.\n\n**Originality rules.** This is an original game in the same genre, not a recreation.\n- Inside the game, use no Nintendo names (Wii, Mii, Balance Board and so on). The only exceptions are the Source line on the About screen and whatever your title's riff requires.\n- No white rectangular board with dot eyes. No pale human trainer in a tank top and ponytail. No Mii-style avatars or face editors. No island or plaza from the source series.\n- No source music, jingles, menu layouts or screen compositions. Do not quote or paraphrase its lines. Write your own.\n- Events have their own names and twists, as specified below.\n- Respect bodies: no weight, BMI, body-shape jokes or diet talk anywhere. Pip judges your wobble, your habits and your absences.\n\n## 2. Structure of play\n\n**Boot:** title screen over a slow island sweep. Menu: New Stay or Continue, Play Together, Settings, About. After 10 seconds with no input on the title or any pre-game menu, attract mode starts (section 12).\n\n**New Stay:** choose one of 4 guest slots, pick a name from a list of about 40 funny preset names (no on-screen keyboard), pick a look (6 skin tones, 8 outfits). Then a short intro with Pip at reception, skippable.\n\n**A day:**\n1. Wake on the cabana deck. Pip greets you, with an absence comment if real days have passed.\n2. Morning Wobble Check (about 70 seconds), Balance Age reveal, Pip's comment.\n3. Free time on the island: walk, talk to guests, find lost flip-flops, step on an event mat. The Schedule (Triangle or Tab) lists everything and fast-travels.\n4. When the day's minute goal is met, Pip says so. Sleep at your cabana (or choose End Day in the Schedule). A big stamp lands on the Calendar. Next day.\n\n| Day | Opens | Minute goal | Story beat |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | Stillness Studio: Breath Bloom, Pose Parade | 3 | Arrival. The checkout rule. \"Nobody has asked to leave yet\" |\n| 2 | Iron Gazebo: Tempo Squats, Plank Standoff | 5 | Big Kettle. Wardrobe opens |\n| 3 | Boardwalk: Step Party, Floatie Spin, Morning Lap | 7 | Yesterday You appears as a ghost. \"I am not comparing you\" |\n| 4 | Lagoon: Tide Table, Paddle Slalom, Tray Trek, Cannonball Cup | 9 | Guests start whispering about the Big Stand |\n| 5 | The Big Stand, after the morning check | none | Finale, ending, free play |\n\n**Minutes:** the first clear of an event each day banks 1 + stars (0 to 3 stars, so 1 to 4 minutes); repeats bank 1. Resort minutes are openly not real minutes (\"Our minutes are longer. It is a wellness thing\").\n\n**Endings:** Balance Age 40 or better: you may check out, by rowboat (`LIB/core/rowboat`). Otherwise: the Extended Stay ending, gentle and funny. Both roll credits, then unlock Free Play: every event open, personal bests, star goals, and a calendar that keeps stamping real days.\n\n**Bot rule:** `Game::bot` must be able to play this entire flow, menus included, from New Stay to the credits. That is your scripted playthrough and the base of attract mode.\n\n## 3. Controls\n\nThe left stick is both walking and leaning. Prompts always show the glyph for the input used last.\n\n| Action | DualSense (standard mapping) | Keyboard | Mouse |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| Walk on the island, lean in events | Left stick | W A S D (arrows also walk) | Island: click a place or thing to walk there. Events: cursor offset from screen centre is the lean |\n| Fine lean | Stick itself | Hold Shift (half key rate) | Small cursor moves |\n| Jog on the island | Hold R2 | Hold Shift | |\n| Action: talk, begin, inhale, squat, bounce | Cross | Space | Left button |\n| Left step / right step | L1 or L2 / R1 or R2 | Q or Left / E or Right | Left button / right button |\n| Brace (hold both) | L2+R2 or L1+R1 | Q+E | Both buttons |\n| Wave at someone | Square | F | |\n| Schedule | Triangle | Tab | |\n| Island camera | Right stick | | Right-drag, wheel zooms |\n| Pause | Options | Esc | |\n| Menus | D-pad or left stick, Cross confirms, Circle backs, L1/R1 change tabs | Arrows or W A S D, Enter or Space, Esc backs, Q/E change tabs | Hover moves focus, click activates, right-click backs |\n\nXbox glyphs (Settings option) swap A B X Y, LB RB LT RT, Menu. Ignore Options while Create is held: that pair belongs to the AI Hub. Disable the engine's own keys (F1 to F10, digits, H, Backspace rewind, right-drag tilt) outside dev mode. Keep F11 for fullscreen.\n\n## 4. The Balance Core\n\nOne struct, `BalanceCore`, used by every event. Its state is `cob` (the dot, unit disc, x right, y up on screen) and `vel`.\n\n```\ntarget = shaped lean input * reach + wobble(t)\nacc    = (target - cob) * stiffness - vel * damping + gust + nudge\nvel   += acc * dt\ncob   += vel * dt\ntip    = |cob| > 1 for tip_time seconds\n```\n\nStart with `stiffness 40`, `damping 8.5`, `reach 0.92`, `tip_time 0.35`. `wobble` is `amp * (0.7 * sin(2*pi*1.3*t + a) + 0.3 * sin(2*pi*2.9*t + b))` per axis, phases from `sim.state.rng`, base `amp 0.12`, scaled per event and by fatigue, plus a velocity kick of 0.1 units/s in a random direction every 1 to 2 seconds. Use sim time, never the clock.\n\n**Feel targets** (these numbers give them, by numeric simulation at 60 ticks/s): full stick reaches 90% in about 0.4 s with about 5% overshoot, like a body. Release settles in about 0.45 s. Left alone, the dot wanders at a mean radius of 0.05, at most 0.08. A held full lean does not tip by itself; a gust on top of it does.\n\n**Input shaping** (in `pav_app`, passed as `InputFrame.lean`, screen space):\n- **Stick:** deadzone 0.12, response curve `x^1.5` so small motions are fine.\n- **Keyboard:** keys move the target at 1.6 units/s and it returns at 1.2 units/s when released. Tapping gives small nudges, so keys feel native, not bang-bang.\n- **Mouse:** cursor offset from the screen centre divided by 0.38 of the window height, clamped to the disc. No pointer lock. The device moved last wins.\n\n**Body:** the figure tilts with the dot (`cob * 14` degrees about the feet, engine change in section 14). Beyond |cob| 0.75 an upper-body arm-flail clip fades in. A tip plays a stumble and, over water, a splash. Tips never end the game; they cost time or score.\n        assert status(page)[\"scene\"] == \"ending\"\n        click(page, \"free-play\")\n        assert status(page)[\"scene\"] == \"island\"\n        page.reload(wait_until=\"domcontentloaded\")\n        page.wait_for_function(\"window.__gameBoot?.ready === true\")\n        click(page, \"slots-continue\")\n        click(page, \"slot:0\")\n        assert status(page)[\"guest\"] == \"Ari\" and status(page)[\"day\"] == 5\n        assert not errors, errors\n        context.close()\n\n    test(\"five-day stay, ending and save persistence\", stay)\n\n    def minute_rewards():\n        context, page, errors = load(browser)\n        new_guest(page)\n        click(page, \"check\")\n        click(page, \"begin-check\")\n        advance(page)\n        click(page, \"result-next\")\n        for attempt in range(2):\n            before = status(page)[\"minutes\"]\n            click(page, \"intro:breath\")\n            click(page, \"begin-event\")\n            advance(page)\n            earned = status(page)[\"minutes\"] - before\n            assert earned == (1 + status(page)[\"resultStars\"] if attempt == 0 else 1)\n            click(page, \"result-next\")\n        while status(page)[\"minutes\"] < 3:\n            click(page, \"intro:breath\")\n            click(page, \"begin-event\")\n            advance(page)\n            click(page, \"result-next\")\n        click(page, \"end-day\")\n        click(page, \"sleep\")\n        click(page, \"check\")\n        click(page, \"begin-check\")\n        advance(page)\n        click(page, \"result-next\")\n        click(page, \"intro:breath\")\n        click(page, \"begin-event\")\n        advance(page)\n        assert status(page)[\"minutes\"] == 1 + status(page)[\"resultStars\"]\n        assert not errors, errors\n        context.close()\n\n    test(\"first-clear and repeat minute rewards\", minute_rewards)\n\n    def medley():\n        context, page, errors = load(browser)\n        click(page, \"together\")\n        click(page, \"hotseat:2\")\n        for player in range(2):\n            for event in range(3):\n                current = status(page)[\"together\"]\n                assert current[\"player\"] == player and current[\"event\"] == event, current\n                click(page, \"hotseat-next\")\n                click(page, \"begin-event\")\n                advance(page)\n                click(page, \"result-next\")\n        assert status(page)[\"scene\"] == \"podium\"\n        assert not errors, errors\n        context.close()\n\n    test(\"two-player local medley\", medley)\n\n    def tuning():\n        context, page, errors = load(browser, viewport={\"width\": 1280, \"height\": 800})\n        new_guest(page)\n        click(page, \"check\")\n        click(page, \"begin-check\")\n        click(page, \"pause\")\n        before = status(page)[\"elapsed\"]\n        page.wait_for_timeout(250)\n        assert status(page)[\"elapsed\"] == before\n        page.locator(\"summary\").click()\n        page.screenshot(path=str(ARTIFACTS / \"pause-tuning.png\"))\n        for kind, value in ((\"stiffness\", 55), (\"damping\", 10), (\"wobble\", .2), (\"timeScale\", 2)):\n            page.locator(f\"#dev-{kind}\").evaluate(\"(element, value) => { element.value = value; element.dispatchEvent(new Event('input', {bubbles:true})); }\", str(value))\n        click(page, \"reset-tuning\")\n        page.locator(\"summary\").click()\n        for kind, value in ((\"stiffness\", 40), (\"damping\", 8.5), (\"wobble\", .12), (\"timeScale\", 1)):\n            assert float(page.locator(f\"#dev-{kind}\").input_value()) == value\n        click(page, \"give-minutes\")\n        assert status(page)[\"minutes\"] == 5\n        page.locator(\"summary\").click()\n        click(page, \"finish-now\")\n        assert status(page)[\"scene\"] == \"result\" and status(page)[\"checked\"]\n        assert not errors, errors\n        context.close()\n\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_555","type":"reasoning","text":"**Inspecting finish and status**"}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_556","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"sed -n '155,210p' 'Wii Fit Together-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-222701/web/game.js'; sed -n '225,265p' 'Wii Fit Together-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-222701/web/game.js'; sed -n '1,100p' 'Wii Fit Together-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-222701/tests/test_game.py'; sed -n '140,200p' PLAN.md\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_556","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"sed -n '155,210p' 'Wii Fit Together-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-222701/web/game.js'; sed -n '225,265p' 'Wii Fit Together-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-222701/web/game.js'; sed -n '1,100p' 'Wii Fit Together-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-222701/tests/test_game.py'; sed -n '140,200p' PLAN.md\"","aggregated_output":"    else if (action==='together') { state.together=null; setScreen('together'); }\n    else if (action.startsWith('hotseat:')) { state.together={count:Number(action.slice(8)),player:0,event:0,scores:[0,0,0,0],online:false,ghosts:{}}; setScreen('handoff'); }\n    else if (action==='hotseat-next') { state.eventId=medley[state.together.event]; setScreen('eventIntro'); }\n    else if (action==='settings') { state.returnScreen=state.screen; setScreen('settings'); }\n    else if (action==='settings-back') setScreen(state.returnScreen || 'title');\n    else if (action==='about') setScreen('about');\n    else if (action==='hub-ready') { if(hub) hub.ready(); state.message='Ready! Waiting for the other guests.'; render(); }\n  }\n\n  function startCheck() { center={x:0,y:0,vx:0,vy:0}; aim={x:0,y:0}; state.paused=false; state.round={name:'Morning Wobble Check',place:'Stillness Studio',instruction:'Stand still. This is the whole test.',controls:'Keep the dot near the center.',length:37,elapsed:0,sum:0,samples:0,actionHits:0,actionCount:0,targets:0,phase:0,steps:0,lastStep:'',metric:[0,0,0,0],phaseSamples:[0,0,0,0]}; setScreen('check'); }\n  function startRound(id) { const item=eventById(id); if(!item) return; center={x:0,y:0,vx:0,vy:0}; aim={x:0,y:0}; lastHubUpdate=0; lastHubProgress=0; state.paused=false; state.round={...item,instruction:item.controls,elapsed:0,sum:0,samples:0,actionHits:0,actionCount:0,steps:0,lastStep:'',shellX:0,shellY:0,shellVx:0,shellVy:0,potted:0,spin:0,prevAngle:0,gates:0,gateIndex:-1,stillBroken:false,ghostTrail:[]}; setScreen('event'); if(state.together?.online && hub) hub.progress({score:state.together.scores[0],label:`${item.name}: starting`}); }\n  function triggerAction(side='action') {\n    if (!state.round || !['event','check'].includes(state.screen) || state.paused) return;\n    const round=state.round, time=round.elapsed;\n    if (round.id==='finale' && time>60) round.stillBroken=true;\n    round.actionCount++;\n    if (side==='left' || side==='right') { if (round.lastStep!==side) {round.steps++; round.lastStep=side;} }\n    if (round.id==='squat' || round.id==='step' || round.id==='lap' || round.id==='dive' || state.screen==='check') {\n      const interval=round.id==='dive'?1.2:round.id==='step'?.625:.6;\n      const phase=time%interval; if(Math.min(phase,interval-phase)<.22) round.actionHits++;\n      sound(round.id==='dive'?240:420,.09,'sine',.045);\n    } else sound(360,.06,'sine',.03);\n  }\n  function finishCheck() {\n    const round=state.round;\n    const metric=round.metric.map((value,index)=>round.phaseSamples[index] ? value/round.phaseSamples[index] : 0);\n    metric[3]=clamp(round.steps/8,0,1)*.6 + clamp(round.actionHits/8,0,1)*.4;\n    const skill=.30*metric[0]+.25*metric[1]+.25*metric[2]+.20*metric[3];\n    const age=Math.round(clamp(24+56*Math.pow(1-clamp(skill,0,1),1.1)-2*(profileDay()-1)-Math.min((state.profile.stars||0)/3,8),18,99));\n    state.profile.checked=true; state.profile.age=age; save();\n    state.result={isCheck:true,age,stars:skill>.8?3:skill>.5?2:1,comment:'A number! We can put it on a postcard. The important part is that you showed up.'}; voice(); setScreen('result');\n  }\n  function finishRound() {\n    const round=state.round; let score=Math.round(clamp(round.sum/Math.max(round.samples,1),0,1)*1000);\n    if (round.id==='tide') score=Math.round(clamp(round.potted*200+score*.4,0,1000));\n    if (round.id==='paddle') score=Math.round(clamp(round.gates*125+score*.3,0,1000));\n    if (round.id==='dive') score=Math.round(clamp(score*.5+Math.min(round.actionHits,8)*65,0,1000));\n    if (round.id==='finale' && !round.stillBroken) score=Math.min(1000,score+100);\n    const stars=score>=850?3:score>=650?2:score>=400?1:0;\n    let banked=0;\n    if(state.together) { state.together.scores[state.together.player]+=score; if(state.together.online && hub) hub.progress({score:state.together.scores[0],label:`${round.name}: ${score}`}); }\n    else if (state.profile) { const guest=state.profile; guest.clearedToday=guest.clearedToday||{}; banked=guest.clearedToday[round.id]?1:1+stars; guest.clearedToday[round.id]=true; guest.dayMinutes=(guest.dayMinutes||0)+banked; guest.minutesTotal=(guest.minutesTotal||0)+banked; guest.stars=(guest.stars||0)+stars; guest.bests[round.id]=Math.max(guest.bests[round.id]||0,score); if(round.id==='finale') {guest.finaleDone=true;guest.age=Math.max(18,Math.round((guest.age||60)-score/100));} save(); }\n    state.result={isCheck:false,name:round.name,score,stars,comment:`${titles[Math.min(titles.length-1,Math.floor(score/1000*titles.length))]}. We’ve banked ${state.together?'your points':`${banked} minute${banked===1?'':'s'} in the clam`}.`}; state.paused=false; sound(660,.25,'sine'); voice(); setScreen('result');\n    if(state.together?.online) setTimeout(()=>{if(state.screen==='result' && state.round===round && state.together?.online) advanceResult();},1500);\n  }\n  function advanceResult() {\n    if(!state.together) {setScreen('island');return;}\n    const group=state.together; group.event++;\n    if(group.online) { if(group.event>=3) reportHub(); else {state.eventId=medley[group.event];startRound(state.eventId);} return; }\n    if(group.event>=3) {group.event=0;group.player++;}\n    if(group.player>=group.count) setScreen('podium'); else setScreen('handoff');\n  }\n  function reportHub() { if(!state.together || !state.together.online) return; const score=clamp(Math.round(state.together.scores[0]),0,3000); if(hub && !state.together.reported) {state.together.reported=true;hub.result({score,stats:{events:Math.min(3,state.together.event)},awards:[{name:'Island Enthusiast',description:'Completed the Tippy Cay medley.'}]});} state.message=`Medley complete: ${formatScore(score)} points. Waiting for the group.`;setScreen('waiting'); }\n\n  function updateInput(dt) {\n    let x=(keys.has('arrowright')||keys.has('d')?1:0)-(keys.has('arrowleft')||keys.has('a')?1:0), y=(keys.has('arrowdown')||keys.has('s')?1:0)-(keys.has('arrowup')||keys.has('w')?1:0);\n    const targetX=aim.x*.92+wobble*(Math.sin(time*2.13)*.6+Math.sin(time*3.71)*.4), targetY=aim.y*.92+wobble*(Math.sin(time*1.79)*.6+Math.sin(time*3.31)*.4);\n    const stiffness=state.stiffness||40, damping=state.damping||8.5;\n    center.vx+=((targetX-center.x)*stiffness-center.vx*damping)*dt;center.vy+=((targetY-center.y)*stiffness-center.vy*damping)*dt;\n    center.x=clamp(center.x+center.vx*dt,-1.2,1.2);center.y=clamp(center.y+center.vy*dt,-1.2,1.2);\n  }\n  function heldAction() { try { const gamepad=Array.from(navigator.getGamepads?.()||[]).find(Boolean);return mouseHeld||keys.has(' ')||keys.has('enter')||!!gamepad?.buttons[0]?.pressed; } catch (_) { return mouseHeld||keys.has(' '); } }\n  function tickRound(dt) {\n    const round=state.round, online=!!state.together?.online, onlineSettings=online && state.screen==='settings' && state.returnScreen==='event'; if(!round || (state.paused && !online) || (!['event','check'].includes(state.screen) && !onlineSettings)) return;\n    round.elapsed+=dt; const time=round.elapsed;\n    let quality=clamp(1-Math.hypot(center.x,center.y)*.8,0,1), targetX=0,targetY=0, instruction=round.controls;\n    if(state.screen==='check') {\n      const phase=time<8?0:time<23?1:time<29?2:3;round.phase=phase;\n      if(phase===1) {targetX=[-.7,.7,-.7][Math.min(2,Math.floor((time-8)/5))];quality=clamp(1-Math.abs(center.x-targetX),0,1);instruction='Lean into the target ring.';}\n      else if(phase===2) instruction='Eyes closed. Trust the sound and find your center.';\n      else if(phase===3) instruction='Alternate left and right steps to the beat.';\n      else instruction='Stand still. This is the whole test.';\n      round.metric[phase]+=quality;round.phaseSamples[phase]++;\n    } else {\n      if(round.id==='breath') { const inhale=(time%8)<4;quality=(heldAction()===inhale)?1:.15;instruction=inhale?'Breathe in · hold Action':'Breathe out · release Action'; }\n      else if(round.id==='pose') { targetX=Math.sin(time*.58)*.55;targetY=Math.cos(time*.43)*.25;quality=clamp(1-Math.hypot(center.x-targetX,center.y-targetY),0,1);instruction='Follow the drifting ring.'; }\n      else if(round.id==='squat') {quality=clamp(round.actionHits/Math.max(1,time/.6)*1.1,0,1)*.7+quality*.3;instruction='Press Action as the beat lands.';}\n      else if(round.id==='plank') { quality=quality*(heldAction()?1:.35);instruction='Hold Action. Be one with the plank.'; }\n      else if(round.id==='step'||round.id==='lap') {quality=clamp(round.steps/Math.max(1,time/.625),0,1)*.65+clamp(round.actionHits/Math.max(1,round.actionCount),0,1)*.35;instruction='Alternate Left and Right on the beat.';}\n      else if(round.id==='spin') {const angle=Math.atan2(center.y,center.x);let diff=angle-round.prevAngle;while(diff>Math.PI)diff-=Math.PI*2;while(diff<-Math.PI)diff+=Math.PI*2;round.prevAngle=angle;round.spin=smooth(round.spin,Math.abs(diff)/Math.max(dt,.001),3,dt);quality=clamp(round.spin/4,0,1)*(Math.hypot(center.x,center.y)>.25?1:.3);instruction='Circle your lean. Keep the floaties moving!';}\n      else if(round.id==='tide') {round.shellVx=(round.shellVx+center.x*dt*.9)*Math.exp(-1.6*dt);round.shellVy=(round.shellVy+center.y*dt*.9)*Math.exp(-1.6*dt);round.shellX=clamp(round.shellX+round.shellVx*dt,-.9,.9);round.shellY=clamp(round.shellY+round.shellVy*dt,-.9,.9);targetX=Math.sin(round.potted*3)*.6;targetY=Math.cos(round.potted*2)*.55;if(Math.hypot(round.shellX-targetX,round.shellY-targetY)<.16){round.potted++;round.shellX=0;round.shellY=0;sound(780,.12);}quality=clamp(1-Math.hypot(round.shellX-targetX,round.shellY-targetY)*.5,0,1);instruction=`Shells in pools: ${round.potted} · Tilt toward the pool.`;}\n      else if(round.id==='paddle') {targetX=Math.sin(Math.floor(time/4.5)*1.9)*.65;quality=clamp(1-Math.abs(center.x-targetX),0,1);const gate=Math.floor(time/4.5);if(gate!==round.gateIndex){round.gateIndex=gate;if(quality>.63)round.gates++;}instruction=`Gates cleared: ${round.gates} · Steer to the ring.`;}\n      else if(round.id==='tray') {quality=clamp(quality-.08*Math.abs(Math.sin(time*1.7)),0,1);instruction='Keep the smoothies aboard.';}\n      else if(round.id==='dive') {quality=clamp(round.actionHits/Math.max(1,time/1.2)*1.5,0,1)*.7+(heldAction()?.3:0);instruction='Press at the bottom of the bounce; hold to tuck.';}\n      else if(round.id==='finale') {if(time<16){instruction=(time%8)<4?'Breathe in · hold Action':'Breathe out · release Action';quality=(heldAction()===((time%8)<4))?1:.2;}else if(time<36){targetX=Math.sin(time*.5)*.5;quality=clamp(1-Math.abs(center.x-targetX),0,1);instruction='Follow the pose through the breeze.';}else if(time<48){quality=clamp(round.steps/Math.max(1,(time-36)/.625),0,1);instruction='Step with the island marching band.';}else if(time<60){quality*=heldAction()?1:.3;instruction='Brace against the waves. Hold Action.';}else{instruction=time>75?'Press Action to skip? Or simply stay.':'The Long Stillness. Do nothing.';quality=round.stillBroken?.2:1;}}\n      round.sum+=quality;round.samples++;\n    }\n    const dot=document.getElementById('dot'), target=document.getElementById('target');\n    if(dot){dot.style.transform=`translate(${center.x*43}px,${center.y*43}px)`;dot.style.opacity=state.screen==='check'&&round.phase===2?'0':'1';}\n    if(target){target.style.transform=`translate(${targetX*43}px,${targetY*43}px)`;target.style.opacity=state.screen==='check'&&round.phase===2?'0':'1';}\n    const timer=document.getElementById('timer'), subtitle=document.getElementById('round-subtitle'), phase=document.getElementById('phase-card'), score=document.getElementById('round-score'), fill=document.getElementById('meter-fill');\n    if(timer)timer.textContent=Math.max(0,Math.ceil(round.length-time))+'s';if(subtitle)subtitle.textContent=instruction;if(phase)phase.textContent=instruction;if(score)score.textContent=state.screen==='check'?['STILL','LEAN','LISTEN','STEP'][round.phase]:formatScore(round.sum/Math.max(1,round.samples)*1000);if(fill)fill.style.width=clamp(time/round.length*100,0,100)+'%';\n    if(state.together?.online && hub && time-lastHubUpdate>.1){lastHubUpdate=time;hub.send({event:state.together.event,x:center.x,y:center.y,progress:time/round.length},{reliable:false});}\n    if(state.together?.online && hub && time-lastHubProgress>=2){lastHubProgress=time;hub.progress({score:state.together.scores[0]+Math.round(clamp(round.sum/Math.max(round.samples,1),0,1)*1000),label:round.name});}\n    if(time>=round.length) { if(state.screen==='check')finishCheck();else finishRound(); }\n  }\n\nimport json\nimport os\nimport sys\nimport threading\nimport traceback\nfrom functools import partial\nfrom http.server import SimpleHTTPRequestHandler, ThreadingHTTPServer\nfrom pathlib import Path\nfrom urllib.parse import urlencode\n\nfrom playwright.sync_api import sync_playwright\n\n\nDEV = Path(__file__).resolve().parent.parent\nROOT = DEV.parent\nHTML = ROOT / f\"{DEV.name}.html\"\nARTIFACTS = DEV / \"tests\" / \"artifacts\"\nfailures = []\nchecks = 0\n\n\ndef test(name, function):\n    global checks\n    checks += 1\n    try:\n        function()\n    except Exception:\n        failures.append(f\"{name}:\\n{traceback.format_exc()}\")\n\n\ndef status(page):\n    return json.loads(page.evaluate(\"window.__gameStatus()\"))\n\n\ndef click(page, action):\n    page.locator(f'[data-action=\"{action}\"]').first.click(timeout=5000)\n\n\ndef advance(page):\n    page.evaluate(\"window.__testAdvance(200)\")\n    assert status(page)[\"scene\"] == \"result\", status(page)\n\n\ndef load(browser, **kwargs):\n    context = browser.new_context(**kwargs)\n    page = context.new_page()\n    errors = []\n    page.on(\"pageerror\", lambda error: errors.append(str(error)))\n    page.goto(HTML.as_uri() + \"?test=1\", wait_until=\"domcontentloaded\")\n    page.wait_for_function(\"window.__gameBoot?.ready === true\")\n    return context, page, errors\n\n\ndef new_guest(page):\n    click(page, \"slots-new\")\n    click(page, \"slot:0\")\n    page.locator(\"#guest-name\").select_option(label=\"Ari\")\n    click(page, \"skin:2\")\n    click(page, \"outfit:3\")\n    click(page, \"create-guest\")\n    click(page, \"island\")\n    assert status(page)[\"guest\"] == \"Ari\"\n\n\ndef browser_tests(playwright):\n    for engine in (\"chromium\", \"firefox\", \"webkit\"):\n        browser = getattr(playwright, engine).launch(headless=True)\n\n        def smoke():\n            context, page, errors = load(browser, viewport={\"width\": 1280, \"height\": 800})\n            assert \"Wii Fit\" in page.title()\n            click(page, \"about\")\n            assert \"Source Information\" in page.locator(\"#app\").inner_text()\n            assert \"Library credits\" in page.locator(\"#app\").inner_text()\n            page.locator(\".licenses summary\").click()\n            assert \"SIL OPEN FONT LICENSE\" in page.locator(\".licenses\").inner_text()\n            click(page, \"title\")\n            new_guest(page)\n            click(page, \"check\")\n            click(page, \"begin-check\")\n            page.keyboard.press(\"Escape\")\n            assert status(page)[\"paused\"]\n            page.keyboard.press(\"Escape\")\n            advance(page)\n            click(page, \"result-next\")\n            assert status(page)[\"checked\"]\n            click(page, \"intro:breath\")\n            click(page, \"begin-event\")\n            page.keyboard.press(\"Space\")\n            advance(page)\n            assert status(page)[\"minutes\"] == 1 + status(page)[\"resultStars\"]\n            click(page, \"result-next\")\n            page.screenshot(path=str(ARTIFACTS / f\"{engine}-island.png\"))\n            assert not errors, errors\n            context.close()\n\n        test(f\"{engine} guest, check and activity\", smoke)\n        browser.close()\n\n    browser = playwright.chromium.launch(headless=True)\n\n**Floatie Spin** (50 s). Circle the lean (stick, mouse, or rolling W-D-S-A) to spin inflatable rings around your hips. Spin speed is the smoothed angular velocity of the lean while |lean| > 0.4; the sweet band is 6 to 9 rad/s, and a `spin_band_scale` rule widens it for keyboard. \"Switch!\" flips the required direction every 15 s. Guests toss new rings from left or right: press that side's step within 0.25 s of arrival to catch it. Out of band, rings sink; on the floor they are lost. Maximum 7 rings. Score: rings times time in band. Rings are no-physics entities positioned in code. Bot: 7.5 rad/s circle, presses on arrivals.\n\n**Morning Lap** (about 90 s, one lap of the hub island). Alternate left and right steps to set your pace (1.6 to 2.4 steps/s is the zone). Too fast raises a stitch meter that makes you stumble; too slow and Bounce, the pacer rolling ahead, gets away. The path steers you; lean moves you up to 1.2 m sideways to dodge crabs, sunbathers and towels and to grab ribbons. Flip-flops can be found here too. Score: time in zone, plus ribbons, minus bumps. Camera: chase with per-tick yaw. Use `MESH2MOTION/Jog` scaled to speed. Bot: 2 steps/s, steers to ribbons.\n\n### Lagoon (Commodore Gull). Sets: `tide`, `channel`, `pier`, `tower`.\n\n**Tide Table** (3 boards, 60 s total). You stand on a floating square raft and your lean tilts it. Roll hermit crabs in shells into tide pools. Board 1: 3 shells. Board 2: 5 shells and a moving pool. Board 3: 7 shells, bumpers and a rising tide. Fast shells skip over pools. Write the shell physics as simple 2D code (`a = tilt * g - friction * v`, wall bounce 0.5), not rapier: it is more tunable and bot-friendly. Score: shells potted plus time left. Camera: high 3/4 (tilt 62). Bot: PD steering of the nearest shell toward the nearest pool.\n\n**Paddle Slalom** (about 45 s). Stand on a paddleboard on a long channel and pass buoy gates. Lean x steers. Lean forward speeds up and risks tipping, lean back brakes. Gusts, shown as ripple streaks, push the dot. A tip is a big splash and a 2 s remount. A missed gate adds 2 s. `score = clamp((1.6 * par - t) / (0.8 * par)) * 1000`. Standing on water uses the trick in section 15; a silent `Wake` event every few ticks draws the wake. Camera: chase (tilt 22, distance 10). Bot: steers to gate centres at forward lean 0.5.\n\n**Tray Trek** (about 50 s). Walk a long pier at a fixed pace, carrying a tray with a stack of 5 smoothies. Waves, plank gaps and swooping gulls jolt the tray. Your dot tilts it. Glasses slide with tilt and plop into the sea past the edge. Score: 200 per glass delivered, plus a no-spill bonus. Marjorie receives what is left and comments. Use `STYLE100/Balance_Walk` plus an upper-body `FIT/CarryTray` clip. Bot: counters the jolts it knows are coming.\n\n**Cannonball Cup** (3 dives, about 40 s). The board bounces with a 1.2 s period. Press Action at the bottom of 3 bounces to build power, the 4th press leaps. In the air, hold Action to tuck and lean to rotate. Enter tucked and high for the biggest splash. Three gull judges hold up cards: \"6.5\", \"7\", \"See me\". \"We are not here for form. We are here for splash.\" Score: height x tuck x timing. Camera: side view (yaw 90, tilt 6, distance 14). The splash must be huge: a new `BigSplash` event scales the water dents and particles. This is the attract mode's hero shot. Bot: presses on bottoms, tucks at the apex.\n\n### The Big Stand (finale, about 2.5 minutes). Set: `bay`, a tiny post in the bay at sunset, with the whole cast watching from rafts.\n\nFive phases, reusing event code with new numbers:\n1. Breathing, 4 cycles.\n2. A pose under rising gusts, 20 s.\n3. Step Party for 16 bars with a marching band of guests, wobble on.\n4. Brace while waves crash, 20 s.\n5. **The Long Stillness:** 30 s of nothing. Music fades to silence, the HUD vanishes except the Puck. At 15 s a fake prompt offers \"Press Cross to skip\". Pressing anything forfeits the Inner Peace bonus. Then Pip, quietly: \"...Oh. You're still here. Good.\"\n\nA tip drops you in the sea to a groan from the crowd and puts you back; it costs score and cannot end the run. Final Balance Age = morning age minus `final_score / 100` (up to 10).\n\n### Morning Wobble Check. Set: `studio`. About 70 s, four micro-tests, Pip presiding.\n\n| Test | What you do | Metric (0 to 1) |\n|---|---|---|\n| Stand Still (\"This is the whole test\") | Hold the dot centred for 8 s; one small nudge at 5 s | Mean distance from centre |\n| Lean Targets | A left/right bar: reach \"70% left\", then two more targets, within 6%, hold 1.5 s; 5 s limit each | Time taken |\n| Eyes Closed | 6 s. The screen dims to almost black, the Puck vanishes. A tone's pitch tells your offset, and rumble if the pad has it | Mean distance |\n| Step Test | 8 alternating steps to a 100 BPM metronome | Timing |\n\n```\nskill = 0.30*still + 0.25*targets + 0.25*blind + 0.20*steps\nage   = 24 + 56 * (1 - skill)^1.1 - 2*days_completed - min(total_stars/3, 8)\n```\nClamp to 18..99, round. A middling player (skill 0.5) starts at 50 and reaches about 34 by Day 5; a weak one (skill 0.2) starts at 68 and ends near 52, before the finale's bonus. The big number rolls like a slot machine. Pip's comment is chosen by the change since yesterday and by the worst metric. A sparkline of 5 big dots shows the week. Your figure's posture improves as the age falls (a small constant forward slump through the tilt field, shrinking each day): visible progress, no numbers needed.\n\n## 6. Meta systems\n\n- **Minute Clam:** a giant clam at reception that gulps banked minutes with a gibberish burp. Totals unlock wardrobe items.\n- **Calendar:** five big days, a stamp per completed day, then real days in free play. No tables.\n- **Titles:** after each event Pip awards a deadpan title by score: Human Soup, Acceptable Human, Certified Lean-To, Wobble Enthusiast, Seasoned Tilter, Stillness Intern, Professional Standing Person, Alarmingly Balanced. At least 30, in `script.toml`.\n- **Wardrobe:** reuse the engine's `GearLook`, which needs no new drawing (verified): `helm = cap` (sun cap), `helm = hood` (towel turban), `crown`, `halo`; `gloves` (sweatbands), `belt`, `pauldrons` (reads as arm floaties, funny). Plus shirt, pants and shoe colours. Skip `cape`: it draws long sticks.\n- **Lost flip-flops:** 5 hidden on the island, for Two-Towel Tom. Reward: Golden Flip-Flops (gold shoes) and a line. This is the exploration layer.\n- **Yesterday You:** your best run of each event is recorded and replayed as a tinted figure in a neighbouring lane, from Day 3.\n- **Absence comments:** the page passes today's date to the game at boot, and the save stores the last day played. \"You were away for 2 days. I did not count them. There were 2.\" Passing the date in as data keeps the rule that the sim never reads the clock.\n- **Saves:** versioned JSON in `localStorage`: guest slots (name, look, day, minutes, stars, bests, ghosts, ages, flip-flops, unlocks) and global settings. Save on every change of day and every result.\n\n## 7. World, cast and writing\n\n**Tippy Cay** is about 64 x 48 m: reception at the centre (Pip's desk, Calendar wall, Minute Clam), a ring path for jogging, four pavilions around it, a row of cabanas, a pier, a diving tower and a water channel in the distance. Palms, grass, sand terraces, sea on all sides, circling gulls.\n\n| Character | What it is | Voice and manner |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Pip** | Sky-blue round wobble cushion, two dot eyes (`blob` plan, scale 0.7, squash 2.0, plus a small valve) | Front desk and scorekeeper. Relentlessly pleasant. Keeps records of everything. Never technically insults you. Squeaky rubber voice |\n| **Posey** | Faceless wooden artist's mannequin (biped with eyes the colour of its skin; verified look in section 8) | Stillness. Serene, short, oddly poetic. Soft wood-block voice. It has no eyes and never blinks; \"This has not been discussed\" |\n| **Big Kettle** | Cast-iron kettlebell (dark `blob` plus a torus handle part; add a `Handle` attach kind) | Strength. Booming, gentle, deeply supportive. No arms or legs, cannot do any exercise |\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_557","type":"reasoning","text":"**Inspecting top arrays**"}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_558","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"sed -n '1,65p' 'Wii Fit Together-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-222701/web/game.js'; sed -n '225,265p' 'Wii Fit Together-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-222701/web/game.js'; sed -n '110,153p' TASK.md; sed -n '1,150p' 'Wii Fit Together-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-222701/tests/test_game.py'\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_558","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"sed -n '1,65p' 'Wii Fit Together-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-222701/web/game.js'; sed -n '225,265p' 'Wii Fit Together-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-222701/web/game.js'; sed -n '110,153p' TASK.md; sed -n '1,150p' 'Wii Fit Together-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-222701/tests/test_game.py'\"","aggregated_output":"(() => {\n  'use strict';\n\n  const app = document.getElementById('app');\n  const canvas = document.getElementById('world');\n  const context = canvas.getContext('2d');\n  const hub = window.AIHub;\n  const names = ['Alex','Ari','Ash','Bailey','Bea','Benny','Birdie','Blair','Bo','Cameron','Casey','Charlie','Cleo','Coco','Dani','Drew','Eden','Eli','Emery','Finn','Frankie','Harper','Indigo','Jaden','Jamie','Jesse','Jules','Kai','Kit','Lane','Leo','Lou','Marley','Mika','Morgan','Nico','Parker','Quinn','Remy','Robin'];\n  const skins = ['#f4c29c','#dca37a','#b87855','#8a563f','#f5d7c4','#604437'];\n  const outfits = ['#ff826d','#49b4ac','#f5bb52','#8a9cdb','#e77c9d','#87b979','#e9a778','#778a99'];\n  const titles = ['Stillness Intern','Human Soup','Wobble Enthusiast','Certified Lean-To','Acceptable Human','Seasoned Tilter','Professional Standing Person','Alarmingly Balanced','Chief of Almost','Puddle Avoider','The Upright-ish','Assistant to Gravity','A Quiet Triumph','Exceptionally Present','Honorary Buoy','Very Good at Floor','Sensible Seagull','The Sway Whisperer','Locally Stable','Foot Placement Expert','A Fine Vertical','Slightly Legendary','Calm Adjacent','Proudly Perpendicular','The Unfallen','Official Dot Mover','Ocean Negotiator','Flamingo in Training','Grand Marshal of Balance','Keeper of the Wobble'];\n  const events = [\n    {id:'breath', name:'Breath Bloom', day:1, coach:'Posey', place:'Stillness Studio', length:32, description:'Breathe with the flower. Hold Action as it opens; release as it closes.', controls:'Hold and release Action with the flower.'},\n    {id:'pose', name:'Pose Parade', day:1, coach:'Posey', place:'Stillness Studio', length:36, description:'Follow three gently drifting poses. Keep your dot inside the moving ring.', controls:'Lean toward the moving target.'},\n    {id:'squat', name:'Tempo Squats', day:2, coach:'Big Kettle', place:'Iron Gazebo', length:32, description:'A very dignified imaginary chair awaits. Press on the beat.', controls:'Press Action when the ring closes.'},\n    {id:'plank', name:'Plank Standoff', day:2, coach:'Big Kettle', place:'Iron Gazebo', length:30, description:'Brace against the breeze. A plank is a promise you make to the floor.', controls:'Hold Action and keep the dot centered.'},\n    {id:'step', name:'Step Party', day:3, coach:'Bounce', place:'Boardwalk', length:32, description:'Find your feet at 96 beats per minute. Left, right, and repeat.', controls:'Alternate Left and Right on the beat.'},\n    {id:'spin', name:'Floatie Spin', day:3, coach:'Bounce', place:'Boardwalk', length:32, description:'Circle your lean to keep a bright stack of floaties spinning.', controls:'Circle with WASD, the stick, or mouse.'},\n    {id:'lap', name:'Morning Lap', day:3, coach:'Bounce', place:'Boardwalk', length:35, description:'Take the scenic route. Alternate your steps and steer around beach clutter.', controls:'Alternate Left and Right; lean to steer.'},\n    {id:'tide', name:'Tide Table', day:4, coach:'Commodore Gull', place:'Lagoon', length:40, description:'Tilt the raft to roll a shell into the tide pool. Mind the edges.', controls:'Lean to roll the shell into the pool.'},\n    {id:'paddle', name:'Paddle Slalom', day:4, coach:'Commodore Gull', place:'Lagoon', length:36, description:'Steer through the buoy gates. The sea is mostly on your side.', controls:'Lean left and right to meet the gates.'},\n    {id:'tray', name:'Tray Trek', day:4, coach:'Marjorie', place:'Lagoon Pier', length:35, description:'Carry five very optimistic smoothies across a wobbly pier.', controls:'Keep the dot centered through the gusts.'},\n    {id:'dive', name:'Cannonball Cup', day:4, coach:'Commodore Gull', place:'Lagoon Tower', length:36, description:'Time your bounce, tuck in the air, and make a spectacular splash.', controls:'Press Action at the bottom of a bounce; hold to tuck.'},\n    {id:'finale', name:'The Big Stand', day:5, coach:'Pip', place:'Sunset Bay', length:90, description:'The whole island is watching. Breathe, pose, step, brace, and finally be still.', controls:'Follow each phase. During Long Stillness, do nothing.'}\n  ];\n  const medley = ['paddle','tide','dive'];\n  const goals = [3,5,7,9,0];\n  const keys = new Set();\n  const storage = 'wii-fit-together-v1';\n  let saved = readStorage();\n  let settings = Object.assign({music:0.1, sound:true, glyph:'PlayStation'}, saved.settings || {});\n  let state = {screen:'title', previous:'title', slot:null, profile:null, setup:{name:'Alex',skin:0,outfit:0}, round:null, paused:false, together:null, hub:null, lastInput:performance.now(), device:'keyboard', attract:false, message:'', returnScreen:'title'};\n  let center = {x:0,y:0,vx:0,vy:0}, aim = {x:0,y:0}, mouseAim = null, mouseHeld = false, previousButtons = [], audio, musicClock = 0, lastFrame = performance.now(), lastHubUpdate = 0, lastHubProgress = 0;\n  let viewport = {width:0,height:0,scale:1,ox:0,oy:0};\n\n  function readStorage() { try { return JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(storage) || '{}'); } catch (_) { return {}; } }\n  function save() { try { saved.settings = settings; saved.slots ||= [null,null,null,null]; if (state.profile && state.slot !== null) saved.slots[state.slot] = state.profile; localStorage.setItem(storage, JSON.stringify(saved)); } catch (_) {} }\n  function esc(value) { return String(value).replace(/[&<>\"']/g, character => ({'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','\"':'&quot;',\"'\":'&#39;'}[character])); }\n  function clamp(value, min, max) { return Math.max(min, Math.min(max, value)); }\n  function smooth(value, target, rate, dt) { return value + (target-value) * Math.min(1,rate*dt); }\n  function markInput(device) { const needsRender = state.attract || (!state.hasHardwareInput && (device === 'keyboard' || device === 'gamepad')); state.device = device; state.lastInput = performance.now(); if (device === 'keyboard' || device === 'gamepad') state.hasHardwareInput = true; if (needsRender) { state.attract = false; render(); } }\n  function sound(frequency=440, length=.08, type='sine', volume=.06) {\n    if (!settings.sound) return;\n    try { audio ||= new (window.AudioContext || window.webkitAudioContext)(); if (audio.state === 'suspended') audio.resume(); const oscillator=audio.createOscillator(), gain=audio.createGain(); oscillator.type=type; oscillator.frequency.value=frequency; gain.gain.setValueAtTime(volume,audio.currentTime); gain.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(.001,audio.currentTime+length); oscillator.connect(gain).connect(audio.destination); oscillator.start(); oscillator.stop(audio.currentTime+length); } catch (_) {}\n  }\n  function voice() { [490,610,520].forEach((tone,index) => setTimeout(() => sound(tone,.07,'sine',.025),index*75)); }\n  function music(dt) { if (!audio || !settings.music || document.hidden) return; musicClock -= dt; if (musicClock <= 0) { musicClock=.48; const notes=[261.63,329.63,392,329.63,293.66,349.23,440,349.23]; const index=Math.floor(performance.now()/480)%notes.length; try { const oscillator=audio.createOscillator(), gain=audio.createGain(); oscillator.type='sine'; oscillator.frequency.value=notes[index]; gain.gain.setValueAtTime(settings.music*.07,audio.currentTime); gain.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(.001,audio.currentTime+.32); oscillator.connect(gain).connect(audio.destination); oscillator.start(); oscillator.stop(audio.currentTime+.32); } catch (_) {} } }\n  function button(label, action, extra='', subtitle='') { return `<button class=\"button ${extra}\" data-action=\"${action}\">${label}${subtitle ? `<small>${subtitle}</small>` : ''}</button>`; }\n  function header(right='A little balance goes a long way') { return `<div class=\"topbar\"><div class=\"logo\">TIPPY <i>✳</i> CAY</div><span class=\"pill\"><span class=\"sun-dot\"></span>${esc(right)}</span></div>`; }\n  function shell(content, right) { return `<div class=\"screen\">${header(right)}${content}</div>`; }\n  function modal(title, eyebrow, content, back='title') { return shell(`<div class=\"panel-wrap\"><section class=\"panel\"><div class=\"panel-head\"><div><div class=\"eyebrow\">${eyebrow}</div><h2>${title}</h2></div><button class=\"close\" data-action=\"${back}\" aria-label=\"Back\">×</button></div>${content}</section></div>`); }\n  function profileName() { return state.profile ? state.profile.name : 'Guest'; }\n  function profileDay() { return state.profile ? clamp(state.profile.day,1,5) : 1; }\n  function eventById(id) { return events.find(item => item.id === id); }\n  function unlocked(item) { return state.profile && (state.profile.freePlay || item.day <= state.profile.day); }\n  function formatScore(score) { return Math.round(score).toLocaleString(); }\n\n  function render() {\n    let html = '';\n    if (state.screen === 'title') {\n      const hasSave = (saved.slots || []).some(Boolean);\n      html = shell(`<div class=\"title-layout\"><section class=\"title-panel\"><div class=\"overline\">A rather uplifting island escape</div><h1>Wii Fit<br><span>Together.</span></h1><p class=\"lede\">Welcome to Tippy Cay, where the sea is calm, the company is questionable, and balance is a journey.</p><div class=\"title-actions\">${button('New Stay','slots-new','primary','A five-day island adventure')}${button('Continue','slots-continue','',hasSave?'Welcome back to the island':'Choose a guest to continue')}${button('Play Together','together','coral','Local or AI Hub medley')}${button('Settings','settings','', 'Controls, sound & accessibility')}</div></section><aside class=\"hero-note\"><b>A note from Pip</b>“We believe in you.<br>Gravity has declined to comment.”</aside></div><div class=\"footer\"><span>✳ AN ORIGINAL TIPPY CAY GETAWAY</span><div><button class=\"pill\" data-action=\"about\">About this game</button> <span class=\"hint\">WASD / arrows · Space · Controller</span></div></div>`, 'THE ISLAND IS OPEN');\n    } else if (state.screen === 'slots') {\n      const slots = saved.slots || [null,null,null,null];\n      html = modal(state.slotMode === 'new' ? 'Choose a guest' : 'Welcome back', 'THE GUEST BOOK', `<p>Every guest gets a little corner of the island. Choose an empty book to begin.</p><div class=\"cards\">${slots.map((guest,index) => `<button class=\"card\" data-action=\"slot:${index}\"><strong>${guest ? esc(guest.name) : 'Guest '+(index+1)+' · Empty'}</strong><small>${guest ? `Day ${guest.day} · ${guest.minutesTotal || 0} minutes banked` : 'Ready for a new stay'}</small></button>`).join('')}</div><p class=\"tiny\">Your progress stays in this browser on this device.</p>`);\n    const targetX=aim.x*.92+wobble*(Math.sin(time*2.13)*.6+Math.sin(time*3.71)*.4), targetY=aim.y*.92+wobble*(Math.sin(time*1.79)*.6+Math.sin(time*3.31)*.4);\n    const stiffness=state.stiffness||40, damping=state.damping||8.5;\n    center.vx+=((targetX-center.x)*stiffness-center.vx*damping)*dt;center.vy+=((targetY-center.y)*stiffness-center.vy*damping)*dt;\n    center.x=clamp(center.x+center.vx*dt,-1.2,1.2);center.y=clamp(center.y+center.vy*dt,-1.2,1.2);\n  }\n  function heldAction() { try { const gamepad=Array.from(navigator.getGamepads?.()||[]).find(Boolean);return mouseHeld||keys.has(' ')||keys.has('enter')||!!gamepad?.buttons[0]?.pressed; } catch (_) { return mouseHeld||keys.has(' '); } }\n  function tickRound(dt) {\n    const round=state.round, online=!!state.together?.online, onlineSettings=online && state.screen==='settings' && state.returnScreen==='event'; if(!round || (state.paused && !online) || (!['event','check'].includes(state.screen) && !onlineSettings)) return;\n    round.elapsed+=dt; const time=round.elapsed;\n    let quality=clamp(1-Math.hypot(center.x,center.y)*.8,0,1), targetX=0,targetY=0, instruction=round.controls;\n    if(state.screen==='check') {\n      const phase=time<8?0:time<23?1:time<29?2:3;round.phase=phase;\n      if(phase===1) {targetX=[-.7,.7,-.7][Math.min(2,Math.floor((time-8)/5))];quality=clamp(1-Math.abs(center.x-targetX),0,1);instruction='Lean into the target ring.';}\n      else if(phase===2) instruction='Eyes closed. Trust the sound and find your center.';\n      else if(phase===3) instruction='Alternate left and right steps to the beat.';\n      else instruction='Stand still. This is the whole test.';\n      round.metric[phase]+=quality;round.phaseSamples[phase]++;\n    } else {\n      if(round.id==='breath') { const inhale=(time%8)<4;quality=(heldAction()===inhale)?1:.15;instruction=inhale?'Breathe in · hold Action':'Breathe out · release Action'; }\n      else if(round.id==='pose') { targetX=Math.sin(time*.58)*.55;targetY=Math.cos(time*.43)*.25;quality=clamp(1-Math.hypot(center.x-targetX,center.y-targetY),0,1);instruction='Follow the drifting ring.'; }\n      else if(round.id==='squat') {quality=clamp(round.actionHits/Math.max(1,time/.6)*1.1,0,1)*.7+quality*.3;instruction='Press Action as the beat lands.';}\n      else if(round.id==='plank') { quality=quality*(heldAction()?1:.35);instruction='Hold Action. Be one with the plank.'; }\n      else if(round.id==='step'||round.id==='lap') {quality=clamp(round.steps/Math.max(1,time/.625),0,1)*.65+clamp(round.actionHits/Math.max(1,round.actionCount),0,1)*.35;instruction='Alternate Left and Right on the beat.';}\n      else if(round.id==='spin') {const angle=Math.atan2(center.y,center.x);let diff=angle-round.prevAngle;while(diff>Math.PI)diff-=Math.PI*2;while(diff<-Math.PI)diff+=Math.PI*2;round.prevAngle=angle;round.spin=smooth(round.spin,Math.abs(diff)/Math.max(dt,.001),3,dt);quality=clamp(round.spin/4,0,1)*(Math.hypot(center.x,center.y)>.25?1:.3);instruction='Circle your lean. Keep the floaties moving!';}\n      else if(round.id==='tide') {round.shellVx=(round.shellVx+center.x*dt*.9)*Math.exp(-1.6*dt);round.shellVy=(round.shellVy+center.y*dt*.9)*Math.exp(-1.6*dt);round.shellX=clamp(round.shellX+round.shellVx*dt,-.9,.9);round.shellY=clamp(round.shellY+round.shellVy*dt,-.9,.9);targetX=Math.sin(round.potted*3)*.6;targetY=Math.cos(round.potted*2)*.55;if(Math.hypot(round.shellX-targetX,round.shellY-targetY)<.16){round.potted++;round.shellX=0;round.shellY=0;sound(780,.12);}quality=clamp(1-Math.hypot(round.shellX-targetX,round.shellY-targetY)*.5,0,1);instruction=`Shells in pools: ${round.potted} · Tilt toward the pool.`;}\n      else if(round.id==='paddle') {targetX=Math.sin(Math.floor(time/4.5)*1.9)*.65;quality=clamp(1-Math.abs(center.x-targetX),0,1);const gate=Math.floor(time/4.5);if(gate!==round.gateIndex){round.gateIndex=gate;if(quality>.63)round.gates++;}instruction=`Gates cleared: ${round.gates} · Steer to the ring.`;}\n      else if(round.id==='tray') {quality=clamp(quality-.08*Math.abs(Math.sin(time*1.7)),0,1);instruction='Keep the smoothies aboard.';}\n      else if(round.id==='dive') {quality=clamp(round.actionHits/Math.max(1,time/1.2)*1.5,0,1)*.7+(heldAction()?.3:0);instruction='Press at the bottom of the bounce; hold to tuck.';}\n      else if(round.id==='finale') {if(time<16){instruction=(time%8)<4?'Breathe in · hold Action':'Breathe out · release Action';quality=(heldAction()===((time%8)<4))?1:.2;}else if(time<36){targetX=Math.sin(time*.5)*.5;quality=clamp(1-Math.abs(center.x-targetX),0,1);instruction='Follow the pose through the breeze.';}else if(time<48){quality=clamp(round.steps/Math.max(1,(time-36)/.625),0,1);instruction='Step with the island marching band.';}else if(time<60){quality*=heldAction()?1:.3;instruction='Brace against the waves. Hold Action.';}else{instruction=time>75?'Press Action to skip? Or simply stay.':'The Long Stillness. Do nothing.';quality=round.stillBroken?.2:1;}}\n      round.sum+=quality;round.samples++;\n    }\n    const dot=document.getElementById('dot'), target=document.getElementById('target');\n    if(dot){dot.style.transform=`translate(${center.x*43}px,${center.y*43}px)`;dot.style.opacity=state.screen==='check'&&round.phase===2?'0':'1';}\n    if(target){target.style.transform=`translate(${targetX*43}px,${targetY*43}px)`;target.style.opacity=state.screen==='check'&&round.phase===2?'0':'1';}\n    const timer=document.getElementById('timer'), subtitle=document.getElementById('round-subtitle'), phase=document.getElementById('phase-card'), score=document.getElementById('round-score'), fill=document.getElementById('meter-fill');\n    if(timer)timer.textContent=Math.max(0,Math.ceil(round.length-time))+'s';if(subtitle)subtitle.textContent=instruction;if(phase)phase.textContent=instruction;if(score)score.textContent=state.screen==='check'?['STILL','LEAN','LISTEN','STEP'][round.phase]:formatScore(round.sum/Math.max(1,round.samples)*1000);if(fill)fill.style.width=clamp(time/round.length*100,0,100)+'%';\n    if(state.together?.online && hub && time-lastHubUpdate>.1){lastHubUpdate=time;hub.send({event:state.together.event,x:center.x,y:center.y,progress:time/round.length},{reliable:false});}\n    if(state.together?.online && hub && time-lastHubProgress>=2){lastHubProgress=time;hub.progress({score:state.together.scores[0]+Math.round(clamp(round.sum/Math.max(round.samples,1),0,1)*1000),label:round.name});}\n    if(time>=round.length) { if(state.screen==='check')finishCheck();else finishRound(); }\n  }\n\n{\n  \"sourceInformation\": {\"date\": \"\", \"source\": \"\", \"plan\": \"\", \"genre\": \"\", \"perspective\": \"\", \"tech\": \"\", \"artDirection\": \"\", \"animation\": \"\", \"audio\": \"\", \"online\": \"\", \"testing\": \"\", \"research\": \"\", \"environment\": \"\", \"model\": \"\", \"usage\": \"added on import\"},\n  \"testingFeedback\": [\"your answer to each Testing Feedback question, in order\"],\n  \"engineFeedback\": [\"your answer to each Engine Feedback question, in order\"],\n  \"promptFeedback\": [\"your answer to each Prompt Feedback question, in order\"],\n  \"aiHub\": {\n    \"name\": \"the game's title, as on its title screen\",\n    \"tagline\": \"a few words to go under the title\",\n    \"description\": \"one or two sentences for the catalogue\",\n    \"type\": \"Game, Tech demo or Tool\",\n    \"genre\": \"one of Action, Adventure, Fighting, Flight, Horror, Kids & Learning, Life Sim, Platformer, Puzzle, Racing, RPG, Shooter, Simulation, Sports, Stealth, Strategy\",\n    \"source\": \"the work it's based on, e.g. Moby-Dick\",\n    \"series\": \"its franchise, e.g. Star Fox, or empty\",\n    \"players\": \"how many can play: 1, 1–2 or 1–4\",\n    \"controls\": \"the controls, in one line\",\n    \"tags\": [\"3 to 6 lowercase tags, e.g. 2d, 3d, arcade, story, co-op, versus, first-person, third-person, top-down, side-scrolling, pixel art, low-poly, retro, sci-fi, fantasy, comedy, vehicles, boss fights, exploration\"]\n  }\n}\nThe catalogue's model, effort, CLI, date and usage come from the run's record after you finish, so they aren't asked here.\n\nTesting Feedback\n\n- How many issues did testing catch?\n- How many would be considered critical issues / game breaking?\n- What was the most helpful test you ran?\n- What was the least helpful test you ran?\n\nEngine Feedback\n\n- What did you like most about the engine?\n- Did you get stuck or guess wrong?\n- What was the most important thing you had to build yourself?\n- What was the hardest part about using the engine?\n- What did you change in the engine, and why? (none if nothing)\n- If you could change one thing about the engine, what would it be?\n\nPrompt Feedback\n\n- What did you like most about this prompt?\n- What was confusing?\n- What was the hardest thing to do?\n- What would you change in this prompt?\nimport json\nimport os\nimport sys\nimport threading\nimport traceback\nfrom functools import partial\nfrom http.server import SimpleHTTPRequestHandler, ThreadingHTTPServer\nfrom pathlib import Path\nfrom urllib.parse import urlencode\n\nfrom playwright.sync_api import sync_playwright\n\n\nDEV = Path(__file__).resolve().parent.parent\nROOT = DEV.parent\nHTML = ROOT / f\"{DEV.name}.html\"\nARTIFACTS = DEV / \"tests\" / \"artifacts\"\nfailures = []\nchecks = 0\n\n\ndef test(name, function):\n    global checks\n    checks += 1\n    try:\n        function()\n    except Exception:\n        failures.append(f\"{name}:\\n{traceback.format_exc()}\")\n\n\ndef status(page):\n    return json.loads(page.evaluate(\"window.__gameStatus()\"))\n\n\ndef click(page, action):\n    page.locator(f'[data-action=\"{action}\"]').first.click(timeout=5000)\n\n\ndef advance(page):\n    page.evaluate(\"window.__testAdvance(200)\")\n    assert status(page)[\"scene\"] == \"result\", status(page)\n\n\ndef load(browser, **kwargs):\n    context = browser.new_context(**kwargs)\n    page = context.new_page()\n    errors = []\n    page.on(\"pageerror\", lambda error: errors.append(str(error)))\n    page.goto(HTML.as_uri() + \"?test=1\", wait_until=\"domcontentloaded\")\n    page.wait_for_function(\"window.__gameBoot?.ready === true\")\n    return context, page, errors\n\n\ndef new_guest(page):\n    click(page, \"slots-new\")\n    click(page, \"slot:0\")\n    page.locator(\"#guest-name\").select_option(label=\"Ari\")\n    click(page, \"skin:2\")\n    click(page, \"outfit:3\")\n    click(page, \"create-guest\")\n    click(page, \"island\")\n    assert status(page)[\"guest\"] == \"Ari\"\n\n\ndef browser_tests(playwright):\n    for engine in (\"chromium\", \"firefox\", \"webkit\"):\n        browser = getattr(playwright, engine).launch(headless=True)\n\n        def smoke():\n            context, page, errors = load(browser, viewport={\"width\": 1280, \"height\": 800})\n            assert \"Wii Fit\" in page.title()\n            click(page, \"about\")\n            assert \"Source Information\" in page.locator(\"#app\").inner_text()\n            assert \"Library credits\" in page.locator(\"#app\").inner_text()\n            page.locator(\".licenses summary\").click()\n            assert \"SIL OPEN FONT LICENSE\" in page.locator(\".licenses\").inner_text()\n            click(page, \"title\")\n            new_guest(page)\n            click(page, \"check\")\n            click(page, \"begin-check\")\n            page.keyboard.press(\"Escape\")\n            assert status(page)[\"paused\"]\n            page.keyboard.press(\"Escape\")\n            advance(page)\n            click(page, \"result-next\")\n            assert status(page)[\"checked\"]\n            click(page, \"intro:breath\")\n            click(page, \"begin-event\")\n            page.keyboard.press(\"Space\")\n            advance(page)\n            assert status(page)[\"minutes\"] == 1 + status(page)[\"resultStars\"]\n            click(page, \"result-next\")\n            page.screenshot(path=str(ARTIFACTS / f\"{engine}-island.png\"))\n            assert not errors, errors\n            context.close()\n\n        test(f\"{engine} guest, check and activity\", smoke)\n        browser.close()\n\n    browser = playwright.chromium.launch(headless=True)\n\n    def stay():\n        context, page, errors = load(browser, viewport={\"width\": 1280, \"height\": 800})\n        new_guest(page)\n        for day, goal in enumerate((3, 5, 7, 9, 0), 1):\n            assert status(page)[\"day\"] == day\n            click(page, \"check\")\n            click(page, \"begin-check\")\n            advance(page)\n            click(page, \"result-next\")\n            for _ in range(goal if day < 5 else 1):\n                if day < 5 and status(page)[\"minutes\"] >= goal:\n                    break\n                click(page, \"intro:finale\" if day == 5 else \"intro:breath\")\n                click(page, \"begin-event\")\n                advance(page)\n                click(page, \"result-next\")\n            click(page, \"end-day\")\n            click(page, \"sleep\")\n        assert status(page)[\"scene\"] == \"ending\"\n        click(page, \"free-play\")\n        assert status(page)[\"scene\"] == \"island\"\n        page.reload(wait_until=\"domcontentloaded\")\n        page.wait_for_function(\"window.__gameBoot?.ready === true\")\n        click(page, \"slots-continue\")\n        click(page, \"slot:0\")\n        assert status(page)[\"guest\"] == \"Ari\" and status(page)[\"day\"] == 5\n        assert not errors, errors\n        context.close()\n\n    test(\"five-day stay, ending and save persistence\", stay)\n\n    def minute_rewards():\n        context, page, errors = load(browser)\n        new_guest(page)\n        click(page, \"check\")\n        click(page, \"begin-check\")\n        advance(page)\n        click(page, \"result-next\")\n        for attempt in range(2):\n            before = status(page)[\"minutes\"]\n            click(page, \"intro:breath\")\n            click(page, \"begin-event\")\n            advance(page)\n            earned = status(page)[\"minutes\"] - before\n            assert earned == (1 + status(page)[\"resultStars\"] if attempt == 0 else 1)\n            click(page, \"result-next\")\n        while status(page)[\"minutes\"] < 3:\n            click(page, \"intro:breath\")\n            click(page, \"begin-event\")\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
