{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_574","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"apply_patch <<'PATCH'\n*** Begin Patch\n*** Update File: PROGRESS.md\n@@\n-- The browser suite passed 13 checks, including three engines, the five-day stay, rewards, save persistence, pause controls, the local medley, and 2–4-player AI Hub runs. Two Rust balance-spring tests passed.\n+- The final browser suite passed 13 checks, including three engines, the five-day stay, rewards, save persistence, pause controls, the local medley, and 2–4-player AI Hub runs. Two Rust balance-spring tests passed.\n@@\n-- First-clear and repeat minute rewards follow the plan. The exit interview and development README document the current result.\n+- First-clear and repeat minute rewards follow the plan. The exit interview, in-game About screen, asset credits and development README document the current result.\n@@\n-- Next: re-bundle the completed interview, rerun the final browser suite, inspect a 1920×1080 frame, and remove engine build caches.\n+- The interview is embedded in the standalone HTML, the 1920×1080 frame has been inspected, and engine build caches have been removed. A full rebuild will recompile the engine.\n+- Remaining work: replace the Canvas 2D/JavaScript prototype with the planned engine-native 3D simulation, implement the full individual event mechanics and missing island systems, and resolve or verify the WebGPU device-loss issue on the intended platform.\n*** End Patch\nPATCH\npython3 - <<'PY'\nimport json\nfrom pathlib import Path\nroot=Path('.')\ndev=root/'Wii Fit Together-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-222701'\nhtml=root/'Wii Fit Together-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-222701.html'\ninfo=json.loads((root/'exit-interview.json').read_text())\npage=html.read_text()\nassert info['aiHub']['name']=='Wii Fit Together'\nassert info['sourceInformation']['usage']=='added on import'\nassert (dev/'hub/session.js').read_text() in page\nassert 'about-data' in page and 'Wii Fit Together' in page\nassert not (dev/'engine/target').exists()\nprint(f'Package verified: {html.name}, {html.stat().st_size:,} bytes; exit interview parses; hub client embedded; build cache removed.')\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
