and 'Wii Fit Together' in page\nassert not (dev/'engine/target').exists()\nprint(f'Package verified: {html.name}, {html.stat().st_size:,} bytes; exit interview parses; hub client embedded; build cache removed.')\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"Success. Updated the following files:\nM PROGRESS.md\nPackage verified: Wii Fit Together-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-222701.html, 11,444,695 bytes; exit interview parses; hub client embedded; build cache removed.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
